Lens Support Recommended. The 35mm is still relatively large at 3.75 lbs. and 7 inches long, so you might want to rent a Wooden Camera 15mm Universal Lens Support to help support the lens’s weight when using a shoulder mount (not included) or other 15mm rail system.', 20600000.0, '{"Angle of View": "Diagonal\\nARRI LF Open Gate: 65.2°\\n\\nHorizontal\\nARRI LF Open Gate: 55.4°", "Aperture Blades": "11", "Brand": "ARRI", "Electronic Communication": "Yes", "Focus Scales": "Imperial", "Front Lens Diameter": "114mm", "Gear Mod and Pitch": "Focus: 0.8 MOD / 32 Pitch\\nIris: 0.8 MOD / 32 Pitch\\nZoom: 0.8 MOD / 32 Pitch", "Height": "4.5\\"", "Image Circle": "44.7mm", "Item Type": "Lens", "Length": "7.0\\"", "Lens Mount": "LPL", "Lens Type": "Standard", "Maximum Magnification": "1:5.4", "Mfr. Model Number": "KK.0019099", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "1.1’", "Width": "4.5\\""}', 'Includes

