Power and Memory. You can power the ALEXA 35 via the included ARRI B-Mount battery adapter or by separately available batteries. The B-Mount system can power both 12 and 24V accessories, which saves you weight and space when you’d otherwise need to use two separate battery types. The ALEXA 35 offers MFX/ARRIRAW and MFX/ProRes capture to 1 or 2TB Codex Compact drives with resolutions up to 4.6K and frame rates up to 120p.

Displays, Interfaces, and Connections. The ALEXA 35’s left-side display lets you view camera status and adjust settings without an EVF attached, making it ideal for use with stabilizers, drones, and cranes. You can even select a simulated ND filter so that the display gives you a quick visual reminder for any stop compensation you may need. The right-hand side of the ALEXA 35 includes a second EVF port; two 1.5/3/6/12G-SDI outputs, one of which has a return option; timecode in/out; and 12 and 24V accessory output ports. There’s an Ethernet port for real-time metadata streaming in mixed-reality productions. On the audio front, you get two internal mics, one 6-pin LEMO input, one 3.5mm headphone jack, embedded SDI audio, and compatibility with the AEM-1 audio module.', 108175000.0, '{"Brand": "ARRI", "Camera Mount": "LPL", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Compatible Media": "Compact Drive", "Display": "Size4\\"Resolution800 × 400Display TypeIncluded External LCDSecondary DisplaySide: LCD Status Display", "Environmental": "Operating Temperature-4 to 113°FStorage Temperature-22 to 158°F", "External Video Capture": "External Recording ModesNoneIP StreamingNone", "General": "Power Consumption90 WTripod Mounting Thread1/4\\"-20 Female3/8\\"-16 FemaleMaterialAluminumDimensions (W x H x D)8 × 6 × 5.8″Weight6.4 lbs.", "Interface": "Media/Memory Card SlotSingle Slot: Codex Compact DriveVideo I/O1x BNC (12G-SDI) Output1x BNC (12G-SDI) Input/OutputAudio I/O1x LEMO 6-Pin Line Input1x 1/8\\" / 3.5 mm TRRS Headphone/Mic Headphone OutputPower I/O1x LEMO 8-Pin (20.5 to 33.6 VDC) InputOther I/O2x CoaXPress Viewfinder1x LEMO 4-Pin Control Input/Output1x LEMO 4-Pin (Serial) Data Input/Output1x LEMO 5-Pin (Timecode) Input/Output1x LEMO 10-Pin (Ethernet) Control1x BNC (Sync) Input/Output1x USB Type-C Data Input/Output1x Pogo 5-Pin1x Pogo 18-PinWirelessWi-Fi (802.11b/g) ControlGlobal Positioning (GPS, GLONASS, etc.)None", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Frame Rate": "120", "Maximum Video Resolution": "4K", "Mfr. Model Number": "K0.0041725", "Screen Type": "Fixed", "Sensor": "Super 35 format ARRI ALEV 4 CMOS sensor with Bayer pattern color filter array4608 × 316427.99 × 19.22 mm / 1.102x 0.757\\"Ø 33.96 mm / 1.337\\"", "Sensor Size": "Super35", "Stabilization": "No", "Supported Formats": "ARRIRAW4.6K 3:2 Open Gate: 35 / 75 fps4.6K 16:9 – 4.6K: 45 / 75 fps4K 16:9 – 4K: 55 / 120 fps4K 2:1 – 4K: 65 / 120 fps3.3K 6:5 – 3.3K: 55 / 100 fps3K 1:1 – 3K: 55 / 100 fps Apple ProRes4.6K 3:2 Open Gate: 60 / 60 fps4.6K 16:9 – 4K: 75 / 75 fps4K 16:9 – 4K: 100 / 100 fps4K 16:9 – UHD: 120 / 120 fps4K 16:9 – 2K: 120 / 120 fps4K 16:9 – HD: 120 / 120 fps4K 2:1 – 4K: 120 / 120 fps3.3K 6:5 – 3.3K: 75 / 75 fps3.3K 6:5 – 4K 2.39:1 Ana. 2x: 90 / 90 fps3K 1:1 – 3K: 90 / 90 fps3K 1:1 – 3.8K 2:1 Ana. 2x: 100 / 100 fps2.7K 8:9 – UHD 16:9 Ana. 2x: 100 / 100fps2K 16:9 S16 – 2K: 120 / 120 fps", "Viewfinder": "TypeRemovable Electronic (OLED)Resolution1920 × 1080Diopter Adjustment-5 to +5Focus TypeManual Focus Only", "Viewfinder Type": "Electronic", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi"}', 'Includes

	ARRI ALEXA 35
	ARRI MVF-2 viewfinder
	ARRI LPL lens mount
