INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (32, 1, 3, 'ARRI ALEXA 35 Production Set (19mm Studio)', 'arri-alexa-35-production-set-19mm-studio', 'The ARRI ALEXA 35 Production Set (19mm Studio) combines the powerful, studio-specced ARRI ALEXA 35 camera with a host of accessories, including a viewfinder, an LPL mount, a PL-to-LPL adapter, and a cage-type set with 19mm supports. Key features include:

4.6K Super35 ARRI ALEV 4 CMOS sensor
Up to 4.6K 4608 × 3164; 19mm support set included
19 ARRIRAW and Apple ProRes recording formats
Netflix approved camera

Production Set with 19mm Supports. The ARRI ALEXA 35 Production Set (19mm Studio) is based around the studio-grade 4K ARRI ALEXA 35 camera, which features greater dynamic range, contrast, sensitivity, contrast, and color reproduction than its predecessors. In addition to the ALEXA 35 itself, this kit includes the MVF-2 electronic viewfinder, an EVF support, an LPL mount, a PL-to-LPL lens adapter, a PDM-1 Power Distribution Module, a top handle, a bridge-plate adapter, a B-mount battery plate, side brackets, a baseplate, and a dovetail. You also get a cage-type set with 15mm LWS and 19mm studio rod setups for additional support.

4.6K Super35 ARRI ALEV4 Sensor. The ARRI ALEXA 35’s 4.6K Super 35 CMOS sensor gives you 17 stops of dynamic range—2.5 stops more than previous ARRI cameras. Those 2.5 stops are broken up between 1.5 stops at the top end to give you highlight roll-off for a film-like look, and 1 stop at the lower end to give you deeper shadows without overexposing the rest of the shot. This sensor affords you a wide dynamic range that’s perfect for backlit setups and for image editing in post.

Pro-Grade Video Capabilities. The ALEXA 35’s in-camera downsampling and anamorphic de-squeezing allow for nineteen ARRIRAW and Apple ProRes recording formats with a broad range of different resolutions, data rates, aspect ratios, and other features, making it suitable for an array of production styles. You get 4.6, 4, 3.3, 3, 2.7, and 2K recording resolutions.

REVEAL Color Science. ARRI’s advanced REVEAL color science system gives your images substantially improved color, contrast, sensitivity, and dynamic range when compared to previous ALEXA cameras. The new debayering algorithm helps create cleaner-edged images that are ideal for compositing. The ACE4 color engine converts RGB image data to the ARRI Wide Gamut color space (AWG4), improving color accuracy, saturation, and tracking, even with subtle tones and low light. System-specific LUTs, which must be used with the Log-C 4 tonal curve, produce superlative shadow tonality and color fidelity, in addition to an optimal color-grading base.

Backward Compatibility. The REVEAL system lets you process footage shot on your ALEXA, ALEXA LF, ALEXA Mini, ALEXA Mini LF, and AMIRA to match footage shot on your ALEXA 35 so that you can intercut among all of it without a noticeable change in quality. While processed images won’t have the same dynamic range or ARRI Textures as your native ALEXA 35 images, they will have cleaner edges; improved color; easier grading; and ACES, Log-C 4, and new LUT compatibility.

Extensive Lens Compatibility. This kit includes an LPL mount and a PL-to-LPL adapter, providing compatibility with a considerable range of cine-style lenses. Additional lens mounts are available as separate rental items, and those will further broaden your selection. The ALEXA 35 is compatible with all common metadata standards and can stream metadata in real time with an optional plugin.

Power and Memory. You can power the ALEXA 35 via the included ARRI B-Mount battery adapter or by separately available batteries. The B-Mount system can power both 12 and 24V accessories, which saves you weight and space when you’d otherwise need to use two separate battery types. The ALEXA 35 offers MFX/ARRIRAW and MFX/ProRes capture to 1 or 2TB Codex Compact drives with resolutions up to 4.6K and frame rates up to 120p.

Displays, Interfaces, and Connections. The ALEXA 35’s left-side display lets you view camera status and adjust settings without an EVF attached, making it ideal for use with stabilizers, drones, and cranes. You can even select a simulated ND filter so that the display gives you a quick visual reminder for any stop compensation you may need. The right-hand side of the ALEXA 35 includes a second EVF port; two 1.5/3/6/12G-SDI outputs, one of which has a return option; timecode in/out; and 12 and 24V accessory output ports. There’s an Ethernet port for real-time metadata streaming in mixed-reality productions. On the audio front, you get two internal mics, one 6-pin LEMO input, one 3.5mm headphone jack, embedded SDI audio, and compatibility with the AEM-1 audio module.', 110350000.0, '{"Brand": "ARRI", "Camera Mount": "LPL", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Compatible Media": "Compact Drive", "Display": "Size4\\"Resolution800 × 400Display TypeIncluded External LCDSecondary DisplaySide: LCD Status Display", "Environmental": "Operating Temperature-4 to 113°FStorage Temperature-22 to 158°F", "External Video Capture": "External Recording ModesNoneIP StreamingNone", "General": "Power Consumption90 WTripod Mounting Thread1/4\\"-20 Female3/8\\"-16 FemaleMaterialAluminumDimensions (W x H x D)8 × 6 × 5.8″Weight6.4 lbs.", "Interface": "Media/Memory Card SlotSingle Slot: Codex Compact DriveVideo I/O1x BNC (12G-SDI) Output1x BNC (12G-SDI) Input/OutputAudio I/O1x LEMO 6-Pin Line Input1x 1/8\\" / 3.5 mm TRRS Headphone/Mic Headphone OutputPower I/O1x LEMO 8-Pin (20.5 to 33.6 VDC) InputOther I/O2x CoaXPress Viewfinder1x LEMO 4-Pin Control Input/Output1x LEMO 4-Pin (Serial) Data Input/Output1x LEMO 5-Pin (Timecode) Input/Output1x LEMO 10-Pin (Ethernet) Control1x BNC (Sync) Input/Output1x USB Type-C Data Input/Output1x Pogo 5-Pin1x Pogo 18-PinWirelessWi-Fi (802.11b/g) ControlGlobal Positioning (GPS, GLONASS, etc.)None", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Frame Rate": "120", "Maximum Video Resolution": "4K", "Mfr. Model Number": "K0.0041726", "Screen Type": "Fixed", "Sensor": "Super 35 format ARRI ALEV 4 CMOS sensor with Bayer pattern color filter array4608 × 316427.99 × 19.22 mm / 1.102x 0.757\\"Ø 33.96 mm / 1.337\\"", "Sensor Size": "Super35", "Stabilization": "No", "Supported Formats": "ARRIRAW4.6K 3:2 Open Gate: 35 / 75 fps4.6K 16:9 – 4.6K: 45 / 75 fps4K 16:9 – 4K: 55 / 120 fps4K 2:1 – 4K: 65 / 120 fps3.3K 6:5 – 3.3K: 55 / 100 fps3K 1:1 – 3K: 55 / 100 fps Apple ProRes4.6K 3:2 Open Gate: 60 / 60 fps4.6K 16:9 – 4K: 75 / 75 fps4K 16:9 – 4K: 100 / 100 fps4K 16:9 – UHD: 120 / 120 fps4K 16:9 – 2K: 120 / 120 fps4K 16:9 – HD: 120 / 120 fps4K 2:1 – 4K: 120 / 120 fps3.3K 6:5 – 3.3K: 75 / 75 fps3.3K 6:5 – 4K 2.39:1 Ana. 2x: 90 / 90 fps3K 1:1 – 3K: 90 / 90 fps3K 1:1 – 3.8K 2:1 Ana. 2x: 100 / 100 fps2.7K 8:9 – UHD 16:9 Ana. 2x: 100 / 100fps2K 16:9 S16 – 2K: 120 / 120 fps", "Viewfinder": "TypeRemovable Electronic (OLED)Resolution1920 × 1080Diopter Adjustment-5 to +5Focus TypeManual Focus Only", "Viewfinder Type": "Electronic", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi"}', 'Includes

	ARRI ALEXA 35
	ARRI MVF-2 viewfinder
	ARRI LPL lens mount
	ARRI PL-to-LPL adapter
	ARRI B-mount battery plate
	ARRI PDM-1 Power Distribution Module', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (33, 1, 3, 'ARRI ALEXA LF Basic Camera Set (LPL)', 'arri-alexa-lf-basic-camera-set-lpl', 'The ARRI ALEXA LF Basic Camera Set (LPL) is the premium, studio spec’d, and high speed sibling to the ARRI ALEXA Mini LF, capable of recording ProRes to SxS or up to 4.5K ARRIRAW with SXR drives. Key features include:

ALEXA image quality from native-4K sensor
Open Gate ARRIRAW up to 150 fps to SXR
Integrated wireless video transmission system
Netflix approved camera

Premium Large Format.  The ALEXA LF utilizes the ALEV 3 A2X large-format sensor which provides low noise at its native ISO 800, natural skin tones, true colors, and 14+  stops of dynamic range. The camera does not include ND filters but the ARRI ALEXA LF FSND Filter Set can be rented separately.

Basic Camera Set. This rental is only for the ARRI ALEXA LF Body and a few select accessories and will require additional rental items to be a functional camera. This barebones option might be for you if your Alexa is at a repair facility or if you’re looking for a backup camera. At the very least, it’ll need SXR media and an LPL-compatible lens to be operational. This rental does not include a battery plate, and access to AC power will be needed.

Record Up to 4.5K ARRIRAW. ARRIRAW recording is included out of the box and capable of capturing the full, open gate 4448 × 3096 pixel area of the sensor at up to 90 fps to proprietary ARRI SXR Capture Drives. Straight-to-ProRes recording is of course still an option up to 40 fps in open gate mode.

SXR or SxS Media. To use the full recording capabilities of this camera, you’ll want to use ARRI SXR Capture Drives, but ARRI Sony 256GB SxS Pro+ Memory Cards can be used for recording up to UHD 4K/30p in the ProRes 4444 XQ codec. A SxS adapter is included in this rental.', 50050000.0, '{"Brand": "ARRI", "Camera Mount": "LPL", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Frame Rates": "LF Open Gate ProRes 4.5K: 0.75 – 60 fps LF Open Gate ARRIRAW 4.5K: 0.75 – 90 fps LF 16:9 ProRes HD: 0.75 – 60 fps LF 16:9 ProRes 2K: 0.75 – 60 fps LF 16:9 ProRes UHD: 0.75 – 60 fps LF 16:9 ARRIRAW UHD: 0.75 – 90 fps LF 2.39:1 ProRes 4.5K: 0.75 – 100 fps LF 2.39:1 ARRIRAW 4.5K: 0.75 – 150 fps", "Imaging": "Sensor TypeLF ARRI ALEV III (A2X) CMOS (36.70 × 25.54 mm / 1.444 × 1.005″)Maximum Resolution4448 × 3096", "Inputs/Outputs": "LEMO 5pin LTC Timecode In/OutBNC SDI Return In LEMO 16pin EXT (Accessories & Sync) LEMO 10pin Ethernet (RC & sync)(3) Fischer 12pin CLM (lens motors)(2) Fischer 5pin LCS (hand units)", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "4K", "Physical": "Dimensions6.22 × 7.91 × 14.33″ (camera body with LPL lens mount)Weight∼17.2 lbs", "Power Supply": "Power Inputs Fischer 2pin BAT connector (18.5-34 V DC) On-board battery interface (19.5-34 V DC)Power Outputs Fischer 3pin 24V RS LEMO 2pin 12V", "Recording Format": "LF Open Gate ProRes 4.5K: 4480 × 3096LF Open Gate ARRIRAW 4.5K: 4448 × 3096LF 16:9 ProRes HD: 1920 × 1080LF 16:9 ProRes 2K: 2048 × 1152LF 16:9 ProRes UHD: 3840 × 2160LF 16:9 ARRIRAW UHD: 3840 × 2160LF 2.39:1 ProRes 4.5K: 4480 × 1856LF 2.39:1 ARRIRAW 4.5K: 4448 × 1856", "Screen Type": "Fixed", "Sensor Size": "Full-Frame", "Viewfinder Type": "Electronic", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi"}', 'Includes

ARRI ALEXA LF
ARRI Wireless Video Receiver WVR-1 Basic Set
ARRI ALEXA Electronic Viewfinder EVF-2



See Details', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (34, 1, 3, 'ARRI ALEXA Mini Body', 'arri-alexa-mini-body', 'The ARRI ALEXA Mini is a scaled-down version of the ALEXA XT. Its functionality and control make it a worthy main camera. This rental is for the body only. Key features include:

ALEXA-line image quality in a compact, durable form factor
4K (UHD) video capture in a variety of ProRes codecs
Open Gate and ARRIRAW license upgrades installed
Includes stereo audio cable, Wi-Fi antenna, and USB utility drive

Body Only. This rental is only for the ARRI ALEXA Mini Body, which isn’t an operable camera without additional accessories. Here’s a link to our complete kit. This barebones option might be for you if your Alexa is at a repair facility or if you’re looking for a backup camera. At the very least, it’ll need an ARRI lens mount, media, and a lens to be operational.

Shared ALEXA Sensor. The ALEXA Mini utilizes the ALEV III sensor, which provides low noise, natural skin tones, true colors, and fourteen stops of dynamic range and is the same found across the ALEXA line of cinema cameras.

Resolutions Up to 4K (UHD).  Record high-quality 4K (UHD) in a variety of ProRes codecs to readily available CFast 2.0 media.

Internal Neutral-Density Filters. Built-in ND filtration at two-, four-, and seven-stop increments.

Sized for Motion. Designed for versatile use on gimbals and other applications where compact size and scale are required.

Lookup Tables. Pre-programmed Rec 709, and Log C color outputs as well as the ability for user-uploaded looks.

Intuitive Controls. Uses the same interface as the rest of the ALEXA line. It’s a design so intuitive that other brands keep copying it.

Durable and Reliable. With a housing built from carbon fiber and manufactured for the most rugged of applications, the ALEXA Mini proudly upholds the Arri’s tradition of stable cameras that can be counted on for any shoot.

Wi-Fi Control. You can remotely control the ALEXA Mini with a tablet or other compatible device over an ad-hoc Wi-Fi network.', 26125000.0, '{"Brand": "ARRI", "Camera Mount": "Canon EF, LPL, and PL", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Codec / Format Support": "ProRes 4444XQ, 4444, 422(HQ), 422, 422(LT) MXF/ARRIRAW", "Compatible Media": "CFast", "Dimensions": "Length: 185 mm/7.3\\" \\nWidth: 125 mm/4.9\\" \\nHeight: 140 mm/5.5\\"", "Frame Rates": "16:9\\n ProRes HD 0.75 – 200 fps\\n ProRes S16 HD 0.75 – 200 fps\\n ProRes 2K 0.75 – 200 fps\\n ProRes 3.2K 0.75 – 60 fps\\n ProRes UHD 0.75 – 60 fps\\n MFX/ARRIRAW 16:9 2.8K 0.75 – 48 fps\\n\\n 4:3\\n ProRes 4:3 2.8K 0.75 – 50 fps\\n\\n 6:5*\\n ProRes 2:39:1 2K Ana. 0.75 – 120 fps\\n\\n 8:9**\\n ProRes HD Ana. 0.75 – 120 fps\\n\\n Open Gate\\n MFX/ARRIRAW 3.4K Open Gate 0.75 – 30 fps\\n * 4:3 cropped\\n ** Center crop from anamorphic\\n (1) Minimum frame rate is always 0.75 fps\\n (2) The recording resolution determines the number of horizontal pixels that will be recorded (the number of vertical pixels is dependent on the recording file type and sensor mode)", "Inputs/Outputs": "Additional Inputs/Outputs          SDI-Genlock; timecode (in and output)", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Frame Rate": "200", "Maximum Video Resolution": "4K", "ND Filters": "Built-in motorized ND filters 0.6, 1.2, 2.1", "Power Input": "Lemo 8-pin, 10.5-34 V DC", "Recording Formats": "ProRes:\\n 4:3 2.8K: 2880 × 2160 up to 50 fps (padded to 2944 × 2160)\\n 4K UHD: 3840 × 2160 (up-sampled from 3.2K)\\n 3.2K: 3200 × 1800\\n 2K Cine 16:9: 2048 × 1152\\n HD: 1920 × 1080\\n S16 HD: 1920 × 1080 (up-sampled from 1600 × 900)\\n\\n Anamorphic ProRes: (with 2x in-camera de-squeeze)\\n 2.39:1 2K Anamorphic: 2048 × 858\\n HD Anamorphic: 1920 × 1080\\n\\n MXF/ARRIRAW:\\n (in-camera recording to MXF-wrapped ARRIRAW files)\\n Open Gate: 3424 × 2202\\n 2.8K 16:9: 2880 × 1620\\n\\n MXF/ARRIRAW Open Gate: (with active image area matching 4:3 ProRes modes)\\n 4:3 2.8K (OG 3.4K): 2880 × 2160 (recording in open-gate 3.4K)\\n 2.39:1 Anamorphic (OG 3.4K): 2560 × 2145 (recording in open-gate 3.4K)\\n 16:9 HD Anamorphic (OG 3.4K): 1920 × 2160 (recording in open-gate 3.4K)", "Sensor": "35 mm format ARRI ALEV III CMOS with Bayer pattern color filter array", "Sensor Size": "Super35", "Stabilization": "No", "Video Output": "2x HD-SDI out 1.5G and 3G: uncompressed HD video with embedded audio and metadata, SDI-6G interface to external CODEX recorder", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "5.0 lb.", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi"}', 'Includes

	ARRI ALEXA Mini Body
	Wi-Fi Antenna
	LEMO to XLR audio cable
	AC adapter
	USB flash drive', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (35, 1, 3, 'ARRI ALEXA Mini Gimbal-Ready Kit for DJI Ronin 2 (EF)', 'arri-alexa-mini-gimbal-ready-kit-for-dji-ronin-2-ef', 'Our ARRI ALEXA Mini Gimbal-Ready Kit for DJI Ronin 2 (EF) has been customized for DJI Ronin 2 operators and designed to take the time and guesswork out of building a complete Alexa Mini camera package that will feel right at home on your gimbal. This kit is centered around the ARRI ALEXA Mini and offers the best of ARRI’s off-tripod accessories needed to mount, power, and interface with the camera in a one-click, EF-mount compatible kit solution that still allows you the freedom to choose your own lenses and media. Click on any of the package items below for more information.

