Compatibility. This lens’s 36.7mm x 25.5mm imaging area covers full-frame, 16:9, 3:2, and 4:3 sensors with easy delivery to 2:1, 2.25:1, 2.66:1, and 2.4:1. If you have questions regarding sensor coverage, please contact us and a tech will be happy to help you determine whether this lens is right for your shoot.

Full-Frame 1.5x Anamorphic. This lens’s 1.5x optical design gives you many of the popular visual characteristics found in the traditional 2x cinemascope format—including oblong oval bokeh, barrel distortion, and shallow depth of field—while keeping its build comparatively compact and lightweight.', 11225000.0, '{"Anamorphic Squeeze": "1.5x", "Angle of View": "42º", "Aperture Blades": "14", "Brand": "Atlas", "Dimensions": "3.7 × 6.4″ (ø x L)", "Filter Type": "Matte Box Mount", "Focal Length": "72-72", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Front Lens Diameter": "95mm", "Gearing": "0.8 MOD focus, iris", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "PL", "Lens Type": "Anamorphic, Telephoto, Cine, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.2", "Mfr. Model Number": "MERC-0072-300S", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "3’", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "3.6 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

