Compatibility. While this lens is designed for Super35 sensor type cameras, the 31mm image circle may not provide full sensor coverage on all S35 cameras, depending on your recording format. If you have questions regarding sensor coverage, please contact us and a tech will be happy to help you determine whether this lens is right for your shoot.', 12725000.0, '{"Anamorphic Squeeze": "2x", "Angle of View": "55º", "Aperture Blades": "14", "Brand": "Atlas", "Dimensions": "4.5 × 7″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "105.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On and Matte Box Mount", "Focal Length": "50-50", "Focus Rotation": "270º", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Front Lens Diameter": "114mm", "Gearing": "0.8 MOD focus, iris", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "APS-C and Super16", "Lens Mount": "PL", "Lens Type": "Standard, Anamorphic, Cine, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.0", "Mfr. Model Number": "N050SEI", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "2.5’", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "5.0 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

