to 120 fps", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "6K", "Monitor": "Display TypeTilting Touchscreen LCD Display Size5\\" Resolution1920 × 1080 TypeOptional, Not Included", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Tilt", "Sensor Size": "Full-Frame", "Stabilization": "No", "Video Capture": "External Recording ModesNo Fast-/Slow-Motion SupportYes Broadcast OutputNTSC/PAL Built-In Microphone TypeStereo IP StreamingNo", "Viewfinder Type": "Electronic", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Wireless Connectivity": "Bluetooth"}', 'Includes

