	Pearstone USB 3.2 Gen 2 Type-C Female to Type-A Male Adapter', 13125000.0, '{"Brand": "Blackmagic", "Camera Mount": "PL", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Compatible Media": "CFexpress Type B", "Imaging": "ISODynamic Range: 13 stopsISO Range: Dual gain 400/3,200 (25,600 expanded)Max Resolution6K (6048 × 4032)ND FiltersNoSensor24.6MP Full Frame CMOSShutterElectronic rollingStabilizationNo", "Inputs/Outputs": "Audio I/O1x 3.5mm headphone jack1x 3.5mm mic jack1x 3-pin mini-XLR mic/line (+48V phantom power)Other I/O1x USB-C (data)1x BNC (ref/TC)1x EthernetPower I/O1x 2-pin LEMO (12V DC)1x BP-U battery portStorage I/O2x CFexpress Type B slots1x SSD with URSA Mini Recorder (not included)Video I/O1x BNC (12G-SDI)", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "6K", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Fixed", "Sensor Size": "Full-Frame", "Stabilization": "No", "Video Capture": "Shooting Resolutions, Blackmagic RAW6048 × 4032 (Open Gate 3:2) up to 36 fps4832 × 4032 (Anamorphic 6:5) up to 36 fps6048 × 3408 (6K 16:9) up to 46 fps6048 × 3200 (6K DCI 17:9) up to 48 fps6048 × 2520 (6K 2.4:1) up to 60 fps4096 × 3072 (Super 35 4:3) up to 50 fps4096 × 2304 (4K 16:9) up to 60 fps4096 × 2160 (4K DCI 17:9) up to 60 fps2112 × 1184 (Super 16 16:9) up to 100 fps1920 × 1080 (1080 HD 16:9) up to 120 fps", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Wireless Connectivity": "Bluetooth"}', 'Includes

