INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (176, 1, 8, 'Blackmagic Design URSA Cine 12K LF (Body Only)', 'blackmagic-design-ursa-cine-12k-lf-body-only', 'The Blackmagic Design URSA Cine 12K LF (Body Only) is a full-frame cinema camera capable of Blackmagic RAW capture up to 12K 3:2 open gate. Key features include:

Large format full-frame 12K sensor
12G-SDI output; USB-C expansion ports
Built-in folding 5-inch monitor
Netflix approved camera

Revolutionary 12K Sensor. The Blackmagic Design URSA Cine 12K LF (Body Only) sports a stellar new sensor designed to capture cinema-quality imaging at all resolutions from 4K to 12K. Building on the technology of the URSA Mini Pro 12K, this sensor provides larger photo-sites that lead to 16 stops of dynamic range. At all resolutions, this camera delivers rich, quality colors thanks to its unique RGBW architecture.

Format Friendly. The URSA Cine’s large-format sensor creates a flexible environment for aspect ratios, lenses, and delivery formats. With a stunning 3:2 open gate image, you can easily reframe your shots in post-production. There’s plenty of benefits to this redesigned sensor, including the ability to shoot in 4K, 8K, or 12K using the entire sensor without cropping and retaining the full field-of-view. You can even shoot with classic cinema lenses using one of the three available 9K Super 35 modes!

Monitoring and Camera Control. To monitor your productions, the URSA Cine sports a fold-out monitor with a 5-inch touchscreen on one side and an external color status LCD on the other. With the dedicated assist station located on the right-side of the camera, you have access to another 5-inch HDR touchscreen that helps prevent the need for external monitors.

Inputs and Outputs. To meet the demands of high-end productions, the URSA Cine is packed out with connections all around. You’re provided with 7-pin LEMO and 3-pin Fischer connectors for record start/stop, a standard 24V 8-pin LEMO connector for camera power, and an additional 2-pin LEMO 12V connection to power lower-voltage accessories. For external monitoring, you have access to two 12G-SDI outputs, plus a 10G Ethernet connection for syncing to Blackmagic Cloud media.

Built-In Filters. For those moments you’re in need of light reduction and minimized interference, this camera has built-in OLPF and ND filters. The integrated OLPF is precisely matched to that stellar sensor we’ve chatted about, and is designed to minimize the interference that comes along with shooting materials and fabrics. The three integrated ND filters are available to you in reductions of 2-, 4- and 6-stops. Even in the harshest of lighting, these filters can save the day of production.

Internal Recording Available. This URSA Cine is the first digital film camera that comes equipped with the ultra-fast Blackmagic Media Module to internally store up to 8TB of footage! This storage solution allows you to record at the highest resolutions and frame rates for hours, and even access your files over 10G Ethernet. If you’re using several URSA Cine cameras with the modules, you can add up to three of them to the separately available Blackmagic Design Media Dock to gain access to more files at once, speeding up post-production and turnaround times.

Wireless Capabilities and Streaming. Like most cameras of this generation, the URSA Cine is capable of WiFi and 10G Ethernet connections. With a built-in hardware engine that supports RTMP and SRT streaming, the URSA Cine can stream directly to clients or major streaming platforms. While live streaming, you can use the USB-C port to connect an Apple or Android device to gain internet connection!

Blackmagic OS. Equipped with Blackmagic OS, the URSA Cine is an intuitive device with user-friendly controls. This operating system allows each of the camera’s features run independently, resulting in smoother control of the camera. With this interface, you’ll tap and swipe to adjust settings and features. All advanced features, like on-screen focus and exposure tools, HDR, metadata entry, and Blackmagic RAW settings, can be accessed and controlled with ease!

Power Supply. The included Blackmagic Design Power Supply for URSA Cine is an alternative power bank for the Blackmagic URSA Cine camera. This power cable is capable of outputting 24V, 250W power to the camera through its 8-pin LEMO connector.

Lens Mounts Available. Although this rental will not include a lens mount, we do have the dedicated EF, PL, and LPL mounts available separately.', 9750000.0, '{"Brand": "Blackmagic", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Compatible Media": "Internal Storage", "General": "Accessory MountsNo Dimensions11 × 6 × 6″ Mfr. Model Number#CINEURSAA12KLF Monitor 2 x Monitoring Screens 1 x Camera Status Screen Weight8.72 lb WirelessWi-Fi, Bluetooth", "Imaging": "ISODynamic Range: 16 StopsISO Range: 200 to 3200 Max Resolution12K ND FiltersMechanical Filter Wheel with Clear, 2-Stop (1/4), 4-Stop (1/16), 6-Stop (1/64) ND Filters Sensor35.64 × 23.32 mm (Full-Frame) CMOS StabilizationNo", "Inputs/Outputs": "Audio I/O2x XLR 3-Pin Mic/Line (+48 V Phantom Power) Input1x 1/8\\" / 3.5 mm TRRS Headphone/Mic Output Other I/O2x USB-C (Camera Interface) Input/Output1x USB-C (Firmware)1x RJ45 (10 Gigabit Ethernet) Control/Data/Monitor/Video Input/Output1x BNC (Reference, Timecode) Data Input Power I/O1x LEMO 8-Pin (12 to 24VDC) Input1x LEMO 7-Pin (12 to 24VDC) Output1x Fischer 3-Pin (12 to 24VDC) Output Storage I/ONone Video I/O2x BNC (12G-SDI) Output", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "12K", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Swivel", "Sensor Size": "Full-Frame", "Stabilization": "No", "Video Capture": "CompressionH.264 Proxy in 1920 × 10808-bit 4:2:0 Format Blackmagic RAW Resolution12K (12,288 × 8040) at 24 fps9K (9408 × 6264) at 24 fps8K (8192 × 5360) at 24 fps4K (4096 × 2680) at 24 fps", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'Includes

