Internal Recording Available. This URSA Cine is the first digital film camera that comes equipped with the ultra-fast Blackmagic Media Module to internally store up to 8TB of footage! This storage solution allows you to record at the highest resolutions and frame rates for hours, and even access your files over 10G Ethernet. If you’re using several URSA Cine cameras with the modules, you can add up to three of them to the separately available Blackmagic Design Media Dock to gain access to more files at once, speeding up post-production and turnaround times.

Wireless Capabilities and Streaming. Like most cameras of this generation, the URSA Cine is capable of WiFi and 10G Ethernet connections. With a built-in hardware engine that supports RTMP and SRT streaming, the URSA Cine can stream directly to clients or major streaming platforms. While live streaming, you can use the USB-C port to connect an Apple or Android device to gain internet connection!

Gold Mount Powerhouse. This camera requires a decent amount of power, which can be easily taken care of with our selection of Gold Mount batteries. Alongside the Gold Mount battery plate, the URSA Cine is also equipped with an 8-pin LEMO power connector in the rear and additional LEMO and Fischer connectors in the front to power accessories.

Blackmagic OS. Equipped with Blackmagic OS, the URSA Cine is an intuitive device with user-friendly controls. This operating system allows each of the camera’s features run independently, resulting in smoother control of the camera. With this interface, you’ll tap and swipe to adjust settings and features. All advanced features, like on-screen focus and exposure tools, HDR, metadata entry, and Blackmagic RAW settings, can be accessed and controlled with ease!
Battery Plate. This V-mount Battery Plate from Blackmagic Design is specifically designed to work with the URSA Cine camera. The sturdy plate enables the attachment of a single third-party V-mount battery directly to the rear of your camera without the need for any extra cabling.

Lens Mount. Use your high-end cinema lenses on your URSA Cine camera with this EF Lens Mount from Blackmagic Design. Designed to easily integrate with the URSA Cine camera, this compact, interchangeable adapter facilitates the seamless employment of EF lenses with your camera. This adapter includes contact pins to read and record lens metadata.

Baseplate. The included Blackmagic Design 19mm Baseplate for URSA Cine 12K provides you with both 19mm and 15mm studio rod mounts and ARRI standard rosettes on either side for rod and accessory mounting. Want to add a baseplate with just the 15mm rod mounts? We have the Blackmagic Design 15mm LWS Baseplate available too! Please note that in order to connect either baseplate to another surface, you will need access to an ARRI-standard dovetail plate.

Power Supply. The Blackmagic Design 24V 250W Power Supply for URSA Cine is an alternative power bank for the Blackmagic URSA CIne camera. This power cable is capable of outputting 24V, 250W power to the camera through its 8-pin LEMO connector.

Top Handle. The Blackmagic Design URSA Cine Top Handle pairs well with the Blackmagic Design URSA Cine EVF and is designed for the Blackmagic URSA Cine and PYXIS line of cameras. It provides a secure grip and easy transport of these cameras while offering more customization options for rigging.', 16325000.0, '{"Brand": "Blackmagic", "Camera Mount": "Canon EF", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Compatible Media": "Internal Storage", "General": "Accessory MountsNo Battery TypeGold Mount Dimensions11 × 6 × 6″ Mfr. Model Number#CINEURSAA12KLFBODY Monitor 2 x Monitoring Screens 1 x Camera Status Screen Weight8.72 lb WirelessWi-Fi, Bluetooth", "Imaging": "ISODynamic Range: 16 StopsISO Range: 200 to 3200 Max Resolution12K ND FiltersMechanical Filter Wheel with Clear, 2-Stop (1/4), 4-Stop (1/16), 6-Stop (1/64) ND Filters Sensor35.64 × 23.32 mm (Full-Frame) CMOS StabilizationNo", "Inputs/Outputs": "Audio I/O2x XLR 3-Pin Mic/Line (+48 V Phantom Power) Input1x 1/8\\" / 3.5 mm TRRS Headphone/Mic Output Other I/O2x USB-C (Camera Interface) Input/Output1x USB-C (Firmware)1x RJ45 (10 Gigabit Ethernet) Control/Data/Monitor/Video Input/Output1x BNC (Reference, Timecode) Data Input Power I/O1x LEMO 8-Pin (12 to 24VDC) Input1x LEMO 7-Pin (12 to 24VDC) Output1x Fischer 3-Pin (12 to 24VDC) Output Storage I/ONone Video I/O2x BNC (12G-SDI) Output", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "12K", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Swivel", "Sensor Size": "Full-Frame", "Stabilization": "No", "Video Capture": "CompressionH.264 Proxy in 1920 × 10808-bit 4:2:0 Format Blackmagic RAW Resolution12K (12,288 × 8040) at 24 fps9K (9408 × 6264) at 24 fps8K (8192 × 5360) at 24 fps4K (4096 × 2680) at 24 fps", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'Includes

