Top Handle. The Blackmagic Design URSA Cine Top Handle pairs well with the Blackmagic Design URSA Cine EVF and is designed for the Blackmagic URSA Cine and PYXIS line of cameras. It provides a secure grip and easy transport of these cameras while offering more customization options for rigging.', 16325000.0, '{"Brand": "Blackmagic", "Camera Mount": "Canon EF", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Compatible Media": "SSD", "General": "Accessory MountsNo Battery TypeV-Mount Dimensions11 × 6 × 6″ Mfr. Model Number#CINEURSAA12KLFBODY Monitor 2 x Monitoring Screens 1 x Camera Status Screen Weight8.72 lb WirelessWi-Fi, Bluetooth", "Imaging": "ISODynamic Range: 16 StopsISO Range: 200 to 3200 Max Resolution12K ND FiltersMechanical Filter Wheel with Clear, 2-Stop (1/4), 4-Stop (1/16), 6-Stop (1/64) ND Filters Sensor35.64 × 23.32 mm (Full-Frame) CMOS StabilizationNo", "Inputs/Outputs": "Audio I/O2x XLR 3-Pin Mic/Line (+48 V Phantom Power) Input1x 1/8\\" / 3.5 mm TRRS Headphone/Mic Output Other I/O2x USB-C (Camera Interface) Input/Output1x USB-C (Firmware)1x RJ45 (10 Gigabit Ethernet) Control/Data/Monitor/Video Input/Output1x BNC (Reference, Timecode) Data Input Power I/O1x LEMO 8-Pin (12 to 24VDC) Input1x LEMO 7-Pin (12 to 24VDC) Output1x Fischer 3-Pin (12 to 24VDC) Output Storage I/ONone Video I/O2x BNC (12G-SDI) Output", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "12K", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Swivel", "Sensor Size": "Full-Frame", "Stabilization": "No", "Video Capture": "CompressionH.264 Proxy in 1920 × 10808-bit 4:2:0 Format Blackmagic RAW Resolution12K (12,288 × 8040) at 24 fps9K (9408 × 6264) at 24 fps8K (8192 × 5360) at 24 fps4K (4096 × 2680) at 24 fps", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'Includes

