INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (192, 1, 8, 'Blackmagic Design URSA Mini Pro 12K OLPF (EF)', 'blackmagic-design-ursa-mini-pro-12k-olpf-ef', 'The Blackmagic Design URSA Mini Pro 12K OLPF (EF) is the same as the Blackmagic Design URSA Mini Pro 12K but with the addition of an Optical Low Pass Filter. Key features include:

80MP 12K Super 35 sensor
Electronic Canon EF mount
OLPF for reduced moire and aliasing
Netflix approved camera

What’s Changed? The Blackmagic Design URSA Mini Pro 12K OLPF (EF) is the same in every way as the Blackmagic Design URSA Mini Pro 12K but with one key addition: an Optical Low Pass Filter. This URSA Mini Pro’s OLPF is precisely matched to the 12K sensor. This is useful when shooting in environments that have video walls, as the ultra-sharp and modern sensors in most cameras will introduce interference patterns. Additionally, the updated IR filtering improves far red color response.

One other key difference: please note that, unlike the Blackmagic Design URSA Mini Pro 12K (EF) rental, this rental does not include a gold mount battery plate. If you want the OLPF version with a plate, please see the Blackmagic URSA Mini Pro 12K OLPF Gold Mount Kit.

Extreme Resolution from a Cinematic Sensor. Blackmagic’s revolutionary sensor offers an astounding native resolution of 12,288 × 6480 (80MP)! Shoot 12K footage at 60 fps or use in-sensor scaling for 8K up to 120 fps and 4K up to 240 fps. Take advantage of the 12-bit Blackmagic RAW workflow, which uses efficient constant quality and constant bitrate codecs. Constant bitrate encoding ensures the best possible imagery with consistent file sizes for easy editing, even on a laptop. It should be noted that Blackmagic RAW is your only option with this camera. You’ll find no ProRes options here.

All of these sensor features are complemented by Generation 5 color science, which produces accurate skin tones and better rendering of saturated colors (like neon signs or car lights). With a wide 14-stop dynamic range and built-in ND filters, you have full control over scene exposure, giving you the opportunity to really create your own look in nearly any condition.

Lightweight Form Factor, Versatile Build. Blackmagic designed this camera to be evenly-weighted and as lightweight as possible without sacrificing important features. All of the buttons and dials have been thoughtfully laid out to make them easy to find by feel when composing via EVF. This rental does not include an EVF. It can be added to your order here. The body is equipped with a backlit LCD for critical data and a 4" fold-out touchscreen for reviewing footage. For a larger, more customizable monitor, check out the Blackmagic Design PYXIS Monitor EVF Kit. Connections such as 12G-SDI, USB-C, XLR audio, and timecode are maintained. For recording, you have access to dual CFast and dual SD card slots as well as an optional SuperSpeed USB-C expansion port for recording on SSDs. All of this is delivered in a system that’s barely over 5 pounds!', 8975000.0, '{"Brand": "Blackmagic", "Camera Mount": "Canon EF", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Compatible Media": "CFast and SD", "General": "Accessory Mounts4x 1/4\\"-20 (top)1x ARRI rosetteBattery TypeGold, V-mount (not included)Dimensions (W x H x D)9.2 × 5.92 × 5.87″Mfr. Model NumberCINEURSAMUPRO12KOLPFMonitorEVF not included (available here)4\\" articulating touchscreenWeight5.62 lb.WirelessBluetooth", "Imaging": "ISODynamic Range: 14 stopsISO Range: 125-3200Max ResolutionDCI 12K (12288 × 6480)ND FiltersBuilt-in (mechanical)Sensor79.6MP Super 35 CMOSShutterElectronic rollingStabilizationNo", "Inputs/Outputs": "Audio I/O1x 3.5mm headphone/mic jack2x 3-pin XLR mic/lineOther I/O1x USB-C1x BNC (ref/TC)1x 2.5mm LANC12-pin HirosePower I/O1x 4-pin XLR1x 12-pin Molex1x 4-pin XLR 12V DCStorage I/O2x CFast 2.0 slots2x SD UHS-II slots1x SSD with URSA Mini Recorder (not included)Video I/O2x BNC (12G-SDI)1x BNC (3G-SDI)", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "12K", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Swivel", "Sensor Size": "Super35", "Stabilization": "No", "Video Capture": "CompressionBlackmagic RAW Constant BitrateBlackmagic RAW Constant QualityFormat.BRAWResolutionDCI 12K (12,288 × 6480) up to 60.00 fpsAnamorphic 12K (7680 × 6408)DCI 8K (8192 × 4320)Anamorphic 8K (5120 × 4272) up to 160 fps6K Super 16 (6144 × 3240)4K Super 16/DCI 4K (4096 × 2160) up to 240 fpsAnamorphic 4K (2560 × 2136) up to 160 fps", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'Includes

