	Polarized Cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (203, 1, 8, 'Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 6K Pro (EF)', 'blackmagic-pocket-cinema-camera-6k-pro-ef', 'The Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 6K Pro (EF) is an update to the BMPCC6K that records up to 6144 × 3456 RAW video to CFast 2.0 or UHS-II SD media. Key features include:

5" tilting HDR touchscreen LCD
2/4/6 internal ND filters
Dual mini-XLR inputs
Powered by one Sony L-Series battery

6K Pro, Stepping Up To The Plate. To top their previous achievement with the Pocket Cinema Camera 6K, Blackmagic Design adds an even more full-featured, compact Super35 camera to their cine-style line with the Pocket Cinema Camera 6K Pro. The 6K Pro features all the recording features, sensor, and dynamic range as its predecessor, the Pocket Cinema Camera 6K, and adds a variety of important new features such as a 5" tilting HDR capacitive touchscreen LCD with 1500 cd/m² brightness, a Pro EVF option, built-in clear/2/4/6-stop ND filters, dual mini-XLR inputs, an accurate timecode clock, an NP-F570 L-series battery slot, and updated Gen 5 color science. If you’re working on a tight budget and can forgo some of the “Pro” features, the Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 6K G2 is a great alternative.

Same Feel, More Power. With only a slightly larger form factor than the 6L, the 6K Pro records the same resolutions up to 50 fps 6144 × 3456 video, and it retains the valuable active Canon EF mount, letting users take advantage of the expansive array of EF/EF-S mount lenses available. The EF mount supports iris, autofocus, and zoom functions using electronic communication when using compatible lenses. If you need a battery grip for this camera, we also carry the Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 6K Pro Battery Grip.

Gen 5 internal Color Processing. The updated Gen 5 internal color processing makes it easy to intercut 6K Pro, 6K, and BMPCC 4K footage. Record using the internal CFast 2.0 and SD/UHS-II card slots or via the full-size HDMI port to an optional ATEM Mini switcher for live streaming, or output via the USB Type-C port to capture longer clips to an external drive.', 3600000.0, '{"Brand": "Blackmagic", "Camera Mount": "Canon EF", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Compatible Media": "CFast and SD", "Imaging": "Sensor Type: CMOS Size: 23.1 × 12.99mm (Super35) Maximum Resolution 6144 × 3456 Dynamic Range: Up to 13 stopsSensitivity Range: 100-25,600 Native ISO: up to 25,600", "Inputs/Outputs": "Audio Inputs2x mini XLR (XLR adapter not included!)3.5mm stereo mini-jackAudio ControlsMic/LinePhantom power +48vAudio Output3.5mm stereo mini-jackVideo OutHDMI Type-A Additional Inputs/Outputs3.5mm timecode inputDC In: 12V DC (with supplied AC adapter)USB Type-C", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Frame Rate": "50", "Maximum Video Resolution": "6K", "Monitoring": "LCD Panel5” Tilting Widescreen Color LCDResolution: 1920 × 1080TouchscreenInternal MicrophoneStereo (front mounted)", "Physical": "Dimensions (W x H x D)7.1 × 4.4 × 4.8″Accessory Mounts1/4-20 (center top and bottom)", "Power Supply": "AC AdapterSuppliedBatteryType: Sony L-series (1x supplied)Operating Time: Approximately 1 hrCharging Time: Approximately 2.5 hrAdditional Battery CompatibilityType: Sony L-series", "Recording": "Formats ProRes 422 HQ ProRes 422 ProRes 422 LT ProRes 422 Proxy Modes 4096 × 2160p/3840 × 2160p: 23.98/24/25/30/50/60 1920 × 1080p: 23.98/24/25/30/50/60 MediaCFast 2.0SDXC UHS-II", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Tilt", "Sensor Size": "Super35", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "2.7 lb.", "Wireless Connectivity": "Bluetooth"}', 'Includes

	BMPCC6K Pro
	EVF port cover
	AC adapter
	Blackmagic NP-F570 battery
	Sony AC-VQ1051D
	Polarized cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (204, 1, 8, 'Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 6K Pro w/ Wooden PL Mod', 'blackmagic-pocket-cinema-camera-6k-pro-w-wooden-pl-mod', 'The Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 6K Pro w/ Wooden PL Mod is an upgrade to the BMPCC6K Pro that adds a PL mount to the camera. Key features include:

5" tilting HDR touchscreen LCD
2/4/6 internal ND filters
Modified with a Wooden PL mount
Powered by one Sony L-Series battery

The One with the PL Mount. Wooden has answered the challenge of lens versatility with a PL Mount Mod, and this rental comes with it preinstalled on the camera, allowing the BMPCC 6K Pro to be friends with your beloved collection of PL-mount cinema lenses. Could it be any easier?

6K Pro, Stepping Up To The Plate. To top their previous achievement with the Pocket Cinema Camera 6K, Blackmagic Design adds an even more full-featured, compact Super35 camera to their cine-style line with the Pocket Cinema Camera 6K Pro. The 6K Pro features all the recording features, sensor, and dynamic range as its predecessor, the Pocket Cinema Camera 6K, and adds a variety of important new features such as a 5" tilting HDR capacitive touchscreen LCD with 1500 cd/m² brightness, a Pro EVF option, built-in clear/2/4/6-stop ND filters, dual mini-XLR inputs, an accurate timecode clock, an NP-F570 L-series battery slot, and updated Gen 5 color science.

Same Feel, More Power. With only a slightly larger form factor than the 6K, the 6K Pro records the same resolutions up to 50 fps 6144 × 3456 video. If you need a battery grip for this camera, we also carry the Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 6K Pro Battery Grip.

Gen 5 Internal Color Processing. The updated Gen 5 internal color processing makes it easy to intercut 6K Pro, 6K, and BMPCC 4K footage. Record using the internal CFast 2.0 and SD/UHS-II card slots or via the full-size HDMI port to an optional ATEM Mini switcher for live streaming, or output via the USB Type-C port to capture longer clips to an external drive.', 3725000.0, '{"Brand": "Blackmagic", "Camera Mount": "PL", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Compatible Media": "CFast and SD", "Imaging": "Sensor Type: CMOS Size: 23.1 × 12.99mm (Super35) Maximum Resolution 6144 × 3456 Dynamic Range: Up to 13 stopsSensitivity Range: 100-25,600 Native ISO: up to 25,600", "Inputs/Outputs": "Audio Inputs2x mini XLR (XLR adapter not included!)3.5mm stereo mini-jackAudio ControlsMic/LinePhantom power +48vAudio Output3.5mm stereo mini-jackVideo OutHDMI Type-A Additional Inputs/Outputs3.5mm timecode inputDC In: 12V DC (with supplied AC adapter)USB Type-C", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "6K", "Monitoring": "LCD Panel5” Tilting Widescreen Color LCDResolution: 1920 × 1080TouchscreenInternal MicrophoneStereo (front mounted)", "Physical": "Dimensions (W x H x D)7.1 × 4.4 × 4.8″Accessory Mounts1/4-20 (center top and bottom)", "Power Supply": "AC AdapterSuppliedBatteryType: Sony L-series (1x supplied)Operating Time: Approximately 1 hrCharging Time: Approximately 2.5 hrAdditional Battery CompatibilityType: Sony L-series", "Recording": "Formats ProRes 422 HQ ProRes 422 ProRes 422 LT ProRes 422 Proxy Modes 4096 × 2160p/3840 × 2160p: 23.98/24/25/30/50/60 1920 × 1080p: 23.98/24/25/30/50/60 MediaCFast 2.0SDXC UHS-II", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Tilt", "Sensor Size": "Super35", "Stabilization": "No", "Weight": "2.7 lb.", "Wireless Connectivity": "Bluetooth"}', 'Includes

