RAWLITE Optical Low Pass Filter. This Rawlite OLPF is specifically designed for the Blackmagic URSA Broadcast G2, preventing moiré and aliasing while preserving the high detail that this camera is able to capture with it’s 6K resolution.', 8275000.0, '{"Brand": "Blackmagic", "Camera Mount": "B4", "Camera Type": "Broadcast", "Compatible Media": "CFast and SD", "Dimensions": "10.95 × 9.93 × 5.9″", "Dynamic Range": "13 Stops", "Inputs/Outputs": "Video Inputs 1x BNC (12G-SDI)USB Type-C Data Input3-Pin XLR Mic/Line Level (+48 V Phantom Power) InputBNC Reference, Sync, Timecode Data InputVideo Outputs2x BNC (12G-SDI) clean output & monitor outputUSB Type-C USB 3.1 Gen 2 Video Output2.5 mm LANC Control Output12-Pin Hirose Camera Interface Control Output1/8\\" / 3.5 mm TRRS Headphone/Microphone Headphone Input/Output", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "4K", "Microphone": "2x built-in stereo cardioid microphones (-10dB pad and low-cut filter)", "Power Output": "12V output (4-pin XLR) for EVF\\n4-Pin XLR (12 to 20 VDC) Output\\n12-pin molex connector", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Swivel", "Sensor Size": "Super35", "Stabilization": "No", "Video Formats": "Blackmagic RAW 10-Bit3840 × 2160 at 60 fps1920 × 1080 at 150 fpsProRes 422/ProRes 422HQ3840 × 2160p up to 60 fps1920 × 1080p up to 60 fps1920 × 1080p at 120 fpsH.2653840 × 2160p up to 60 fpsH.2641920 × 1080p up to 60 fps", "Weather Sealing": "No"}', 'Includes

