Suitable for Solo Shooters. Easily swap out different Remus primes without having to adjust your follow focus setup thanks to unified and industry-standard 0.8 MOD gearing. The focus rotation is 150º, which makes focusing by hand easier, and the 77mm front threading will accommodate affordable and readily-available filters. The outside diameter is 80mm, which is compatible with most pro matte boxes for using high-end drop-in filters. A port for adding lens support is on the barrel of the lens, which is handy for heavier matte box setups.

Widescreen for a Wider Audience. Adding a cinematic and artistic touch to your footage is now more accessible than ever because of brands like Blazar, Vazen, and Sirui challenging the high-end likes of ARRI, Cooke, and Atlas. What sets Blazar apart from its current low-cost competitors is their ample sensor coverage and retro look. The Blazar Remus 85mm T2.8 1.5x Anamorphic is a great option for full-frame PL-mount cameras like the Blackmagic PYXIS 6K.

Convenient Prime Packages. Expand your options beyond just the 85mm. We have created the following lens sets for creators to easily explore all that the Blazar Remus collection has to offer. The lenses in these sets are unified both physically and optically so that swapping out different focal lengths is a breeze.

3-Lens Set with the 45mm, 65mm, and 100mm
	4-Lens Set with the 33mm, 50mm, 85mm, and 125mm
	5-Lens Sets with the 33mm, 50mm, 65mm, 85mm, and 125mm

