Widescreen for a Wider Audience. Adding a cinematic and artistic touch to your footage is now more accessible than ever because of brands like Blazar, Vazen, and Sirui challenging the high-end likes of ARRI, Cooke, and Atlas. What sets Blazar apart from its current low-cost competitors is their ample sensor coverage and retro look.', 6600000.0, '{"Anamorphic Squeeze": "1.5x", "Aperture Blades": "16", "Brand": "Blazar", "Filter Size": "77.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On and Matte Box Mount", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Front Lens Diameter": "80mm", "Gearing": "0.8 MOD focus, iris", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "L", "Lens Type": "Anamorphic, Kit, Wide Angle, Standard, Telephoto, and For Mirrorless", "Mfr. Model Number": "REM-4LA-L", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "10.0 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

