INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (253, 2, 9, 'Blazar Remus-M Anamorphic 4-Lens Set (RF, Silver Flare)', 'blazar-remus-m-anamorphic-4-lens-set-rf-silver-flare', 'The Blazar Remus-M Anamorphic 4-Lens Set (RF, Silver Flare) provides you with the 33mm, 50mm,  85mm, & 100mm Remus-M lenses, designed to mirror the construction and capabilities of the Remus. Key features include:

Silver flare effect; 1.5x squeeze ratio
T1.8/T2.0/T2.8 max apertures
Only for mirrorless Canon RF cameras
80mm front diameter; 77mm filter thread

Quadruple Threat. Looking to fill out your production with the interchangeable, L-Mount compatible Remus-M lenses? The Blazar Remus-M Anamorphic 4-Lens Set (RF, Silver Flare) has you covered! This set of lenses provides you with the Blazar Remus-M 33mm T1.8, 50mm T2.0, 85mm, and 100mm T2.8 lenses. If you’re just looking for the 33/50/85mm range of lenses, we do have the Blazar Remus-M Anamorphic 3-Lens Set – RF, Silver Flare available!

Anamorphic Look for Less. With a goal of maintaining portability and affordability, Blazar has expanded creative possibilities with a set of 1.5x full-frame primes. With wide compatibility with multiple aspect ratios, including covering up to 3:2 open gate large formats, these lenses are a versatile choice that can be paired with mirrorless RF-mount cameras – while being a lot more budget-friendly than most anamorphics.

Suitable for Solo Shooters. Easily swap out different Remus primes without having to adjust your follow focus setup thanks to unified and industry-standard 0.8 MOD gearing. The focus rotation is 150-degrees, which makes focusing by hand easier, and the 77mm front threading will accommodate affordable and readily-available filters. The outside diameter is 80mm, which is compatible with most pro matte boxes for using high-end drop-in filters. A port for adding lens support is on the barrel of the lens, which is handy for heavier matte box setups.

Widescreen for a Wider Audience. Adding a cinematic and artistic touch to your footage is now more accessible than ever because of brands like Blazar, Vazen, and Sirui challenging the high-end likes of ARRI, Cooke, and Atlas. What sets Blazar apart from its current low-cost competitors is their ample sensor coverage and retro look.', 6600000.0, '{"Anamorphic Squeeze": "1.5x", "Aperture Blades": "16", "Brand": "Blazar", "Filter Size": "77.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On and Matte Box Mount", "Focus Rotation": "150º", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Front Lens Diameter": "80mm", "Gearing": "0.8 MOD focus, iris", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Canon RF", "Lens Type": "Anamorphic, Kit, Wide Angle, Standard, Telephoto, Cine, and For Mirrorless", "Mfr. Model Number": "REM-4LA-RF", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "10.0 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

