n": "Yes", "Video Capture": "CompressionCinema RAW Light 12-BitXF-AVC Intra 4:2:2 10-BitXF-AVC Long GOP 4:2:2 10-BitXF-AVC S Intra 4:2:2 10-BitXF-AVC S Long GOP 4:2:2 10-BitXF-AVC S Long GOP 4:2:0 8-BitXF-HEVC S Long GOP 4:2:2/4:2:0 10-BitFormat.MP4ResolutionUHD 6K (6000 × 3164) up to 60 fpsDCI 4K (4096 × 2160) up to 120 fpsUHD 4K (3840 × 2160) up to 120 fpsDCI 2K (2048 × 1080) up to 180 fpsFHD 1080p (1920 × 1080) up to 180 fps", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi"}', 'Includes

