	Top handle
	Mic mount
	Mic mount hardware', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (390, 1, 12, 'Canon EOS C700 EF Cinema Camera', 'canon-eos-c700-ef-cinema-camera', 'The Canon C700 is a Super-35 sensor digital cinema camera and the flagship camera in Canon’s Cinema EOS lineup. This version uses the Canon EF lens mount. Key features include:

8.85MP 4.5K Super 35 CMOS sensor
Internal 4:2:2 10-bit in 4K or up to 4:4:4 12-bit in 2K
Up to 60p in 4K, 120p in 2K, or up to 240p in 2K crop mode
Netflix approved camera

Cinema EOS Heritage. The C700 is Cinema EOS. That means you get all the great features previously made popular in the line, including a sensor that boasts Canon’s color science and a wide dynamic range, Canon Log (Original, Canon Log 2, and Canon Log 3 versions), the joy of Dual Pixel autofocus, and an XF-AVC internal recording codec capable of up to 12-bit 4:4:4 in 2K and 10-bit 4:2:2 in 4K.

Cinema EOS Evolution. So, what makes this newfangled camera the cream of the crop for Cinema EOS? There’s a new modular form factor, higher recording speeds, more codecs, and a more advanced monitoring system.

New Form Factor. If the C300 Mark II was a dog, it’d be like a pug or an English bulldog with its kind-of smushed face and collapsed form factor. The C700 is more like the noble dachshund: long, sleek, and elegant. The C700’s body gets longer and shorter, making it better suited to go in a shoulder-mount configuration. There’s also a plethora of 1/4"-20 and 3/8"-16 mounting points to be found along the top of the camera.

Higher Speeds. Even slower slow motion is possible with 60 fps in 4K and up to 240 fps in cropped 2K mode.

Internal ProRes. In addition to the native .MXF recording format, the C700 also supports internal Apple ProRes recording to the CFast media, with the 422 HQ version available in 4K at 30p. In 2K, there’s a choice between 422 to conserve space, 422 HQ for less compression, or 12-bit 4444 for the highest quality. You can record ProRes at up to 180 fps in standard 422 when using the crop mode.

Advanced Monitoring. HDR monitoring is now possible when using monitors compatible with the SMPTE ST 2084 standard. Monitoring also gets some expansion from the surround-area function. Operators can use the 4.5K sensor’s extra resolution to track boom poles and lights outside the frame and keep them from dipping into the shot, and an anamorphic de-squeeze function allows images from anamorphic lenses to be displaced at their proper aspect ratio on the EVF and monitor outputs.

Battery and Charger Included. This rental includes an Anton Bauer V-Mount battery plate, an Anton Bauer LP2 charger, and one Anton Bauer Dionic XT90 V-Mount Battery, so that you can power the camera without needing to keep it plugged in.', 7950000.0, '{"Brand": "Canon", "Camera Mount": "Canon EF", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Compatible Media": "CFast and SD", "DC Input": "12V DC (4-pin XLR)", "Frame Rates": "4096 × 2160 – 59.94p, 29.97p, 25p, 24p, 23.98p, 3840 × 2160 – 59.94p, 29.97p, 25p, 24p, 23.98p, 2048 × 1080 – 59.94p, 29.97p, 25p, 24p, 23.98p, 1920 × 1080 – 59.94p, 29.97p, 25p, 24p, 23.98p, and HFR 2K/HD – 240p, 180p, 120p, 119.88p, 100p", "Genlock Input": "BNC", "Inputs/Outputs": "Video OutputsHDMI Output Type A HD-SDI Output(4) BNC", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Frame Rate": "240", "Maximum Photo Resolution": "11.5 MP", "Maximum Video Resolution": "4K", "Recording Format": "Video – 4K: 410Mbps (CBR) 4:2:2, ProRes 422, Pr 2K / HD: 225 / 210Mbps (CBR) 4:4:4 and Audio – LPCM (24/16 bits, 48 kHz, 4 channels)", "Remote": "2.5mm LANC-compatible terminal", "Sensor Size": "Super35", "Stabilization": "No", "Timecode Input": "BNC", "Timecode Output": "BNC", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "7.6 lb."}', 'Includes

	C700 EF Camcorder
	Top Handle
	Body cap
	Mic holder attachment
	Anton Bauer Dionic XT90 V-Mount Battery
	Anton Bauer V-Mount charger w/power cable
	Wooden 15v 10A XLR4 AC adapter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (391, 1, 12, 'Canon EOS C700 EF Premium Kit', 'canon-eos-c700-ef-premium-kit', 'Our Canon EOS C700 EF Premium Package gives you a C700 and the accessories you’ll need to get the most out of it. This is a Netflix approved camera! This package includes:

Canon EOS C700 EF
	Canon C700 Shoulder Mount with SG-1 Grip
	Canon EVF-V70 OLED Viewfinder
	Canon OU-700 Remote Operation Unit
	Spare Anton Bauer Dionic XT90 V-Mount Battery
	Anton Bauer LP2 V-Mount Charger

Canon EOS C700 EF. The C700 is Canon’s flagship Cinema EOS camera. That means you get all the great features previously made popular in the line, including a sensor that boasts Canon’s color science and a wide dynamic range, Canon Log (Original, Canon Log 2, and Canon Log 3 versions), the joy of Dual Pixel Auto Focus, and an XF-AVC internal recording codec capable of up to 12-bit 4:4:4 in 2K and 10-bit 4:2:2 in 4K, all in a sleek, modular form factor.

Canon C700 Shoulder Mount with SG-1 Grip Unit. This cinema-style shoulder mount gives you rod- and tripod-mounting capabilities. The included Canon SG-1 Grip Unit adds start/stop and iris controls, and a zoom rocker for supported lenses.

Canon EVF-V70 OLED Viewfinder. This Full HD EVF sports an OLED display for color reproduction matches that of the camera, and it includes intuitive controls and user-assignable buttons. Its myriad other features include an ST 2084 Assist LUT, a Surrounding Area function, a built-in diopter, and false color and zebras.

Canon OU-700 Remote Operation Unit. The OU-700 gives you remote start/stop control and full menu navigation, making it perfect for multi-operator setups. You can also mount it directly to the camera.

Anton Bauer LP2 V-Mount Charger. The LP2 lets you simultaneously charge two batteries. It prioritizes the battery with the strongest charge so that you’ll be shooting again as quickly as possible.', 19650000.0, '{"Brand": "Canon", "Camera Mount": "Canon EF", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Item Type": "Camera"}', 'Includes

Canon EOS C700 EF Cinema Camera
Canon EOS C700 Shoulder Mount w/ SG-1 Grip Unit
Canon EVF-V70 OLED Viewfinder
Canon OU-700 Remote Operation Unit for C700
Anton Bauer Dionic XT90 V-Mount Battery
Anton Bauer LP2 Dual V-Mount Battery Charger
Wheeled Hard Case



See Details', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (392, 1, 12, 'Canon EOS C80 Cinema Camera (RF)', 'canon-eos-c80-cinema-camera-rf', 'The Canon C80 is a 6K full-frame, RF-mount cinema camera that combines the sensor of the C400 with the form factor of the C70. Key features include:

800/3,200/12,800 triple base ISO in Log/RAW
Upgraded Dual Pixel CMOS AF II
Oversampled 4K120p or 1080p with 4:2:2 10-bit color
12G-SDI out, built-in Wi-Fi, Ethernet, and mini-XLR

What’s Changed? The Canon EOS C80 Cinema Camera improves on the prior C70 with increased sensor resolution, expanded internal recording modes, expanded ports for external recording, more audio recording options, IP streaming support, built-in Wi-Fi, a multi-interface shoe, and improved Dual-Pixel CMOS AF technology. With this camera, you can focus on objects across the entire image sensor instead of the narrower area coverage of the C70. You also have access to the latest subject-tracking modes, including animal-tracking AF. The BSI Stacked CMOS sensor is greatly improved at 19.05 effective megapixels (vs the prior’s 8.85MP). While the C80 still doesn’t offer in-body image stabilization, it is equipped with Electronic Image Stabilization (EIS).

Expanded Recording Options. Record up to 6K30p in Cinema RAW Light, as well as 4K120p and 2K180p. This camera also supports 6K60p RAW out over full-size HDMI. The dual SD card slots allow for dual recording, simultaneous recording of proxy files, simultaneous recording of different formats, or relay recording. The C80 inherited the sensor, DIGIC DV 7 processor,  and the triple base ISO specs from the beefier C400 without sacrificing form factor so that the C80 can still be used with gimbals. With 16 stops of dynamic range, 12-bit RAW footage, and ports you’d normally only see on high-end cameras, the C80 fills the gap between large, pro-level cinema systems and portable prosumer mirrorless cameras.

Comprehensive Connectivity. With SRT protocol support, the C80 simplifies live streaming, ensuring stable, high-quality footage while using minimal network bandwidth. The built-in Ethernet port and Wi-Fi unlock maximum operability for both streaming and for Canon’s IP-based remote control XC protocol. When paired with a Canon RC-IP1000 or RC-IP100, you can remotely control the C80 as part of a large multi-camera setup. Alternatively, Canon’s Multi-Camera Control app lets you to start/stop recording and see framing and settings from afar.

Large Lens Selection. The C80 shoots full frame as well as Super 35 (4K Super 35 and UHD Super 35) and is compatible with Canon’s Virtual Production System, so you can use any RF mount lens, including VR lenses like the Canon RF 5.2mm f/2.8L Dual Fisheye 3D VR. The C80 is also equipped with the Cooke /i Technology protocol from Cooke Optics, which opens up metadata compatibility with a variety of /i Technology partners. This protocol will automatically record key lens data for every frame shot. Lenses equipped with i/ Technology include the Canon Cine-Servo 17-120mm T2.95-3.9, the Angenieux EZ-2 15-40mm T2.0 S35, and the Cooke 50mm T2.4 SP3 Full-Frame Prime.', 8425000.0, '{"Brand": "Canon", "Camera Mount": "Canon RF", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Compatible Media": "SD", "General": "Accessory Mounts1x 1/4\\"-20 (top)1x 1/4\\"-20 (side)3x 1/4\\"-20 (bottom)1x 3/8\\"-16 (bottom)Battery TypeCanon BP-AN (note: BP-A batteries compatible but won’t power multi-function shoe)Dimensions (W x H x D)6.3 × 5.4 × 4.6″Mfr. Model Number6389C002MonitorNo EVF3.5\\" articulating touchscreenWeight2.87 lb.Wireless2.4/5 GHz Wi-Fi", "Imaging": "ISODynamic Range: 16 stopsISO Range: 100-102,400Triple Base ISO (800/3,200/12,800)Max ResolutionUHD 6K (6000 × 3164)ND FiltersBuilt-in (mechanical)Sensor19.05MP Full Frame BSI Stacked Dual Pixel CMOSShutterElectronic rollingStabilizationDigital, 5-Axis", "Inputs/Outputs": "Audio I/O1x 3.5mm headphone jack1x 3.5mm mic jack2x 3-pin mini-XLROther I/O1x USB-C1x BNC (ref/TC)1x 2.5mm LANC1x Ethernet1x Multi-interface hot shoePower I/O23.7-25V DC barrelBP-AN battery portStorage I/O2x SD UHS-II slotsVideo I/OHDMI Type-A1x BNC (12G-SDI)", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Photo Resolution": "26.7 MP", "Maximum Video Resolution": "6K", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Swivel", "Sensor Size": "Full-Frame", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Video Capture": "CompressionCinema RAW Light 12-bitXF-AVC S Intra 4:2:2 10-bitXF-HEVC S Long GOP 4:2:2 10-bitFormat.MP4.MOVResolutionUHD 6K (6000 × 3164) up to 29.97 fpsDCI 4K (4096 × 2160) up to 120 fpsUHD 4K (3840 × 2160 ) up to 120 fpsDCI 2K (2048 × 1080) up to 180 fpsFHD 1080p (1920 × 1080) up to 180 fps", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi"}', 'Includes

	Canon EOS C80 cinema camera (RF)
	Canon mic mount v2
	Canon C200 mic mount screws
	Canon C80 top handle
	Canon BP-A30N battery
	Canon CG -A20 charger
	Canon CA-CP300 B AC adapter
	Non-polarized cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (393, 1, 12, 'Canon EOS C80 RF and 24-105mm f/2.8L Power Zoom Starter Kit', 'canon-eos-c80-rf-and-24-105mm-f-2-8l-power-zoom-starter-kit', 'The Canon EOS C80 RF and 24-105mm f/2.8L Power Zoom Starter Kit is a full-frame cinema kit offering versatile recording tools, 6K30p capture, and functions built for novice cinematographers. This bundle is built around the impressive C80 6K – RF and 24-105mm f/2.8, alongside other essential accessories. This is a Netflix approved camera! Feel free to click any of the below highlighted links for additional information and specifications.

