	Sennheiser MKH 8060 short shotgun microphone
	Blackmagic 19.5-inch mini-XLR to female XLR cable', 17150000.0, '{"Audio": "Microphone:\\nFrequency Response50Hz to 25kHzOutput ImpedanceNominal: 25ΩMinimum Terminating: 2kΩPolar PatternSupercardioid/LobarTransducerSymmetrical RFMaximum Sound Pressure Level129dB", "Brand": "Canon", "Camera Mount": "Canon RF", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Compatible Media": "SD", "General": "Camera:\\nAccessory Mounts1x 1/4\\"-20 (top)1x 1/4\\"-20 (side)3x 1/4\\"-20 (bottom)1x 3/8\\"-16 (bottom)Battery TypeCanon BP-AN (note: BP-A batteries compatible but won’t power multi-function shoe)Dimensions (W x H x D)6.3 × 5.4 × 4.6″Mfr. Model Number6389C002MonitorNo EVF3.5\\" articulating touchscreenWeight2.87 lb.Wireless2.4/5 GHz Wi-Fi\\nLens:\\nDimensions (ø x L)3.5 × 7.8\\"Mfr. Model Number6347C002Weight2.9 lb.", "Imaging": "ISODynamic Range: 16 stopsISO Range: 100-102,400Triple Base ISO (800/3,200/12,800)Max ResolutionUHD 6K (6000 × 3164)ND FiltersBuilt-in (mechanical)Sensor19.05MP Full Frame BSI Stacked Dual Pixel CMOSShutterElectronic rollingStabilizationDigital, 5-Axis", "Inputs/Outputs": "Audio I/O1x 3.5mm headphone jack1x 3.5mm mic jack2x 3-pin mini-XLROther I/O1x USB-C1x BNC (ref/TC)1x 2.5mm LANC1x Ethernet1x Multi-interface hot shoePower I/O23.7-25V DC barrelBP-AN battery portStorage I/O2x CFast 2.0 slots2x SD UHS-II slotsVideo I/OHDMI Type-A1x BNC (12G-SDI)", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "6K", "Optical Design": "Aperture Blades11Aperture Rangef/2.8-f/22Filter Size82mmFocal Length24-105mmFocus TypeAutofocus and manual focusLens FormatFull FrameMount TypeRF", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Swivel", "Sensor Size": "Full-Frame", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Video Capture": "CompressionCinema RAW Light 12-bitXF-AVC S Intra 4:2:2 10-bitXF-HEVC S Long GOP 4:2:2 10-bitFormat.MP4.MOVResolutionUHD 6K (6000 × 3164) up to 29.97 fpsDCI 4K (4096 × 2160) up to 120 fpsUHD 4K (3840 × 2160 ) up to 120 fpsDCI 2K (2048 × 1080) up to 180 fpsFHD 1080p (1920 × 1080) up to 180 fps", "Wea