Each lens is fitted with a Cool-Lux LuxGear lens gear on its focus ring.  These seamless, high-durometer silicone gears feature a standard 0.8-MOD/32-pitch and continuous 360º of rotation.', 11725000.0, '{"Brand": "Canon", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Canon EF", "Lens Type": "Ultra Wide Angle, Wide Angle, Standard, Telephoto, and Supertelephoto"}', 'Includes

