Configurable Control Ring. This RF mount lens features a new integrated, configurable control ring that you can use to adjust a range of exposure settings, including ISO, aperture, and exposure compensation.', 875000.0, '{"Angle of View": "63°", "Aperture Blades": "9, rounded", "Brand": "Canon", "Dimensions": "2.9 × 2.5″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "52.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "35-35", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "9/11", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Canon RF", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle, Macro, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "f/1.8", "Maximum Magnification": "0.5x", "Mfr. Model Number": "2973C002", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "6.69\\"", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "0.67 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

