INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (510, 1, 12, 'Canon XA75', 'canon-xa75', 'The Canon XA75 is a compact, lightweight 4K-capable prosumer camcorder and an update to the XA55. Key features include:

1-inch 4K UHD CMOS sensor
25.5 to 382.5mm f/2.8 to 4.5 15x optical zoom lens
160 Mbps UHD 4K/30p & 45 Mbps 1080/60p recording
BNC 3G-SDI and mini HDMI outputs for external monitoring

Pro-Grade UHD 4K Camcorder. The Canon XA75 gives you a pro-grade 4K UHD camcorder in a compact package. It carries over the 4K 1-inch CMOS sensor and DIGIC DV6 image processor from the XA55, meaning that it’s capable of XF-AVC recordings in UHD 4K30p at 160 Mbps and in oversampled Full HD 1080p60 at 45 Mbps. You also get MP4 recordings in 4K30p at 150 Mbps and in oversampled Full HD 1080p60 at 17 Mbps.

Compact and Easy to Use. The Canon XA camcorders are a fantastic option for first-time videographers or for situations requiring a compact, no-fuss camcorder. Despite its small stature, the XA75 features BNC 3G-SDI and mini HDMI outputs for external monitoring and a detachable top handle with two XLR audio inputs. Attach the battery, insert and format your UHS-I SD cards (not included), and you’re ready to film with a fully outfitted weight of only 3.2 lbs.

Fast, Accurate Face-Detection Autofocus. In addition to its adjustable focusing speeds, the XA75 also includes a hybrid autofocus system that offers fast and accurate performance. Simply press the AF point on the camera’s LCD to set focus and you’re ready to go. There are also Face-Detection AF and Face-Tracking AF modes, and a manual-focus mode that you can set using the focus/zoom ring.

Image-Stabilized Zoom Lens. The attached f/2.8 to 4.5 lens has a 15x zoom ratio with a 35mm equivalent zoom range of 25.5 to 382.5mm. The lens works in conjunction with the camera’s sensor for 5 axes of image stabilization that ensure smooth hand-held shooting, even in low light.

Other Notable Features. Dual UHS-I SD card slots keep you shooting longer without needing to stop to swap out cards. The camera has two options for viewing your image with a flip-out, 3.5-inch, capacitive-touch LCD and a tiltable rear OLED electronic viewfinder. It can also stream HD video to a PC or Mac via UVC1, although it doesn’t support audio output through USB. An On-Screen Display recording mode embeds date, time, timecode, and other relevant data in your original camera files, essentially time-stamping each frame of your footage.', 5150000.0, '{"Brand": "Canon", "Camera Type": "Camcorder", "Compatible Media": "SD", "Environmental": "Operating Temperature32 to 72°FStorage Temperature23 to 113°FOperating Humidity85%Storage Humidity60%", "Exposure Control": "Shutter Speed1/2000 to 1 SecondMinimum Illumination1.7 Lux at 1/30 Shutter Speed0.1 Lux at 1/2 Shutter SpeedWhite Balance2000 to 15,000K", "Focusing": "Focus TypeAuto and Manual FocusFocus ModeAutofocusManual Focus", "General": "Battery TypeCanon BP-8 SeriesPower Consumption5.3 WTripod Mounting Thread1/4\\"-20 FemaleAccessory Mount1x Cold Shoe MountDimensions (W x H x D)8.4 × 4.3 × 3.6″Weight2.2 lbs. (Body Only)3.2 lbs. (With Battery, Handle, Recording Media)", "Imaging": "Sensor ResolutionActual: 13.4 Megapixel (4268 × 3148)Effective: 8.29 Megapixel (3840 × 2160)Sensor Type1\\"-Type CMOS SensorImage StabilizationOptical in Integrated LensDigitalBuilt-In ND FilterMechanical Filter Wheel with 2 Stop (1/4), 4 Stop (1/16), 6 Stop (1/64) ND FiltersCapture TypeStills & Video", "Interface": "Media/Memory Card SlotDual Slot: SD/SDHC/SDXC (UHS-I)Video I/O1x Mini-HDMI 2.0 Output1x BNC (3G-SDI) OutputAudio I/O2x XLR 3-Pin Mic/Line (+48 V Phantom Power) Input1x 1/8\\" / 3.5mm TRS Stereo Headphone Input1x 1/8\\" / 3.5mm TRS Stereo Microphone InputPower I/O1x USB-C InputOther I/O1x USB-C Output", "Item Type": "Camera", "Lens": "Focal Length8.3 to 124.5mm (35mm Equivalent Focal Length: 25.5 to 382.5mm)Optical Zoom Ratio15xMaximum Aperturef/2.8 to 4.5Minimum Focus DistanceWide: 0.4\\"Entire Zoom Range: 23.6\\"Filter Size58mmFocus ControlAutofocusManual FocusInternal Recording Modes (H.264/MP4 4:2:0 8-Bit)3840 × 2160 at 23.98/24.00/29.97 fps1920 × 1080p at 23.98/24.00/29.97/59.94 fps [35 to 45 Mb/s]1280 × 720 at 59.94 fps [8 Mb/s]Internal Recording Modes (XF-AVC 4:2:0 8-Bit)3840 × 2160 at 23.98/24.00/29.97 fps1920 × 1080p at 23.98/24.00/29.97/59.94 fpsRecording LimitUp to 2120 MinutesBroadcast OutputNTSCBuilt-In Microphone TypeStereoAudio RecordingMP4: 2-Channel 16-Bit AAC AudioMP4: 4-Channel 16-Bit LPCM AudioXAVC: 4-Channel 24-Bit LPCM AudioIP StreamingNone", "Maximum Video Resolution": "4K", "Mfr. Model Number": "5735C002", "Monitor": "Size3.5\\"Resolution2,760,000 DotDisplay TypeArticulating Touchscreen LCD", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Swivel", "Sensor Size": "1-Inch", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Viewfinder": "TypeBuilt-In Electronic (LCD)Size0.36\\"Resolution1,770,000 Dot", "Weather Sealing": "No"}', 'Includes

