High-Quality Build. The 100mm was designed for a wide range of shooting applications, and it balances comfortably when used with compact cameras. A cam-style focus mechanism ensures smooth adjustments, while large, clear numbers on both sides of the barrel give your focus puller the option of working on either side of the lens.', 6650000.0, '{"Angle of View": "25º", "Aperture Blades": "9", "Brand": "Cooke", "Dimensions": "3.2 × 4.9″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "77.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "100-100", "Focus Rotation": "160º", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Front Lens Diameter": "82mm", "Gearing": "0.8 MOD focus, iris", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Canon RF", "Lens Type": "Telephoto, Cine, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.4", "Maximum Magnification": "0.2x", "Mfr. Model Number": "15.100.7.0 (RF)", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "2.18’", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "1.5 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

