INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (542, 2, 13, 'Cooke 50mm T2.0 S7/i Full Frame Plus (PL)', 'cooke-50mm-t2-0-s7-i-full-frame-plus-pl', 'The Cooke 50mm T2.0 S7/i Full Frame Plus (PL) is a high-quality PL-mount cine lens that covers full-frame sensors. As you might expect, it supports Cooke’s /i metadata protocols. Key features include:

Full-frame coverage up to 46.3mm
Supports Cooke’s /i metadata protocols
Color-matched to all Cooke lenses
High-quality PL-mount cine lens

Full-Frame Coverage.The Cooke 50mm T2.0 S7 / i Full Frame Plus lets you shoot 35mm, Super 35mm, full frame, VistaVision, and beyond. It supports full-frame cinema camera sensors up to at least 46.3mm, which covers the RED Weapon 8K.

Cinema Design. This lens’s cine-style aperture and focusing rings boast standard 0.8 mod gears so that you can easily install a follow-focus system, lens motor, or lens-control system, and its 110mm front diameters let you use almost any cine-style matte box. It boasts a generous 90° of iris rotation and an extended 270° smooth focus throw that gives you accurate focus pulling with almost no focus breathing. The 50mm is color-balanced and color-matched to other Cooke lenses to keep things consistent, and it’s compatible with Cooke S4/i, miniS4/i, Anamorphic/i and PANCHRO/i lenses.

Advanced Optics. The 50mm T2.0’s optics are designed to give you the best possible performance at full aperture while warding off flare, distortion, and spherical aberrations. They’re well-balanced for astigmatism, and they correct for lateral and longitudinal aberrations over the entire image area.

Cooke /i Metadata Support. The Cooke 50mm T2.0 S7/i Full Frame Plus supports Cooke’s /i metadata protocols to communicate with the camera, recording optical characteristics and lens settings to every frame to make post-production easier. This is especially useful when you’re adding effects in post. The electronics are accessible via a cable connector near the PL mount, and contacts in the mount sync with /i-compatible cameras and accessories.

High-Quality Build. The 50mm was designed for a wide range of shooting applications including hand-held and Steadicam, and it balances comfortably when used with compact cameras. A cam-style focus mechanism ensures smooth adjustments, while large, clear numbers on both sides of the barrel give your focus puller the option of working on either side of the lens. The body boasts a scratch-resistant PTFE hard anodized finish, which increases durability so that you can shoot in inclement conditions.

Lens Support Included. This rental includes a Wooden Camera 15mm Universal Lens Support, which lets you easily mount and unmount the support on your rods without having to remove other rod-mounted accessories.', 20575000.0, '{"Angle of View": "47°", "Aperture Blades": "9", "Brand": "Cooke", "Dimensions": "4.3 × 7.4″ (ø x L)", "Filter Type": "Matte Box Mount", "Focal Length": "50-50", "Focus Rotation": "270°", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Front Lens Diameter": "110mm", "Gearing": "0.8 MOD focus, iris", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame and VistaVision", "Lens Mount": "PL", "Lens Type": "Standard, Cine, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.0", "Mfr. Model Number": "CKE7 50", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "20\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "7.5 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

