INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (571, 1, 14, 'DJI Osmo Action 5 Pro Standard Combo', 'dji-osmo-action-5-pro-standard-combo', 'The DJI Osmo Action 5 Pro Standard Combo is a compact action camera and the predecessor to the Action 6. Key features include:

40MP 1/1.3" CMOS sensor
47GB built-in storage
Up to UHD 4K120 video
Waterproof to 65.6’

What’s New. Building off the foundation of its predecessor, the DJI Osmo Action 5 Pro Standard Combo offers incredibly helpful upgrades to the interior and exterior. This action cam boasts a 50% increase in operating time with the dedicated DJI Extreme Battery Plus, 47 GB of built-in storage, dual OLED full-color touchscreens, larger ISO ranges, and much more that can be found in the comparison sheet!

5th Gen Action Cam. Despite the similar sizing of previous generations, the Action 5 Pro packs an incredible punch to your streams and recordings. Capable of recording up to UHD 4K120 video and  8K photos through its incredible 1/1.3" sensor, this action camera is dedicated to producing clean, smooth detail throughout your footage. A super-wide 155° FOV ensures all of the action stays in frame, without missing a beat. For capturing vivid, colorful footage, the 10-bit D-Log M color mode provides over one billion colors and a wide 13.5-stop dynamic range, and even offers SuperNight mode for superior low-light performance. Subject tracking intelligently detects your subject and adjusts the composition, keeping them in frame for every important moment.

Dual OLED Screens. This camera features two OLED screen, a 2.5" OLED back touchscreen and a 1.46" front OLED screen. Turning your camera around to adjust parameter and settings is a thing of the past, as you can now facilitate all of that through both screens! When the camera is switched between horizontal and vertical orientations, the user interface adapts accordingly.

Balanced N’ Steady. The smart stabilization HorizonSteady feature removes shake from movement, and even horizontally corrects tilt at any angle in 2.7K60 video, producing clean and smooth footage through heavy bumps and 360° rotations. With HorizonBalancing, the camera will corrects the tilt horizontally within ±45° in 4K60 videos. Additionally, you can activate RockSteady 3.0 for a more immersive first-person perspective in up to 4K120.

Capture Features and Options. Looking to add some slo-mo in the mix? You can capture smooth, 1080p240 action footage with the Action 5 Pro’s 32x Super Slow Motion feature. The pre-record feature enables the camera to capture the moments leading up to the start of the official recording, and to speed up post-production editing, the highlight feature allows you to mark important moments in your footage.

Designed For Action. The Action 5 Pro features a magnetic quick release design to easily swap accessories and mounting options when needed. Whether you’re shooting vertical or horizontal, the protective frame has your back. An AF coating over the tempered glass ensures durability and responsiveness, even when wet! The camera is waterproof with a housing up to 65.6-feet, and with the optional waterproof housing, can be fully submerged up to 197-feet.

Battery, Memory, and Interface. Tagging along to provide power to the Action 5 Pro is the high-capacity Battery Plus, capable of fueling your adventures for up to 4 hours in temperatures as low as -4°F. Fast charging through the USB-C port allows you to power up the battery for a 2-hour charge in just 15 minutes. In addition to the internal 47GB storage, this camera features a microSD card slot that accepts cards up to 1TB. Over WiFi 6 and USB 3.0, you can quickly transfer files with speeds up to 80 MB/s, and even stream directly from the camera to your preferred platform. As for audio, you can utilize the three built-in omnidirectional microphones, connect to the optional DJI MIc 2, or connect an external microphone with a 3.5mm to USB-C adapter cable.

Mimo App. The DJI Mimo app unlocks the power of your smartphone to get the most out of the ACtion 5 Pro. It uses cloud computing and AI algorithms to eliminate the selfie stick for skiing and snowboarding scenarios, giving you breathtaking footage that looks like it was shot by a pro.', 1050000.0, '{"Brand": "DJI", "Camera Type": "Action", "Compatible Media": "microSD", "Display": "Display TypePrimary Monitor: Fixed 2.5\\" Touchscreen OLEDSecondary Monitor: Fixed 1.4\\" Touchscreen OLED ResolutionPrimary Monitor: 400 × 712Secondary Monitor: 342 × 342", "Environmental": "Operating Conditions-4 to 113°F  Environmental ResistanceWater-Resistant to 65.6’", "Exposure Control": "Shutter Speed1/8000 to 30 Seconds in Photo Mode ISO Sensitivity RangePhoto: 100 to 25,600Video: 100 to 51,200 Interval RecordingYes", "Features": "Scene ModesPresets – Yes Creative EffectsYes Built-In MicrophoneStereo Built-In SpeakerYes", "General": "Built-In LightLight – No Tripod Mounting ThreadNo Dimensions (W x H x D)1.7 × 1.3 × 2.8″", "Imaging": "Image Sensor1/1.3\\"-Type CMOS Sensor ResolutionEffective: 40 Megapixel (7296 × 5472) Image StabilizationDigital", "Interface": "Media/Memory Card SlotSingle Slot: microSD/microSDHC/microSDXC [1 TB Maximum] Video I/O1x USB-C 3.0 / 3.1/3.2 Gen 1 Output Audio I/ONo Power I/O1x USB-C Input Other I/O1x USB-C (USB 3.2 / 3.1 Gen 1) Data  Remote ControlMimo App (Optional) Mobile App CompatibleYes: Android & iOSApp Name: Mimo App WirelessWi-Fi 6 (802.11ax) / Bluetooth 5.1\\n*Built-In", "Internal Video Recording Modes": "H.265/MP43840 × 2880 at 23.98/25/29.97/47.95/50/59.94/100/120 fps 3840 × 2160 at 23.98/25/29.97/47.95/50/59.94/100/120 fps 2688 × 2016 at 23.98/25/29.97/47.95/50/59.94/100/120 fps 2688 × 1512 at 23.98/25/29.97/47.95/50/59.94/100/120 fps 1920 × 1080p at 23.98/25/29.97/47.95/50/59.94/100/120/200/240 fps", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "4K", "Optics": "Maximum Aperturef/2.8 Minimum Focus Distance1.15’ Fixed FocusYes Angle of View155° ZoomDigital: 2x", "Power": "Battery TypeRechargeable Lithium-Ion Battery Pack, 3.87 VDC, 1950 mAh Charging Time1 Hours Estimated Battery Life240 Hours", "Recording": "Still Image SupportJPEG / Raw: 40 MP (7296 × 5472) Audio RecordingAAC: -Channel 16-Bit48 kHz Internal Storage47 GB", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Fixed", "Sensor Size": "1-Inch", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'Includes

	DJI Osmo Action 5 Pro
	DJI Osmo Action 5 Pro Side Door
	DJI Osmo Action 3 / Action 4 Quick Release Adapter Mount
	DJI Osmo Action 5 Pro Glass Lens Cover
