Built-In ND & Consistent Filter Thread Sizes. DJI included a built-in ND 4 filter on this lens. That should help with achieving cinematic shutter speeds while in sunny conditions without the need for additional filters. If additional filters are something you’re interested in, you’ll be happy to know that all of DJI’s DL lenses have consistent thread sizes of 46mm.', 2150000.0, '{"Aperture": "f/2.8-f/16", "Brand": "DJI", "Filter Diameter": "46mm", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "DJI DL", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle"}', 'Includes

