INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (667, 2, 15, 'DZOFilm X-Tract 18-28mm T8 FF 360° Probe Zoom (PL)', 'dzofilm-x-tract-18-28mm-t8-ff-360deg-probe-zoom-pl', 'The DZOFilm X-Tract 18-28mm T8 FF 360° Probe Zoom (PL) is a compact periscope lens designed with complete 360° rotation and a 2.1:1 magnification ratio to capture immersive & creative macro imaging. Key features include:

Standard 0.8 MOD FIZ gears
Full-Frame | T8 to T22 aperture
Versatile 73 to 100° angle of view
0.24" minimum focusing distance

Macro Madness. Immerse yourself in a world of macro cinematography with this DZOFilm X-Tract 18-28mm T8 FF 360° Probe Zoom (PL)! Design to cover full-frame cinema camera sensors, the X-Tract features a stunning 0.2" minimum focusing distance, 2.1:1 magnification, and a wide T8 to T22 aperture. Capture anything from individual sand grains to an action-packed bank heist, the creative flow belongs to you here.

Balanced Optics. A balanced combination of prism structure, a 360° rotating ring, and a smooth 300° focus throw ensures precision focus control and even more flexibility with what you can create. With the addition of native breath control, the lens’ breathing effects are reduced to 0.5%, reducing the amount of work in post-production. A relative illumination of 68.6% guarantees a bright, brag-worthy performance.

Roll Through It. This periscope lens depends on its slim profile,16.3" length, and 360° rotation to capture these creative shots. The 360° front lens element paired with its impressive focusing distance and magnification ratio can take that immersion even further to create a seamless “barrel roll” effect!

Ultimate Protection. Constructed from aerospace-grade aluminum alloy with a 25μm anodized coating, the X-Tract maintains a low weight and tough exterior. The lens body’s IP57-rating confirms protection against dust and water, and is also waterproof up to 11". For consistently clear imaging, the front lens element is equipped with a hydrophobic anti-fog coating.

More Options Available! Alongside this 360° X-Tract, we also have the DZOFilm X-Tract 18-28mm T8 FF 90° Probe Zoom – PL.', 5725000.0, '{"Angle of View": "100-73°", "Aperture Blades": "10", "Brand": "DZOFilm", "Dimensions": "1.2 × 16.3″ (ø x L)", "Focal Length": "18-28", "Focus Rotation": "300º", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Front Lens Diameter": "30mm", "Gearing": "0.8 MOD zoom, focus, iris", "Groups/Elements": "20/27", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "PL", "Lens Type": "Specialty, Ultra Wide Angle, Wide Angle, Cine, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "8.0", "Maximum Magnification": "0.47x", "Mfr. Model Number": "DZO-X1828C", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "0.2\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "2.38 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	DZOFilm X-Tract 18-28mm T8 FF 360° Probe Zoom (PL)
	Front & rear caps
	Rotating optical block
	90/360º slip-on protector filter
	(2) 48mm mounting rings
