Balanced Optics. A balanced combination of prism structure, a rotating ring, and a smooth 300° focus throw ensures precision focus control and even more flexibility with what you can create. With the addition of native breath control, the lens’ breathing effects are reduced to 0.5%, reducing the amount of work in post-production. A relative illumination of 68.6% guarantees a bright, brag-worthy performance.

