Ultimate Protection. Constructed from aerospace-grade aluminum alloy with a 25μm anodized coating, the X-Tract maintains a low weight and tough exterior. The lens body’s IP57-rating confirms protection against dust and water, and is also waterproof up to 11-inches. For consistently clear imaging, the front lens element is equipped with a hydrophobic anti-fog coating.

More Options Available! Alongside this 90° X-Tract, we also have the DZOFilm X-Tract 18-28mm T8 FF 360° Probe Zoom – PL.', 5275000.0, '{"Angle of View": "100-73º", "Aperture Blades": "10", "Brand": "DZOFilm", "Dimensions": "1.2 × 16.3″ (ø x L)", "Focal Length": "18-28", "Focus Rotation": "300º", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Front Lens Diameter": "30mm", "Gearing": "0.8 MOD zoom, focus, iris", "Groups/Elements": "19/26", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "PL", "Lens Type": "Specialty, Ultra Wide Angle, Macro, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "8.0", "Maximum Magnification": "1.56x", "Mfr. Model Number": "DZO-X1828B", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "0.2\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "2.4 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	DZOFilm X-Tract 18-28mm T8 FF 90° Probe Zoom (PL)
	Front & rear caps
	DZOFilm X-Tract 18-28mm T8 optical block
	DZOFilm X-Tract slip-on protective filter
	DZOFilm X-Tract 32.5mm slip-on protective filter
	(2) DZOFilm X-Tract 48mm mounting rings
