	Freefly NATO Rail Clamp
	Freefly Cheese Plate for Ember Camera
	Freefly Adjustable Accessory Mount
	(2) Anton Bauer Titon Micro 90 V-Mount Battery
	Anton Bauer VM2 Dual V-Mount Charger w/ 4-Pin XLR Output', 27775000.0, '{"Brand": "Freefly", "Camera Mount": "Canon EF", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Item Type": "Camera"}', 'Includes

Freefly Ember S5K with Active EF Mount and 2.56TB pSLC
