Freefly NATO Rail Clamp
Freefly Cheese Plate for Ember Camera
Freefly Adjustable Accessory Mount
(2) Anton Bauer Titon Micro 90 V-Mount Battery
Anton Bauer VM2 Dual V-Mount Charger w/ 4-Pin XLR Output



