INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (678, 1, 18, 'Freefly Ember S5K with Active EF Mount and 2.56TB pSLC', 'freefly-ember-s5k-with-active-ef-mount-and-2-56tb-pslc', 'The Freefly Ember S5K with Active EF Mount and 2.56TB pSLC is a compact drone camera capable of capturing high-resolution, high-speed 5K video at at 600 fps through its Gpixel S35 sensor. Key features include:

Active EF mount
High-speed compact S35 drone camera
USB-C 3.2 data output
1080p24 HDMI preview

Capture high-resolution, high-speed 5K drone video with the Ember S5K Camera from FREEFLY. The compact S35 camera is designed for continuous high-speed recording and is small enough to mount as a drone payload. The Gpixel S35 sensor captures up to 5K resolution at 600 fps or up to 4K800 to capture clear high-speed slow-motion video. This S5K model features an Active EF mount for use with a variety of EF stock lenses, and it has a global shutter.

Ember Easy. The Freefly Ember S5K with Active EF Mount and 2.56TB pSLC is a perfect match for anyone from professional videographers to novice beginners. Offering a quick 2-second boot-up and continuous recording, you’ll find that operating this camera is a breeze. There aren’t too many confusing buttons and switches on the Ember, it provides the basics: the power switch, record button, select button, and scroll wheel.

High-Res, High-Speed. The Ember’s Gpixel S35 sensor is capable of recording and capturing 5K full resolution up to 600 fps or 4K up to 800 fps, helping this compact camera pack a punch. This camera offers pre-recording from 1 second to up to 2 hours, and allows you to preview your image using the available HDMI output and a separately available 1080p monitor.

Techy Talk. This tiny camera offers more than meets the eye, inside and out. An internal 2.56TB pSLC M.2 SSD captures and saves your work, while the USB-C or Gigabit Ethernet ports assist with transferring your data. This camera offers Wifi control via an iOS/iPadOS/macOS app workflow, but you also have the option of utilizing the 6-pin GPIO port to remotely control start/stop/sync functions. An included 4-pin to D-Tap cable is used to power the camera.

Pre-Record. By setting a buffer time window and arming the camera, the Ember can preemptively save potentially important frames to memory ensuring you don’t miss the action.

Add-Ons and More. Featuring an active EF mount and global shutter, the Ember accepts a wide variety of EF stock lenses. It also accepts a variety of Ember accessories, like the Freefly NATO Rail for Ember S5K and Wave, Freefly Cheese Plate for Ember Camera, and Freefly NATO Rail Clamp.', 26550000.0, '{"Brand": "Freefly", "Camera Mount": "Canon EF", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Compatible Media": "Internal Storage", "Dimensions": "4.3 × 4.1 × 3.9″", "Exposure Control": "Shutter TypeMechanical Focal Plane Shutter and Electronic Global Shutter ISO Sensitivity RangeVideo: 100 to 400 Advertised Dynamic Range11 Stops", "Imaging": "Lens MountActive Canon EF Lens CommunicationYes Sensor ResolutionEffective: 21 Megapixel (5120 × 4096) Image SensorSize-Unspecified CMOS Image StabilizationNo Built-In ND FilterNo Internal Filter HolderNo Capture TypeVideo Only", "Interface": "Media/Memory Card SlotNo Internal Memory2.56 TB Video I/O1x USB-C 3.0 / 3.1/3.2 Gen 1 Input/Output1x HDMI (Unspecified Signal) Output Power I/O1x Molex 4-Pin Input Other I/O1x 6-Pin (GPI) Control Input/Output WirelessWi-Fi 5 (802.11ac) Video Output, Control Mobile App CompatibleYes: iOS Only Global Positioning (GPS, GLONASS, etc.)No", "Internal Video Recording Modes": "ProRes 10-Bit5120 × 4096 up to 600 fpsDCI 4K (4096 × 2160) up to 800 fps", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "5K", "Operating Temperature": "32 to 104°F", "Sensor Size": "Super35", "Stabilization": "No", "Video Capture": "External Recording ModesNo Fast-/Slow-Motion SupportYes IP StreamingNo", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi"}', 'Includes

	Freefly Ember S5K w/ Active Mount Port (2.56TB pSLC)
	Freefly Ember Active EF Mount
	Freefly Ember Locking EF Mount Cap
	Freefly 4-Pin Microfit Male D-Tap Cable 8"
	Freefly Ember Rear Accessory Mount (Top)
	Freefly Ember Rear Accessory Mount (Bottom)
