Standard Zoom. With a focal range equivalent to 25-51mm after sensor crop factor, the GF 32-64mm f/4 R LM WR is Fuji’s go-to (and only) zoom lens for the GFX mirrorless.  The constant f/4 aperture isn’t designed for low-light shooting, rather consistent exposure for still and video shooting.

Build Quality. Like the GFX, Fuji’s GF lenses are dust and weather-sealed for shooting in challenging conditions.  Each lens features a manual aperture ring with new C (Command) position to allow aperture adjustment via command dial.', 3325000.0, '{"Brand": "Fuji", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Fuji G", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle"}', 'Includes

