Nifty Fifty (Equivalent). With a focal length equivalent to 50mm after sensor crop factor, the GF 63mm f/2.8 R WR is the go-to standard prime for the GFX mirrorless.  The f/2.8 aperture isn’t going to be optimal for candlelight portraiture, but it will allow pretty good low-light performance within reason.

Build Quality. Like the GFX, Fuji’s GF lenses are dust and weather-sealed for shooting in challenging conditions.  Each lens features a manual aperture ring with new C (Command) position to allow aperture adjustment via command dial.', 2300000.0, '{"Angle of View": "46.9°", "Brand": "Fuji", "Dimensions": "Length: 2.8\\"", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Fuji G", "Lens Type": "Standard", "Mfr. Model Number": "600018250"}', 'Includes

