Fast, Versatile Short-Portrait Prime. With its 63mm equivalent focal length, f/1.7 maximum aperture, and precise autofocus system, the Fuji GF 80mm f/1.7 R WR is an excellent choice for portraiture, wedding photography, group shots, everyday shooting, and working in low light. Its rounded nine-blade diaphragm helps to produce pleasing bokeh, and its bright maximum aperture gives you extensive depth-of-field control for precise selective-focus applications.

Advanced Optical Design. This lens’s nine-group/twelve-element optical design features one aspherical element and two extra-low dispersion elements to ensure maximum sharpness while combatting spherical and chromatic aberrations.

Compact Focusing Group. The compact focusing group gives you fast, smooth, and quiet autofocus performance while providing consistency throughout the focusing range, while the physical aperture ring gives you intuitive control over exposure settings.

Weather-Resistant Build. The GF 80mm f/1.7’s dust-, freeze-, and weather-resistant body protects it from inclement conditions and lets you work in temperatures down to 14° F. The lens’s front element has a fluorine coating that helps keep it debris- and moisture-free.', 3250000.0, '{"Angle of View": "37.7°", "Aperture Blades": "9, Rounded", "Brand": "Fuji", "Groups/Elements": "9/12", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Fuji G", "Lens Type": "Standard", "Maximum Magnification": "0.15x", "Mfr. Model Number": "600022103"}', 'Includes

