	Pearstone USB 3.2 Gen 2 Type-C Female to Type-A Male Adapter', 11675000.0, '{"Brand": "Fuji", "Camera Mount": "Fuji G", "Camera Type": "Medium Format", "Compatible Media": "SD", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "4K", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Tilt", "Sensor Size": "Medium Format", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Viewfinder Type": "Electronic", "Weight": "1.8 lb.", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'Includes

Fuji GFX 100S II Medium Format Mirrorless
