	58mm protective filter
	Lens pouch', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (748, 2, 19, 'Fuji XF 23mm f/2 R WR', 'fuji-xf-23mm-f-2-r-wr', 'The Fuji XF 23mm f/2 R WR is a moderately wide-angle lens for Fuji X-mount cameras. Key features include:

Versatile 35mm focal length
Shallow depth of field and great low-light performance
Fast, nearly silent autofocus system
High-quality optics

35mm Focal Length. The Fuji XF 23mm f/2 R WR lens offers a 35mm field of view based on full-frame equivalent. The 35mm focal length is one of the most useful for just about any type of photography, and is particularly popular with street shooters.

Fast Aperture. The fast f/2 aperture not only provides a very pleasing shallow depth of field and enables shooting in low-lighting conditions.

Fast, Silent Autofocus Motor. The internal focusing system uses a stepping motor to deliver nearly silent and super-fast autofocusing. When combined with phase-detection autofocus from the camera body, this lens can grab focus in 0.05 seconds.

High-Quality Optics and Build. Two aspherical elements and a Super Electron Beam Coating provide high image quality with reduced flare and ghosting. The metal barrel makes for a solid, sturdy lens that feels responsive, and the nine-blade rounded diaphragm produces images with smooth, out-of-focus highlights.

All-Weather Gear. With multiple weather seals on the lens barrel, there’s little reason to worry about dust, moisture, and even temperatures down to 14°F.', 825000.0, '{"Angle of View": "63.4°", "Aperture": "f/2-16", "Brand": "Fuji", "Dimensions": "Length: 2.04\\"", "Focusing System": "Internal stepping AF", "Groups/Elements": "6/10", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Fuji X", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle", "Mfr. Model Number": "16523169"}', 'Includes

