High-Quality Optics. This lens’s optical design includes one aspherical element and two extra-low dispersion elements to help to minimize chromatic aberrations and distortions for increased clarity and sharpness. A Super Electron Beam Coating keeps ghosting and flare under control while improving contrast and color fidelity.

Stay in Focus. The XF 50mm f/1.0 features a fast and accurate autofocus system that delivers smooth, incredibly quiet performance. The 2.3-foot minimum focusing distance lets you get reasonably close to your subject.

All-Weather Gear. The weather-sealed lens barrel means there’s little reason to worry about dust, moisture, or even freezing temperatures.', 2150000.0, '{"Brand": "Fuji", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Fuji X", "Lens Type": "Standard"}', 'Includes

