Telephoto-Range Zoom. With a 35mm-format focal-length equivalency of 84-305mm, the XF 55-200mm is great for daytime sports, wildlife, and travel photography.

Optical Image Stabilization. The in-lens stabilizer provides up to 4.5 stops of correction, enabling handheld shooting at relatively low shutter speeds. Combined with the f/3.5-4.8 aperture, the lens can be stretched for use in moderately low light.

