High-Quality Build. The metal barrel with metal focusing and aperture rings gives this lens a substantial feel, yet it’s relatively lightweight for its range.', 1300000.0, '{"Angle of View": "29° – 8.1°", "Brand": "Fuji", "Dimensions": "Length: 4.65\\"", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Fuji X", "Lens Type": "Telephoto and Supertelephoto", "Mfr. Model Number": "16384941"}', 'Includes

