High-Quality Optics. This lens’s eight-group/thirteen-element optical design includes two aspherical elements and one extra-low dispersion element to help to minimize chromatic aberrations and distortions for increased clarity and sharpness. A Super Electron Beam Coating keeps ghosting and flare under control while improving contrast and color fidelity.

Stay in Focus. The XF 56mm f/1.2 features a fast and accurate autofocus system that delivers smooth, incredibly quiet performance. The 1.6-foot minimum focusing distance lets you get close to your subject.

All-Weather Gear. The weather-sealed lens barrel means there’s little reason to worry about dust, moisture, or even freezing temperatures.', 1725000.0, '{"Angle of View": "28.5°", "Aperture Blades": "11, Rounded", "Brand": "Fuji", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Fuji X", "Lens Type": "Telephoto", "Maximum Magnification": "0.14x", "Mfr. Model Number": "16780028", "Optical Design": "Groups/Elements8/13Aspherical Elements2Extra-Low Dispersion Elements1", "Physical": "Dimensions (ø x L)3.1 × 3.0″Weight1.0 lb."}', 'Includes

