Stay in Focus. The XF 8mm f/3.5 features a fast and accurate autofocus system that delivers smooth, incredibly quiet performance. The 7.1-inch minimum focusing distance lets you get close to your subject.

All-Weather Gear. The weather-sealed lens barrel means there’s little reason to worry about dust, moisture, or even freezing temperatures.', 1350000.0, '{"Angle of View": "121°", "Aperture Blades": "9, Rounded", "Brand": "Fuji", "General": "Dimensions (o x L) – lens only2.7 × 2.1″ / 68.0 × 52.8mmWeight – lens only0.5 lb.", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Fuji X", "Lens Type": "Ultra Wide Angle", "Maximum Magnification": "0.07x", "Mfr. Model Number": "16797760"}', 'Includes

