High-Quality Build and Optics. The XF 90mm’s weather-sealed construction helps protect it from dust, moisture, and extreme temperatures. The eight-group/eleven-element optical formula uses three extra-low dispersion elements to help minimize chromatic aberrations and distortion and deliver high image quality. Fuji’s Super EBC coating combats ghosting and flare.', 1650000.0, '{"Brand": "Fuji", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Fuji X", "Lens Type": "Telephoto"}', 'Includes

