Fujinon 20-120mm T3.5 Cabrio Premier PL. The Fujinon 20-120mm T3.5 Cabrio Premier is an ENG-style motorized zoom lens for high-end productions. It features a detachable ENG-style hand grip with a zoom rocker and  is designed specifically for image sensors measuring 27.45 × 15.44mm and smaller.

SS-15D Control Kit. The Fujinon SS-15D includes a focus position demand unit, a zoom rate demand unit, two mounting clamps, and two 12-pin communication cables. It provides remote control over the focus and zoom of the 20-120mm T3.5 Cabrio for smooth and precise adjustments.', 17875000.0, '{"Angle of View": "63º41’-11º49’", "Aperture Blades": "9", "Brand": "Fujinon", "Dimensions": "4.5 × 8.9″ (ø x L)", "Filter Type": "Matte Box Mount", "Focal Length": "20-120", "Focus Rotation": "200º", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Front Lens Diameter": "114mm", "Gearing": "0.8 MOD zoom, focus, iris", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Super35 and APS-C", "Lens Mount": "PL", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle, Standard, Telephoto, Broadcast, Cine, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "3.5", "Mfr. Part Number": "XK6X20, SS-15D", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "2.8’", "Parfocal/Varifocal": "Parfocal", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "6.4 lb.", "Zoom Ratio": "6x", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

