INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (811, 1, 22, 'GoPro MAX2 360', 'gopro-max2-360', 'The GoPro MAX2 360 is a compact action cam capable of capturing 8K footage, a jump from the previous 5.6K-capable GoPro MAX 360. Key features include:

HyperSmooth stabilization; Horizon lock
Up to 8K 360° video; 29MP 360° photos
Timecode sync, app, and voice control
Rugged design; Waterproof down to 16ft

What’s Changed? Capture immersive 360° video, photo, and audio for any adventure with the sleek GoPro MAX2 360! Built on the capabilities of the previous-generation MAX 360, this camera takes a stance with its 8K video capture, incredible night and light effects, more digital lens options, 360 TimeWarp video, night-lapse video, a massive 29.5MP max photo resolution, a larger touchscreen display, and much more!

8K Video Capture, 29MP Still Image Capture. Coming in at a whopping 0.43 pounds, this action camera bridges portability and convenience with immersive 8K30 360° video and 4K60 single-lens video. Through its 1/2.3" sensor and dual lenses, your footage makes a crisp and detailed debut, while support from HyperSmooth stabilization and Horizon Lock ensures a straight, shake-free experience. Alongside video capture, this camera also delivers 29MP 360° photos and 12MP single-lens photos. Get creative  with the flexibility to crop, zoom, and reframe your shots!

Effects and Modes. Life doesn’t have to move too fast here. With a catalog of effects not previously available, you have access to creative opportunities such as UHD 4K100 recording in 3x slow motion and 5.6K60 video in 2x slow motion! Engage MotionFrame to accurately keyframe and edit your favorite shots within 360 footage from your phone, or CameraFX to deliver Spin, Flip, Roll, Wobble, Tiny Planet, and more effects. The fast lane doesn’t end with this generation, though. TimeWarp, Time-Lapse, and Night-Lapse modes all speed up footage while retaining that smooth 8K resolution, while effects such as Star Trails, Light Painting, and Vehicle Light Trails deliver stunning nighttime creations.

Audio All Around. To complement your immersive spherical video, this camera also features spherical audio recording. Using six internal microphones, every direction is covered to create an entirely immersive, surround-sound experience.

GoPro Quik App. Access to more tools and editing opportunities can be found in the GoPro Quik App, available for iOS and Android devices! This app gives you immediate access to everything you’ll need from basic post-production editing tools to uploading & sharing your memories with friends.

Fueled by Enduro. This camera uses one included AMBAT-001 Enduro Battery to power you through up to 90 of uninterrupted adventure. Recharging with the included LR Thunderbolt 5 USB Cable 3ft is quick and easy, taking just around 2 hours. Need something quicker? Check out the GoPro Dual Battery Charger for MAX2 360.

Some Things Are Worth Keeping. Retaining the waterproof depths of its predecessor, this camera also features the classic 1/4"-20 mounting thread and folding fingers combo. This updated version even supports compatibility with GoPro’s Magnetic Latch line of accessories! Hands-free filming? Don’t fret, you can still announce up to 13 voice commands in over 11 languages and six accents.

Add-On Mounting Available. To expand mounting opportunities for this rental, we have the GoPro Mounts and Parts Grab Bag available separately.', 1175000.0, '{"Brand": "GoPro", "Camera Type": "Action", "Compatible Media": "microSD", "Imaging": "Image Sensor1/2.3\\" Lens ApertureF1.8 Image ProcessorGP2 35mm Equivalent Focal LengthMin = 14mmMax = 26mm", "Inputs/Outputs": "USB-C (3.0)", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "4K and 8K", "Photo Modes": "(360:) Photo, Burst Photo, Night Photo(Single-Lens:)Photo", "Photo Resolution": "(360:) 29MP (7680×3840) (Single-Lens:) 12MP (4000×3000)", "Physical": "Dimensions (W x H x D)2.5 x  2.74 × 1.9″ Weight0.43 lb", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen", "Sensor Size": "1-Inch", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Still Image Capture": "Photo Frame-Grabs from VideoUp to 12MP from 4K (4:3) Video Photo OutputStandard, RAW (Single Lens) Photo Formats .36P .JPG .GPR Photo Aspect Ratio4:3 Digital Lenses (single photo)Ultra WideWideLinear Burst Photo Rates (Frames / Second)360: 29MP Photos @ 5/1, 10/1, 10/3; 30/3, 30/6 Night Photo Shutter SpeedAuto, 2, 5, 10, 15, 20, 30 sec.", "Video Capture": "Aspect Ratio16:9, 9:16, 4:3 Video Compression StandardH.265 (HEVC) Digital LensesMax HyperView (16:9 only)Max SuperView (16:9 only)Ultra WideWideLinear POV & Selfie Modes (360:)8K: @ 30/25/24 fps5.6K: @ 60/50/30/25 fps4K: @ 100/90/60/50 fps", "Video Resolution": "(360:)8K: (7680×3840) @ 30/25/24 fps5.6K: (5376×2688) @ 60/50/30/25 fps4K: (3328×1664) @ 100/90/60/50 fps (Single-Lens:)4K: (16:9) (3840×2160) @ 60/50/30/25/24 fps4K: (9:16) (2160×3840) @ 60/50/30/25/24 fps4K: (4:3) (4000×3000) @ 60/50/30/25/24 fps1080p: (16:9) (1920×1080) @ 60/50 fps1080p: (9:16) (1080×1920) @ 60/50 fps", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'Includes

