If the listed rental price increases between your preorder and ship dates, don’t worry—you’ll be locked in at your original pre-order price. And if the price decreases, you’ll still pay the lower price. We’ll always contact you to confirm pricing before we ship your order.

Compact Cinematic Capture. Designed to throttle you through any mission, the GoPro MISSION 1 series packs a serious punch on land and under the sea. Along with its MISSION 1 Pro and MISSION 1 Pro ILS counterparts, this action camera delivers cinematic 8K30 video capture and 50MP stills through a 1-inch sensor. Although the entire series is capable of 8K capture, only the Pro and Pro ILS have 8K Open Gate capabilities.', 1350000.0, '{"Brand": "GoPro", "Camera Type": "Action", "Item Type": "Camera"}', 'Includes

