Build Quality. Hasselblad has designed the XCD lens to pair perfectly with the X1D camera. It has a smaller form factor, internal focusing, and a Central Lens Shutter system that can sync up to 1/2000 of a second.', 6275000.0, '{"Angle of View": "77° to 41°", "Brand": "Hasselblad", "Flash Synchronization": "Shutter speed up to 1/2000", "Groups/Elements": "13/15", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Hasselblad X", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle and Standard", "Maximum Magnification": "0.118 to 0.154x", "Mfr. Model Number": "CP.HB.00000418.01"}', 'Includes

