Please Note. If you have a pacemaker, please do not wear GO 3 on your chest or use the Magnet Pendant due to its magnetism.', 875000.0, '{"Battery": "BatteryRechargeable Battery Pack, 1270 mAhMax Runtime: 2.5 Hours per ChargeBattery Charge Time: 1 hours Charging MethodUSB Charging Time1 Hours", "Brand": "Insta360", "Camera Type": "Action", "Compatible Media": "microSD", "Connectors": "Inputs1 x USB-C 3.1/3.2 Gen 2 On Charge Case Outputs1 x USB-C 3.0 / 3.1/3.2 Gen 1 On Charge Case Microphone InputNo Headphone JackNo", "Display": "Display TypeFixed LCD Display Size2.2\\" Secondary DisplayNo Shutter Speed1/8000 to 1/30 Seconds in Video Mode", "Exposure Control": "ISO Sensitivity RangePhoto/Video: 100 to 3200 in Manual Mode Exposure ModesModes: Auto Shooting ModesAction FreezeSuper Slow Motion MovieTime-Lapse Movie Remote ControlNo", "Features": "Image StabilizationDigital Scene ModesPreset: Yes Environmental ProtectionAdvertised as Submersible to 16.4’\\nManufacturer Testing: IPX4 White Balance ModesAutoCustom  Creative EffectsYes Built-In MicYes Built-In SpeakerNo Built-In Light/FlashLight – NoFlash – No Wireless5 GHz Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0 Mobile App CompatibleYes: Android & iOSFunctionality: Access Stored Files, Adjust Settings, Firmware Update, Remote Control, Setup, View Live Feed\\nAs of June, 2023: Check with manufacturer for the most up-to-date compatibility Accessory ShoeNo Tripod Mounting ThreadNo", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "2K", "Operating Temperature": "-4 to 104°F", "Optics": "35mm-Equivalent Focal Length11.24mmMaximum Aperturef/2.2Fixed FocusYes", "Physical": "Dimensions (W x H x D)2.1 × 1 × 0.9″ (Without Protrusions)2.5 × 1.8 × 1.2″ (With Protrusions) Weight1.3 oz (Body Only)3.4 oz", "Recording": "Media/Memory Card SlotNo Internal Storage64 GB Video Format2720 × 1536 at 24/25/30 fps (80 Mb/s MP4)2560 × 1440p at 24/25/30 fps (80 Mb/s MP4)1920 × 1080p at 24/25/30 fps (80 Mb/s MP4) Slow Motion Mode120 fps Recorded at 1920 × 1080p Cha