	Insta360 Quick Reader for X3
	Insta360 Microphone Adapter for X3

Please Note This rental will need a microSD card rented separately in order to record. You can find some great options in the Recommended section on your screen!', 3650000.0, '{"360 Stitched Video Formats": "5760 × 2880 at 24, 25, 30 fps4096 × 2160 at 30, 60 fps", "Battery Life": "1.4 Hours per Charge", "Brand": "Insta360", "Camera Type": "360", "Charging Method": "USB", "Compatible Media": "microSD", "Focal Length": "6.7mm (35mm Equivalent Focal Length: 6.7mm)", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "5K", "Memory Card Slot": "microSD", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Fixed", "Sensor Size": "1-Inch", "Stitching Resolution": "5.7K (Video)", "Video Format": "4096 × 2160 at 24/25/30 fps (MP4)3592 × 1320 at 24/25/30/50/60 fps (MP4)2704 × 1520 at 24/25/30/50/60 fps (MP4)1920 × 1080p at 24/25/30/50/60 fps (MP4)", "Waterproof Depth Rating": "33.0’", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'Includes

Insta360 X3
Selfie Stick + Tripod
(3) Batteries
Fast Charging Hub
 ZILR Type-C to USB Type-C Male Cable (3.3’)
Type-C Wall Charger
