	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	Leica E39 UVa II filter
	Lens pouch', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (889, 2, 29, 'Leica 50mm f/0.95 Noctilux-M for Leica M', 'leica-50mm-f-0-95-noctilux-m-for-leica-m', 'The Leica 50mm f/0.95 Noctilux-M for Leica M is a specially designed optic with exceptional depth-of-field control. Key features include:

Outstanding image quality, even at close distances
Great for portraits and detailed studies
Excellent low-light performance
Extremely shallow depth of field

Excellent Portrait Lens. The Leica 50mm f/0.95 Noctilux-M ASPH has extremely shallow depth of field at open aperture, which produces unequaled portraits and detailed studies. Even when just slightly stopped down, the result is outstanding image quality comparable to the Leica 50mm f/2 APO-Summicron ASPH, which is considered the best standard lens ever produced.

Superior Low-Light Performance. When used in available-light photography, the lens exceeds the perception of the human eye. Even the light from one candle can be sufficient for handheld photography with this lens. A “floating element” retains high image quality even in close-up range. Vignetting and distortion have also been visibly improved compared to the 50mm f/1.0.', 14425000.0, '{"Angle of View": "47 degrees", "Brand": "Leica", "Dimensions": "Length: 3\\"", "Filter Style": "Nonrotating", "Groups/Elements": "5/8", "Hood Included": "No", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Leica M", "Lens Type": "Standard", "Maximum Magnification": "0.059x", "Mfr. Model Number": "11602"}', 'Includes

	Leica 50mm f/0.95 Noctilux-M for Leica M
	Front & rear caps
	Leica E60 UVa II filter
	Hard case', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (890, 2, 29, 'Leica 50mm f/1.2 Noctilux-M for Leica M', 'leica-50mm-f-1-2-noctilux-m-for-leica-m', 'The Leica 50mm f/1.2 Noctilux-M for Leica M is an exceptionally fast M-mount portrait lens that offers superior low-light performance and a unique aesthetic. Key features include:

Slightly soft, dreamlike, otherworldly image quality
Ideal for portrait photography
Excellent low-light and hand-held performance
Advanced optical design for high clarity and contrast

Unique Portrait Lens. The Leica 50mm f/1.2 Noctilux-M’s razor-thin depth of field provides extremely precise subject/background isolation, making it a perfect lens for portraiture. Images captured at an open aperture have a slightly soft, dreamlike quality, but this lens is also fantastic for everyday shooting.

Superior Low-Light Performance. The ultra-fast f/1.2 aperture provides the flexibility to shoot hand-held in even the lowest of light, while the rounded sixteen-blade diaphragm helps create exquisite bokeh when you’re using selective-focusing techniques. When used for available-light photography, the lens exceeds the perception of the human eye. Even the light from one candle can be sufficient for handheld photography with the 50mm f/1.2.

Advanced Optical Design. This lens’s complex four-group/six-element optical design includes two large-diameter aspherical elements to produce incredible sharpness, clarity, and contrast, all while eliminating aberrations.', 9550000.0, '{"Angle of View": "45.6°", "Aperture Blades": "16", "Brand": "Leica", "Groups/Elements": "4/6", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Leica M", "Lens Type": "Standard", "Mfr. Model Number": "11686"}', 'Includes

	Leica 50mm f/1.2 Noctilux-M for Leica M
	Hood
	E49 UV fiter
	Front & rear caps', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (891, 2, 29, 'Leica 50mm f/1.4 ASPH Summilux-SL for L-Mount', 'leica-50mm-f-1-4-asph-summilux-sl-for-l-mount', 'The Leica 50mm f/1.4 ASPH Summilux-SL for L-Mount is a fast prime lens designed for L-mount cameras. Key features include:

Fast Aperture Normal Angle Lens
High Quality Optics
Solid Build
Leica L-mount

Normal Angle. When used on a full-frame camera, the Leica 50mm f/1.4 ASPH Summilux-SL’s 50mm focal length offers a normal field of view that’s useful for just about any type of photography. With an APS-C sensor camera, you’ll have a portrait-range focal length of about 75mm. The fast f/1.4 aperture offers both great low-light performance and shallow depth-of-field control.

High Quality Optics. The lens features 11 elements in 9 groups, including two aspherical and four anomalous partial dispersion elements that cut down on aberrations, while keeping pictures sharp and clear. A multi-layer coating minimizes the effects of flaring and ghosting.

Solid Build. This über nifty fifty is built like a tank. Its weather-sealing keeps out dust and moisture. An internal focusing system doesn’t rotate the front filter ring, which makes the lens fully capable of working with circular polarizers, graduated ND Filters, and variable ND Filters.', 7525000.0, '{"Angle of View": "47.9º", "Autofocus": "Autofocus", "Brand": "Leica", "Dimensions": "Length: 4.88\\"", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "L", "Lens Type": "Standard", "Mfr. Model Number": "11180"}', 'Includes

	Leica 50mm f/1.4 ASPH Summilux-SL for L-Mount
	Front & rear caps
	E82 UVa II filter
	Lens hood', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (892, 2, 29, 'Leica 50mm f/1.4 Summilux-M ASPH for Leica M (2023)', 'leica-50mm-f-1-4-summilux-m-asph-for-leica-m-2023', 'The Leica 50mm f/1.4 Summilux-M ASPH for Leica M (2023) is a versatile, fast-aperture, standard-length prime designed for Leica M-mount cameras that features a redesigned housing and an updated optical design. Key features include:

Great for portraiture, detailed studies, and reportage
Shallow depth of field and great low-light performance
High-contrast images with excellent color rendition
Edge correction for vignetting on compatible cameras

Fast Standard-Length Prime. The Leica 50mm f/1.4 Summilux-M ASPH’s versatile focal length is great for portraiture, detailed photographic studies, reportage, and just about any application you can throw at it. Its f/1.4 aperture enables extensive depth-of-field control and great low-light performance, while its eleven-blade diaphragm gives you pleasing, rounded bokeh when you’re shooting at middle aperture values. A built-in extendable lens hood shields the front element to reduce flare and ghosting.

Updated Optical Design. As part of the Summilux family, the 50mm f/1.4 features top-of-the-line optics. Its five-group/eight-element optical design incorporates an aspherical element to minimize aberrations and distortion while producing high-contrast images with accurate color reproduction.

Improved Focusing. This lens’s double-cam mechanism gives you an improved 1.5-foot minimum focusing distance that lets you get in close when you’re using cameras that feature live view, or when you’re using the Leica Visoflex 2 Electronic Viewfinder or the Leica FOTOS app. The 50mm still only supports rangefinder focusing down to 2.3 feet, and you must use live-view focusing between 2.3 feet and 1.5 feet.

Optimized For Leica. This lens uses 6-bit encoding to provide automatic edge correction for vignetting on compatible Leica M-mount cameras. Please note that if you’re using this lens with an adapter on a mirrorless camera, the camera won’t transmit EXIF data.', 6050000.0, '{"Angle of View": "45.4°", "Brand": "Leica", "General": "Dimensions (ø x L) – lens only2.3 × 2.3″ / 58.6 × 59.3mmWeight – lens only0.7 lb. / 337 g", "Hood Included": "No", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Leica M", "Lens Type": "Standard", "Maximum Magnification": "0.16x", "Mfr. Model Number": "11728", "Optical Design": "Groups/Elements5/8Aspherical Elements1Diaphragm Blades11"}', 'Includes

