	Hood (built-in)
	49mm protective filter
	Lens pouch', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (899, 2, 29, 'Leica 75mm f/2 ASPH APO-Summicron-SL for L-Mount', 'leica-75mm-f-2-asph-apo-summicron-sl-for-l-mount', 'The Leica 75mm f/2 ASPH APO-Summicron-SL for L-Mount is a short-tele prime designed for L-mount cameras. Key features include:

Versatile short-tele prime that’s great in low light
Advanced optical system for exceptional sharpness
Fast, precise, and nearly silent autofocusing
Durable, weather-sealed design

Versatile Short Telephoto Prime. The Leica 75mm f/2 APO Summicron ASPH’s long focal length, which splits the difference between normal and telephoto, makes it ideal for photojournalism, medium-distance work, and general use. Its bright f/2 maximum aperture is great for low-light shooting and gives you substantial depth-of-field control, while its 1.6-foot minimum focusing distance lets you get in close. Using a APS-C sensor camera? You’ll have a focal length equivalent to 112.5mm.

Advanced Optical Design. The lens’s floating-element optical system features eleven elements in nine groups, including one aspherical element that cuts down on aberrations while keeping pictures very sharp and clear. A multi-layer coating minimizes the effects of flaring and ghosting.

Dual Syncro Drive Autofocus System. This autofocus system gives you precise, nearly silent, and exceptionally fast performance that’s great for still and video alike. You also get full-time manual-focus override for greater precision, while the lens’s internal-focusing design helps keep image quality consistent from 1.6 feet to infinity.

High-Quality Build. This lens’s weather-sealed design keeps the dust and moisture out, so you can use it in inclement conditions. Leica has also applied a water-repellent AquaDura coating to the front and rear elements for additional protection from moisture.', 5150000.0, '{"Angle of View": "31.8°", "Brand": "Leica", "Dimensions": "Length: 4\\"", "Groups/Elements": "9/11", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "L", "Lens Type": "Telephoto", "Magnification": "0.2x", "Maximum Reproduction Ratio": "1:5", "Mfr. Model Number": "11178"}', 'Includes

	Leica 75mm f/2 ASPH APO-Summicron-SL for L-Mount
	Leica 12302 hood
	Front & rear caps
	Leica E67 UVa II Protection Filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (900, 2, 29, 'Leica 90-280mm f/2.8-4 APO-Vario-Elmarit-SL for L-Mount', 'leica-90-280mm-f-2-8-4-apo-vario-elmarit-sl-for-l-mount', 'The Leica 90-280mm f/2.8-4 APO-Vario-Elmarit-SL for L-Mount is a telephoto zoom designed for L-mount cameras. Key features include:

Advanced optics for high-quality images
Versatile zoom range
3.5-stop image stabilization system
Smooth, accurate, nearly silent autofocus

Advanced Optics. The Leica 90-280mm f/2.8-4 APO-Vario-Elmarit-SL’s 17-group/23-element construction includes 7 anomalous partial-dispersion elements. This reduces chromatic aberrations and distortions throughout the zoom range, giving you sharp, clear images. The Optical Image Stabilization system can handle up to 3.5 stops of camera shake for sharper hand-held shooting with longer shutters.

Focus, Focus, Focus. The linear-positioned stepping motor is smooth, accurate, and nearly silent. The Vario-Elmarit SL 90-280 focuses at a mere 2 feet at the 90mm focal-length position, and at 4.6 feet at the 280mm focal-length position. An internal focusing system means the front filter ring does not rotate during use, which makes it easier to work with circular polarizers, graduated ND filters, and other filters that require a specific orientation.

Telephoto Range. The 90-280mm L-mount zoom covers a long zoom range for everything from a portrait length to a full-on telephoto distance. The lens is designed for use on full-frame mirrorless cameras, but you can also use it on a crop sensor, where it’ll provide a 135-420mm equivalent focal length range.

High-Quality Build. The weather-sealed design keeps the dust and moisture out, while keeping you working even in inclement shooting conditions. Water-repellent AquaDura coatings on the front and rear optical surfaces protect against moisture and other elements.', 8100000.0, '{"Angle of View": "26° – 9°", "Autofocus": "Autofocus", "Brand": "Leica", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "L", "Lens Type": "Telephoto and Supertelephoto", "Mfr. Model Number": "11175"}', 'Includes

	Leica 90-280mm f/2.8-4 APO-Vario-Elmarit-SL for L-Mount
	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	Lens pouch
	Tripod collar
	Leica E82 UVa II filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (901, 2, 29, 'Leica 90mm f/1.5 Summilux-M ASPH for Leica M', 'leica-90mm-f-1-5-summilux-m-asph-for-leica-m', 'The Leica 90mm f/1.5 Summilux-M ASPH for Leica M is a fast-aperture, portrait-length, manual focus prime designed for Leica M-mount cameras. Key features include:

Fast portrait-length prime that’s great in low light
Meticulously crafted optics for exceptional sharpness
Manual-focus design for maximum precision
Built-in extendable lens hood to guard the front element

Fast Short-Telephoto Prime. The Leica 90mm f/1.5 Summilux-M ASPH’s focal length and fast aperture make it ideal for portraiture, mid-length images, and low-light shooting. The bright aperture also gives you substantial depth-of-field control.

Meticulously Crafted Optics. The lens’s floating-element optical system features eight elements in six groups, including two aspherical elements that cut down on aberrations while keeping pictures sharp and clear throughout the entire focusing range—even at the 3.3-foot minimum focusing distance.

High-Quality Build. The eleven-blade diaphragm helps produce a rounded, pleasing bokeh quality, while a built-in extendable lens hood shields the front element to reduce flare and ghosting. The front of this lens is threaded to accept 67mm screw-in filters.', 15050000.0, '{"Angle of View": "27°", "Aperture Blades": "11, Rounded", "Brand": "Leica", "Groups/Elements": "6/8", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Leica M", "Lens Type": "Telephoto", "Macro Reproduction Ratio": "1:8.8", "Mfr. Model Number": "11678"}', 'Includes

