INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (919, 1, 29, 'Leica SL3-S', 'leica-sl3-s', 'The Leica SL3-S is a full-frame mirrorless camera with a hybrid autofocus system and impressive video capabilities. It’s not an update to the SL3, but rather a more video-focused camera in the same family. Key features include:

24MP full-frame sensor and Maestro IV processor
5-axis image stabilization up to 5 stops
6K, C6K, 4K, C4K & FHD 10-Bit recording
CFexpress Type B & SD UHS-II card slots

24MP Full-Frame Sensor. At the heart of the Leica SL3-S is a versatile 24MP full-frame BSI CMOS sensor. Leica has removed any and all low-pass filtration to deliver sharp, incredibly detailed imagery.

Maestro IV Processor. The updated Maestro IV processor, first seen in the SL3, reliably processes image data and provides impressive image stabilization. It delivers a sensitivity range of ISO 100 to 200,000 and clocks in with record-breaking continuous shooting at up to 30 fps.

Advanced Autofocus. The sensor of the SL3-S boasts 779 autofocus points, which is two times more than the SL3 and three times more than the SL2-S. The autofocus points in conjunction with Contrast Detection AF delivers rapid, intelligent object detection and tracking for moving subjects.

Unlimited Recording Capabilities. Post-production possibilities are expanded greatly thanks to unlimited 6K Open Gate internal recording. This system’s video capabilities allows you to utilize the full size of the sensor in its native 3:2 ratio, crop and adjust framing without losing quality, experiment with aspect ratios, and even use an anamorphic lens without losing image information! As for external recording, the SL3-S is capable of recording HDMI-RAW in 5.9K at 30 fps to external display recorders.

Legendary Lensing. The Leica L-mount system offers users an incredible amount of flexibility when it comes to lensing. The native full-frame SL-series glass benefits from electronic communication for fast autofocus, electronic aperture control, and optical image stabilization. And then there are the adapters—this camera supports Leica M, S, R, and TL lenses. Please note that TL lenses will only cover the APS-C/Super 35mm sensor area.

Image Stabilization and EyeRes Viewfinder. The SL3-S’s five-axis image-stabilization system keeps things ultra-sharp even when you’re shooting hand-held. Multishot Mode is great when using a tripod or when you’re shooting stationary subjects, since it gives you a more color-accurate, highly detailed image than a single shot would. The impeccable EyeRes viewfinder uses its optical glass lens system to clearly display your subjects with up to 120 images per second and 5.76m-dot resolution.

Power and Memory. The SL3-S uses the BP-SCL6 battery, which is rated at 320 shots per charge, or roughly 1350 shots per charge if you only use the optical viewfinder. There are two memory-card slots—one CFexpress Type B, the other UHS-II SD/SDHC/SDXC—to give you flexible file-storage options. With this version of the SL3, you also have the option of recording directly to an SSD via USB-C.

Connection Machine. You can use Wi-Fi or Bluetooth in conjunction with the Leica FOTOS app to share images directly to linked iOS devices, to remotely adjust camera options and control the shutter, and use geotagging on your shots. You can also use the USB Type-C port and the separately available Leica FOTOS cable to connect this camera to an iPhone for file management and sharing via the FOTOS app.', 7625000.0, '{"Brand": "Leica", "Camera Mount": "L", "Camera Type": "Mirrorless", "Compatible Media": "CFexpress Type B and SD", "External Video Recording Modes": "4:2:2 12-Bit via HDMI5776 × 3056", "Flash": "Built-In Flash/LightNo Maximum Sync Speed1/200 Second Flash Compensation -2 to +2 EV (1/3, 1/2 EV Steps) Dedicated Flash SystemTTL External Flash ConnectionShoe Mount", "Focus": "Focus TypeAuto and Manual Focus Focus ModeAutomatic Autofocus Points\\nPhotoContrast Detection: 315PhotoPhase Detection: 779", "General": "Battery1x Leica BP-SCL6 Rechargeable Lithium-Ion, 7.2 VDC, 2200 mAh (Included)Approx. 315 Shots Shoe Mount1x Hot Shoe Tripod Mounting Thread1x 1/4\\"-20 Female (Bottom) Accessory Mounting Thread1x 1/4\\"-20 on Camera Body Material of ConstructionAluminum, Magnesium Alloy Operating Conditions14 to 104°F", "Imaging": "Lens MountL-Mount Sensor ResolutionActual: 25.3 MegapixelEffective: 24.6 Megapixel Image SensorFull-Frame BSI CMOS Sensor Crop (35mm Equivalent)Crop Factor: 1x*Additional Crop Occurs in Select Video Modes Image StabilizationSensor-Shift, 5-Axis Built-In ND FilterNo Capture TypeStills & Video", "Internal Video Recording Modes": "Raw 10-BitUHD 6K (5888 × 3312) at 23.98/25/29.97 fps4128 × 2160 at 23.98/25/29.97/50/59.94 fps H.264/H.265 Long GOP/MP4 4:2:0 8/10-BitUHD 4K (3840 × 2160) at 23.98/25/29.97/50/59.94 fps [100 Mb/s]1920 × 1080PsF at 23.98/25/29.97/50/59.94 fps [20 to 28 Mb/s] H.264 ALL-Intra 4:2:2 10-BitUHD 4K (3840 × 2160) at 23.98/24.00/25/29.97/47.95/48.00/50/59.94 fps [400 to 800 Mb/s]1920 × 1080PsF at 23.98/24.00/25/29.97/47.95/48.00/50/59.94/100 fps [200 to 400 Mb/s] H.265 Long GOP/MOV 4:2:0 10-Bit5952 × 3968 at 23.98/24.00/25/29.97 fps [200 Mb/s]5888 × 3312 at 23.98/24.00/25/29.97 fps [200 Mb/s]5952 × 3136 at 23.98/24.00/25/29.97 fps [200 Mb/s]4096 × 2160 at 23.98/24.00/25/29.97/47.95/48.00/50/59.94 fps [400 to 800 Mb/s] H.265 Long GOP 4:2:0 10-Bit1920 × 1080PsF at 25/29.97 fps [100 Mb/s] ProRes 4:2:25792 × 3056 at 23.98/24.00/25/29.97 fps [1551 to 1939 Mb/s]4096 × 2160 at 25/29.97/50/59.94 fps [811 to 1944 Mb/s]1920 × 1080PsF at 23.98/24.00/25/29.97/50/59.94 fps [181 to 454 Mb/s]", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "6K", "Monitor": "Display Size3.2\\" Resolution2,332,800 Dot Display TypeTilting Touchscreen LCD", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Tilt", "Sensor Size": "Full-Frame", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Still Image Capture": "Aspect Ratio3:2, 16:9, 17:9 Image File FormatDNG, JPEG Bit Depth14-Bit", "Video Capture": "Fast-/Slow-Motion SupportSlow-Motion Only Gamma CurveRec709, Rec2020 Recording LimitNo IP StreamingNo Built-In MicrophoneStereo Audio RecordingAAC AudioLPCM Audio", "Viewfinder": "TypeBuilt-In Electronic (OLED) Resolution5,760,000 Dot Eye Point21 mm Coverage100% MagnificationApprox. 0.76x Diopter Adjustment-4 to +2", "Viewfinder Type": "Optical", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'Includes

	Leica SL3-S
	LR Thunderbolt 4 USB 3ft
