Cinematic Bokeh. Each of the THALIA lenses boasts a fifteen-blade aperture that maintains a circular iris through all aperture stops. While this lens purposefully has under-corrected spherical aberrations, the iris design maintains circular bokeh as the wider aperture increases the intensity of the aberration.', 18000000.0, '{"Brand": "Leitz", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "PL", "Lens Type": "Unknown"}', 'Includes

