Dual Bokeh Blades. If you’re looking to add even more creative effects to your photos, you’re in luck. The Sol 45mm has two bokeh blades—each on its own hinged arm at the edge of the lens—which you can use to add subtle lines and textures to bokeh. Just bring the blades into the lens’s field of view and then rotate them horizontally, vertically, or diagonally to find the effect that suits you.', 325000.0, '{"Aperture Blades": "2", "Brand": "Lensbaby", "Groups/Elements": "2/3", "Hood Included": "No", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon Z", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle and Specialty", "Macro Reproduction Ratio": "1:6", "Mfr. Model Number": "LBS45NZ", "Tilt/Shift": "+/- 8.5° Tilt"}', 'Includes

	Lensbaby Sol 45mm f/3.5
	Front & rear caps', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
