INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (973, 2, 31, 'Lensbaby Velvet 56mm f/1.6 for Sony E', 'lensbaby-velvet-56mm-f-1-6-for-sony-e', 'The Lensbaby Velvet 56mm f/1.6 is a fully-manual specialty lens designed for Sony E-mount cameras and camcorders. Key features include:

Produces soft images that are perfect for portraiture
Shallow depth of field and good low-light performance
1:2 maximum magnification for macro shooting
Fully manual aperture and focus settings

Classic Rendering. Through the use of a singlet-doublet-singlet lens design, the Velvet 56mm produces a soft, glowing effect at wide apertures with smooth tonality similar to a classic 20th-century portrait lens. That’s a fancy way of saying it produces soft images. This look is desirable for portraiture.

Full-Frame Coverage. The 56mm focal length is a great environmental portrait length for full-frame shooters. When used on a crop-frame body, you’ll get a more traditional portrait focal length of 89.6mm. The f/1.6 aperture enables shallow depth of field and low-light capability.

Multi-Purpose Lens. In addition to its portrait qualities, the Velvet 56mm also features 1:2 maximum magnification for macro shooting. It has a 5-inch minimum working distance with a long manual focus throw for minute adjustments.

