Manual Focus. The manual-focus design allows for precision adjustments and lets you work with subjects as close as 35 inches away. There are focus scales in feet and meters with both focus and iris marks printed on both sides of the lens body to help with prefocusing techniques. This lens has built-in focus and iris gears, and has 270° of focus throw.', 725000.0, '{"Angle of View": "12.4°", "Aperture Blades": "10", "Brand": "Meike", "Dimensions": "3.1 × 3.5″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "77.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On and Matte Box Mount", "Focal Length": "85-85", "Focus Rotation": "270°", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Front Lens Diameter": "80mm", "Gearing": "0.8 MOD focus, iris", "Groups/Elements": "7/9", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Micro 4/3", "Lens Mount": "Micro 4/3", "Lens Type": "Telephoto, Cine, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.2", "Mfr. Model Number": "MFR #MK-8522T-MFT", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "2.95’", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "1.4 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Meike 85mm T2.2 Cine (MFT)
	Front & rear caps
