	Nikon HB-81 hood
	Nikon LF-4 rear cap
	Snap-on front cap
	72mm protection filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1020, 2, 38, 'Nikon 10-24mm f/3.5-4.5G AF-S DX', 'nikon-10-24mm-f-3-5-4-5g-af-s-dx', 'The Nikon 10-24mm f/3.5-4.5G AF-S DX is a superb landscape lens for use with crop-sensor DX cameras. Key features include:

Extremely wide 110° angle of view
Excellent for landscape photography
Fast, silent autofocus
Professional-grade build

Very Wide Angle of View. At 10mm, the Nikon 10-24mm f/3.5-4.5G DX offers an extremely wide 110° angle of view.

High-Quality Build. It’s built like a professional-grade lens with ED and aspherical elements, as well as Silent Wave Motor for fast and silent autofocusing.

Internal Focusing. It offers internal focusing so you can use polarizers and other filters, and it has a ten-inch minimum focusing distance. This is a superb landscape lens.', 1000000.0, '{"Angle of View": "109 to 61 degrees", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "Length: 3.42\\"", "Filter Style": "nonrotating front element", "Flare Resistance": "moderate ghosting (worst at 10mm), mild to moderate contrast loss", "Focusing System": "Internal, Silent Wave motor", "Groups/Elements": "9/14", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Hood Type": "HB-23", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Ultra Wide Angle", "Maximum Magnification": "0.20x", "Mfr. Model Number": "2181", "Weather Resistant": "No", "Zoom Method": "Barrel extending, nonrotating"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 10-24mm
	Front & rear caps
	HB-23 hood
	77mm protection filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1021, 2, 38, 'Nikon 105mm f/1.4E ED AF-S', 'nikon-105mm-f-1-4e-ed-af-s', 'The Nikon 105mm f/1.4E ED AF-S is a short telephoto lens for Nikon F-Mount Cameras. Key features include:

Stellar low-light shooting & shallow depth of field
Excellent clarity and color reproduction
Fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus
Nine-blade curved aperture

Fast-Aperture Short Tele. The Nikon 105mm f/1.4E ED AF-S is a true first of its kind. Combining a 105mm (157.5 crop equivalent) focal length with a f/1.4 aperture, it provides stellar low-light performance with an incredibly shallow depth of field. To top it all off, a nine-blade aperture makes sure all of those out-of-focus bits are smooth, making this lens a great choice for portrait work.

High-Quality Optics. The 105mm f/1.4’s optical formula is comprised of fourteen elements in nine groups. Its three extra-low dispersion elements ensure high clarity and color reproduction while keeping aberrations in check. The Nano Crystal Coating reduces flares and ghosting.

Smooth Autofocus. The Silent Wave Motor autofocus system is fast, accurate, and nearly silent, making this lens great for shooting subjects in motion. You can also go with a fully manual override for quick switch between autofocus and manual focusing by just rotating the focus ring.', 2525000.0, '{"Angle of View": "Nikon FX-Format: 23° 10’\\nNikon DX-Format: 15° 20’", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "Length: 4.17\\"", "Groups/Elements": "9/14", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Telephoto", "Maximum Magnification": "0.13x", "Mfr. Model Number": "20064", "Weather Resistant": "No"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 105mm f/1.4E
	Front & rear caps
	HB-79 hood
	82mm protective filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1022, 2, 38, 'Nikon 105mm f/2.8G IF-ED AF-S VR Micro', 'nikon-105mm-f-2-8g-if-ed-af-s-vr-micro', 'The Nikon 105mm f/2.8G IF-ED AF-S VR Micro brings vibration reduction to macro photography. Key features include:

Ultra-sharp full 1:1 macro lens
Improved vibration reduction
Excellent for macro and portrait photography

Ultra-Sharp Macro. The 105mm f/2.8G IF-ED AF-S VR Micro brings Nikon’s second-generation vibration-reduction system to an ultra-sharp full 1:1 macro lens. This allows the lens to be handheld an equivalent of 4-stops longer than the non-VR version, providing the photographer the opportunity to get sharp macro images without a tripod.', 1450000.0, '{"Angle of View": "23º", "Aperture Blades": "9, rounded", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "3.3 × 4.6″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "62.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "105-105", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "12/14", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Macro, Telephoto, and For DSLR", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "1x", "Mfr. Model Number": "2160", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "1.03’", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "1.6 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 105mm f/2.8G IF-ED AF-S VR Micro
	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	62mm protective filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1023, 2, 38, 'Nikon 14-24mm f/2.8G ED AF-S', 'nikon-14-24mm-f-2-8g-ed-af-s', 'The Nikon 14-24mm f/2.8G ED AF-S is designed for exceptional edge-to-edge sharpness the full-frame Nikon line-up, but is also outstanding on DX-format cameras. Key features include:

Exceptional edge-to-edge sharpness
Fast, silent autofocus
FX and DX compatible
Great value

Exceptional Sharpness. The Nikon 14-24mm f/2.8G ED AF-S has a Silent Wave Motor for fast autofocusing, and two extra-low dispersion elements and a Nano Crystal coating for superb sharpness even wide open. An f/2.8 aperture in a zoom this wide with full-frame coverage is unheard of—Nikon has cemented their place as the leader in wide-angle optics with this lens.

Caveats. Please note that there’s no way to use a filter with this lens, other than modifying a square filter holder. Additionally, while this lens offers very high image quality, there’s distortion at its widest setting, so wide group shots will give you very unhappy people on the edges—at least once they see the images.', 2550000.0, '{"Angle of View": "114 to 84 degrees", "Brand": "Nikon", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Ultra Wide Angle", "Mfr. Model Number": "2163"}', 'Includes

	14-24mm f/2.8G
	Front & rear caps
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1024, 2, 38, 'Nikon 16-35mm f/4G ED AF-S VR', 'nikon-16-35mm-f-4g-ed-af-s-vr', 'The Nikon 16-35mm f/4 VR is a professional-quality, full-frame f/4 lens. Key features include:

Extremely sharp images
4-stop vibration reduction
Fast, silent autofocus
9-blade rounded diaphragm

The Nikon 16-35mm f/4 VR is a professional-quality, full-frame f/4 lens. Nikon’s Vibration Reduction technology allows this lens to shoot at shutter speeds up to four stops slower than would otherwise be possible.

The complex optical design features Nikon’s exclusive anti-reflection Nano Crystal coat, two ED glass elements, and three aspherical glass elements to minimize distortion and aberration even at maximum aperture. The VR system and Silent Wave Motor deliver extremely quiet operation, while the nine-bladed rounded diaphragm renders delightful bokeh.', 1325000.0, '{"Angle of View": "107 to 63 degrees", "Brand": "Nikon", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Focusing System": "Internal, Silent Wave motor", "Groups/Elements": "12/17", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Hood Type": "HB-23", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Ultra Wide Angle and Wide Angle", "Maximum Magnification": "0.25x", "Mfr. Model Number": "2182", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Resistant": "No", "Zoom Method": "Front element, inner barrel withdraws into sleeve, nonrotating", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Hood
	77mm protection filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1025, 2, 38, 'Nikon 17-55mm f/2.8G ED AF-S DX', 'nikon-17-55mm-f-2-8g-ed-af-s-dx', 'The Nikon 17-55mm f/2.8G ED AF-S DX is a lightweight, wide-aperture zoom in a very useful focal length. Key features include:

Compatible only with DX cameras
Fast, nearly silent autofocus
9-blade aperture ring
Durable, lightweight build

High-Quality Optics. The Nikon 17-55mm f/2.8G ED AF-S DX is among the best standard-range lenses available for Nikon DX digital cameras. It has three ED elements and three aspherical lenses to minimize distortion and chromatic aberration, and a nine-blade aperture ring to maximize smooth bokeh.

DX Only. This lens only works with crop-sensor DX cameras, such as the D3300, D5500, and D7500.', 1500000.0, '{"Angle of View": "79 to 28.5 degrees", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "Length: 4.4\\"", "Filter Style": "Nonrotating front element", "Flare Resistance": "Minimal, mild contrast loss", "Focusing System": "Internal, Silent Wave motor, FT manual", "Groups/Elements": "10/14", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Hood Type": "HB-31", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle and Standard", "Maximum Magnification": "0.20x", "Mfr. Model Number": "2147", "Weather Resistant": "No", "Zoom Method": "Barrel extending, nonrotating"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 17-55mm lens
	Front & rear caps
	HB-31 hood
	77mm protection filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1026, 2, 38, 'Nikon 18-140mm f/3.5-5.6G AF-S DX VR', 'nikon-18-140mm-f-3-5-5-6g-af-s-dx-vr', 'The Nikon 18-140mm f/3.5-5.6G AF-S DX VR is a budget-friendly all-in-one zoom lens for Nikon DX DSLRs.  Key features include:

Great general-purpose daylight lens
4-stop vibration reduction
Fast, nearly silent autofocus
1.48-foot minimum focusing distance

All-In-One Zoom. With an equivalent focal length of 27-210mm after sensor-crop factor, the Nikon 18-140mm is a great general-purpose lens for daylight conditions.

Vibration Reduction. The second-generation VR unit provides up to four stops of correction, allowing you to handhold at lower shutter speeds.

Silent Wave Motor Autofocus. The Silent Wave Motor provides fast, accurate autofocus performance for both still and video use. It has an internal focusing design, so the front element doesn’t move during focusing. The manual focus override enables quick manual adjustments, and the close-focus distance of 1.48 feet lets you shoot pseudo-macro shots.

Optics. One extra-low dispersion element and one aspherical element provide sharpness and clarity while minimizing chromatic aberrations while helping to keep field curvature down to improve corner sharpness.', 900000.0, '{"Angle of View": "76° – 11° 30’", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "Length: 3.82\\"", "Filter Size": "67.0mm", "Filter Style": "nonrotating front element", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Flare Resistance": "has Super Integrated Coating", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Focusing System": "Internal, Silent Wave motor, manual focus override", "Groups/Elements": "12/17", "Hood Included": "No", "Hood Type": "HB-32", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "APS-C", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle, Standard, and Telephoto", "Maximum Aperture": "3.5", "Maximum Magnification": "0.23x", "Mfr. Model Number": "2213", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Resistant": "No", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "1.1 lb.", "Zoom Method": "Barrel extending, nonrotating", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 18-140mm
	Front & rear caps
	67mm protective filter
	Lens pouch', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1027, 2, 38, 'Nikon 18-300mm f/3.5-6.3G AF-S VR DX', 'nikon-18-300mm-f-3-5-6-3g-af-s-vr-dx', 'The Nikon 18-300mm f/3.5-6.3G AF-S VR DX is an all-in-one superzoom lens for Nikon DX cameras and an alternative to the Nikon 18-300mm f/3.5-5.6G AF-S VR DX. Key features include:

Excellent all-in-one superzoom
4-stop vibration reduction
Fast, nearly silent autofocus
High-quality optics

Smaller Size & Weight. This model doesn’t replace the 18-300mm f/3.5-5.6G AF-S VR DX, but rather offers an option that’s 0.8" shorter in length and just over 0.5 lbs lighter.

All-In-One Lens. This lens is designed for photographers who want one lens to cover the entire range and do a decent job at it. With a focal length equivalent to 27-450mm after crop factor, this lens definitely delivers that. Please note that you sacrifice some image quality and speed for the all-in-one convenience.

Vibration Reduction. The vibration-reduction feature provides four stops of correction, allowing you to shoot at lower shutter speeds without fear of camera shake.

Silent Wave Autofocus Motor. The built-in autofocus motor provides fast, nearly silent performance. The AF/M switch allows you to lock the focus ring during autofocus while still allowing manual focusing when the ring is turned.

High-Quality Optics. Three extra-low dispersion (ED) elements minimize chromatic aberrations while maintaining optimal sharpness and contrast.  Additionally, three aspherical lens elements reduce coma and other aberrations while correcting distortion.', 1675000.0, '{"Brand": "Nikon", "Filter Size": "67.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "APS-C", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle, Standard, Telephoto, and Supertelephoto", "Maximum Aperture": "3.5", "Mfr. Model Number": "2216", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weight": "1.2 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Lens
	Front & rear caps
	67mm protection filter
	Lens pouch', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1028, 2, 38, 'Nikon 180-400mm f/4E TC1.4 FL ED VR AF-S', 'nikon-180-400mm-f-4e-tc1-4-fl-ed-vr-af-s', 'The Nikon 180-400mm f/4E TC1.4 FL ED VR AF-S is a medium to super telephoto zoom lens designed for Nikon FX-format F-mount DSLRs. Key features include:

Great for long-range sports and wildlife photography
Built-in 1.4x teleconverter
Advanced optics for high-quality images
Silent Wave autofocus; four-stop vibration reduction

Medium to Super Telephoto Focal Length. The Nikon 180-400mm f/4E TC1.4 FL ED VR AF-S’s focal length makes it an excellent choice for shooting fast-moving sports and wildlife at long range with an FX-format camera. Its f/4 aperture is plenty fast for daytime use, but you probably won’t want to do a lot of low-light shooting. The 180-400 is also compatible with DX-format DSLRs, on which it’ll provide a 378-840mm equivalent zoom range.

Built-In 1.4x Teleconverter. This lens’s integrated 1.4x teleconverter lets you extend your reach to 252-560mm (378-840mm on a DX camera) with the flip of a switch. The teleconverter is optically matched to the lens for optimal performance, and it has the same weather sealing as the lens itself.  Do note engaging the 1.4x teleconverter results in a 1-stop reduction in maximum aperture.  In other words, the maximum aperture becomes f/5.6.

Advanced Optical Design. This lens’s 19-group/27-element design features one fluorite element and eight extra-low dispersion glass elements to maintain color accuracy and clarity while reducing aberrations and color fringing. Additionally, Nikon applies a Nano Crystal Coat and Super Integrated Coating to the front element to help eliminate ghosting and flare.

Vibration Reduction. The in-lens stabilizer provides up to four stops of correction at its longest focal length, giving you the flexibility to shoot handheld in a variety of conditions. Its Sport Mode is designed for fast-paced shoots, while its Tripod Mode minimizes ground vibrations when you’re using the camera on top of a support system.

Silent Wave Autofocus Motor. The Silent Wave motor provides fast, quiet, and accurate autofocus, which is great for stills and video alike. You also get full-time manual focus override for further precision adjustment, and an internal-focusing design to help ensure maximum sharpness.

Electromagnetic Diaphragm Mechanism. Nikon’s electromagnetic diaphragm mechanism gives you consistent exposures even when you’re shooting at fast continuous rates, while the rounded nine-blade diaphragm produces pleasing bokeh.

Durable Build. This lens’s dust- and moisture-resistant build means that you can shoot in inclement conditions without worry, while its aforementioned internal-focusing design keeps its length consistent and its weight low. Its front element’s fluorine coating helps protect it from smudges, fingerprints, and debris.', 12475000.0, '{"Angle of View": "13° 40’ – 6° 10’", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "Length: 14.3\\"", "Filter Size": "40.5mm", "Filter Type": "Drop-In", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "19/27", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Supertelephoto", "Magnification": "0.25x", "Maximum Aperture": "4.0", "Maximum Reproduction Ratio": "1:4", "Mfr. Model Number": "20071", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Tripod Collar": "Yes; removable, rotating", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "7.7 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 180-400mm f/4E
	40.5mm drop-in UV filter
	HK-41 hood
	LC-K103 slip-on cap
	Soft Case
	Hard case for transport', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1029, 2, 38, 'Nikon 19mm f/4E ED PC-E', 'nikon-19mm-f-4e-ed-pc-e', 'The Nikon 19mm f/4E ED PC-E is a wide-angle tilt-shift lens for Nikon F-Mount cameras. Key features include:

97° angle of view
Great for architectural, landscape, and fine-art photography
Independent tilt and shift rotation
Advanced optical design for high-quality images

Full-Frame Coverage. The 19mm provides a whopping 97° angle of view. That’s really wide. Like really, really wide, which makes it an excellent choice for landscape and architecture photography. But more on that later.

Tilt-Shift Function. Enables perspective and depth-of-field control of your subject. It offers +/-7.5º tilt adjustment and +/-12mm shift adjustment, as well as the ability to rotate up to 90º in either direction. It’s worth noting that the 19mm features independent rotation of the tilting mechanism for both tilt and shift, so that they can be performed either parallel or perpendicularly to one another.

Optics. The thirteen-group/seventeen-element optical formula features two aspherical elements providing images with great corner sharpness and minimal optical aberrations. The Nano Crystal anti-reflective coating aids in preventing lens flare and ghosting, while the fluorine coating at the front and rear prevents smudges.

Common Uses. Tilt-shift/perspective-control lenses are most commonly used for architectural and landscape photography, as well as some product photography. The ability to manipulate the focal plane also makes them a popular choice for fine art photography.', 4175000.0, '{"Angle of View": "97º", "Aperture Blades": "9", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "3.5 × 4.8″ (ø x L)", "Focal Length": "19-19", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Groups/Elements": "13/17", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Ultra Wide Angle, Tilt-Shift, and For DSLR", "Maximum Aperture": "4.0", "Maximum Magnification": "0.18x", "Mfr. Model Number": "20065", "Stabilization": "No", "Tilt/Shift": "± 7.5° tilt\\n± 12mm shift", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "1.95 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 19mm f/4E ED PC-E
	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1030, 2, 38, 'Nikon 200-500mm f/5.6E ED AF-S VR', 'nikon-200-500mm-f-5-6e-ed-af-s-vr', 'The Nikon 200-500mm f/5.6E ED AF-S VR is a prosumer-grade super telephoto zoom lens designed for Nikon FX full-frame DSLRs. Key features include:

Large focal range
4.5-stop vibration reduction
Fast, near-silent autofocus and full-time manual focus
Included tripod collar

Super Telephoto Zoom. Sometimes a single super tele focal length just won’t do. You could reach for the professional Nikon 200-400mm f/4G AF-S ED VR II, but it’s a beast. The 200-500mm f/5.6E ED AF-S VR serves as a very capable travel-friendly alternative. Its focal range and constant f/5.6 aperture make it well-suited for daytime sports and wildlife photography.

Vibration Reduction. The in-lens stabilizer provides up to 4.5-stops of correction to help minimize camera shake. It has a dedicated VR Sport Mode that recognizes panning motion, ensuring accurate compensation is applied where needed. Combined with its rotatable tripod collar, the 200-500mm f/5.6 is perfect for use with a monopod system.

Silent Wave Autofocus Motor. The Silent Wave Motor provides quick, quiet, and precise autofocus performance. The internal focusing design retains the overall lens length during operation while contributing to a lighter overall weight. Full-time manual focus override is as simple as rotating the focus ring at any time.

Electromagnetic Aperture. Provides greater exposure control stability that is especially beneficial when working with fast continuous shooting rates.

Optics. Three extra-low dispersion glass elements minimize chromatic aberrations and distortions, while Nikon’s Super Integrated Coating eliminate internal reflections for reduced lens flare and ghosting.', 2150000.0, '{"Brand": "Nikon", "Filter Size": "95.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Supertelephoto", "Maximum Aperture": "5.6", "Mfr. Model Number": "20058", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weight": "5.1 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 200-500mm f/5.6E
	Front & rear caps
	Hood (HB-71)
	Tripod collar
	95mm protection filter
	Lens case', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1031, 2, 38, 'Nikon 200mm f/2G ED AF-S VR II', 'nikon-200mm-f-2g-ed-af-s-vr-ii', 'The Nikon 200mm f/2G ED AF-S VR II is a very fast telephoto lens for Nikon F-mount cameras. If you need a fast-aperture telephoto lens, this is arguably the best available. Key features include:

Exceptional image quality
Four-stop vibration reduction
Fast, nearly silent autofocus and full-time manual focus
Excellent for portraiture and sports photography

Extremely Shallow Depth of Field. The Nikon 200mm f/2G ED AF-S VR II’s f/2 aperture renders extremely shallow depth-of-field images with beautiful background blur, making it an ideal choice for a variety of photographic styles such as sports and portraiture.

Improved Vibration Reduction. As an update to the original Nikon 200mm f/2 IF-ED AF-S VR, this lens adds an improved Vibration Reduction II system, allowing up to four stops of correction with tripod-sensing ability.

Advanced Optics and Focusing. This updated version also features Nikon’s Nano Crystal Coat for minimizing ghosting and lens flare, and an additional A/M focusing mode. Otherwise, it offers the same high image quality and performance of its predecessor.', 5625000.0, '{"Brand": "Nikon", "Filter Size": "52.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Supertelephoto", "Maximum Aperture": "2.0", "Mfr. Model Number": "2188", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weight": "6.4 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 200mm f/2G
	Rear cap
	Slip-on front cap
	Strap
	Drop-in UV filter
	HK-31 hood
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1032, 2, 38, 'Nikon 20mm f/1.8G ED AF-S', 'nikon-20mm-f-1-8g-ed-af-s', 'The Nikon 20mm f/1.8G ED AF-S is a wide-angle prime lens designed for both full-frame and crop-frame Nikon DSLRs. Key features include:

94° angle of view
Fast, silent autofocus
Fast aperture for low-light shooting
FX and DX compatible

Wide-Angle Prime. Compatible with FX- and DX-sensor cameras, the Nikon 20mm f/1.8 provides a 94° angle of view on full-frame and 70° equivalent on crop-frame cameras.

Fast Aperture. At f/1.8, you’ll be able to shoot in low light as well as create subject-background separation.

Optics. Two aspherical and two ED elements minimizes chromatic aberrations, while the Nano Crystal Coating reduces sagittal flare. The internal Silent Wave Motor gives fast, silent autofocus performance for both still and video shooting, while the rear-focusing design keeps the physical size of the lens the same at all focus distances.', 1500000.0, '{"Angle of View": "94°", "Aperture": "f/1.8 – 16", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "Length: 3.1\\"", "Focusing System": "Rear-focusing, SWM", "Groups/Elements": "11/13", "Hood Type": "HB-72", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle", "Maximum Magnification": "0.23x", "Weather Resistant": "No"}', 'Includes

	Lens
	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	77mm protective filter
	Lens pouch', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1033, 2, 38, 'Nikon 24-120mm f/4G ED AF-S VR', 'nikon-24-120mm-f-4g-ed-af-s-vr', 'The Nikon 24-120mm f/4G ED AF-S VR is a compact zoom in the perfect range for walk-around photography on both FX- and DX-sensor cameras. Key features include:

4-stop vibration reduction
Fast, nearly silent autofocus
Exceptionally smooth zoom ring
FX and DX compatible

Image Stabilization. Nikon’s VR II image-stabilization system allows photographers to work with shutter speeds up to four times slower than usual.

HIgh-Quality Optics. The lens contains two extra-low dispersion elements and three aspherical elements, as well as Nano crystal coatings to maximize image quality and minimize aberrations.

Additional Features. It has a nine-blade aperture ring for smooth out-of-focus highlights and a Silent Wave Motor for fast autofocus.', 1725000.0, '{"Angle of View": "84 to 20.3 degrees", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "Length: 4.1\\"", "Filter Style": "Nonrotating", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Focusing System": "Internal, Silent Wave motor, Full time manual", "Groups/Elements": "13/17", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Hood Type": "HB-53", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle, Standard, and Telephoto", "Maximum Aperture": "4.0", "Maximum Magnification": "0.24x", "Mfr. Model Number": "2193", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Resistant": "Yes", "Weight": "1.6 lb.", "Zoom Method": "Front, barrel extends, nonrotating", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Hood
	77mm protection filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1034, 2, 38, 'Nikon 24-70mm f/2.8E ED AF-S VR', 'nikon-24-70mm-f-2-8e-ed-af-s-vr', 'The Nikon 24-70mm f/2.8E ED AF-S VR is a fast-aperture, pro-grade normal-range zoom and long-awaited update to the Nikon 24-70mm f/2.8G ED AF-S. Key features include:

Four-stop vibration reduction
Fast, nearly silent autofocus and full-time manual focus
Electromagnetic aperture
Excellent depth-of-field control

Fast Normal-Range Zoom. The 24-70mm focal length is the bread and butter for many types of photography due to the wide to portrait-length range it covers. The fast f/2.8 aperture offers both depth-of-field control and flexibility for shooting in low light.

Silent Wave Autofocus Motor. The Silent Wave Motor provides quick, quiet, and precise autofocus performance for both still and video shooting. The internal focusing design retains the overall lens length during operation while contributing to a lighter overall weight. Full-time manual focus override is as simple as rotating the focus ring at any time.

Vibration Reduction. By far the biggest addition, this in-lens stabilization system offers up to 4 stops of correction to help combat camera shake.

Electromagnetic Aperture. Provides greater exposure control stability, which is especially beneficial when working with fast continuous shooting rates.

Updated Optics. The optical formula has been revised from its predecessor’s design. This includes a single unique aspherical extra-low dispersion element, three aspherical elements, one high refractive index element, and two extra-low dispersion glass elements that combine to minimize aberrations, distortion, coma, and flare.', 2750000.0, '{"Angle of View": "84° – 34° 20’", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "Length: 6.08\\"", "Filter Size": "82.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Focusing System": "Internal, Silent Wave motor, FT manual w/ switch", "Groups/Elements": "16/20", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Hood Type": "HB-74", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle, Standard, and Telephoto", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "0.28x", "Mfr. Model Number": "20052", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Resistant": "Yes", "Zoom Method": "Barrel-extending", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 24-70mm f/2.8E
	Front & rear caps
	HB-74 hood
	82mm protective filter
	Lens pouch', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1035, 2, 38, 'Nikon 24mm f/1.4G ED AF-S', 'nikon-24mm-f-1-4g-ed-af-s', 'The Nikon 24mm f/1.4G ED AF-S is Nikon’s premier autofocus wide-angle prime lens. Key features include:

Excellent center sharpness
Smooth, nearly silent autofocus
Great bokeh, color, and contrast
Durable build quality

High-Quality Optics. The Nikon 24mm f/1.4G ED AF-S’s optical system combines Nikon’s anti-reflection Nano Crystal coat, ED glass elements, and aspherical lens elements to deliver brilliant, high-contrast images with minimized distortion and aberration. The f/1.4 aperture and nine-blade rounded diaphragm contribute to render images with beautiful, smooth bokeh.

Smooth, Quiet Autofocus. The lens features a dedicated Silent Wave Motor for smooth, nearly silent autofocus. Its construction is durable, with weather and dust sealing throughout the lens and around the mount.', 2050000.0, '{"Angle of View": "84 degrees", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "Length: 3.5\\"", "Filter Style": "Nonrotating", "Focusing System": "Internal, AF-MF switch with FT manual, Hypersonic motor", "Groups/Elements": "10/12", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Hood Type": "HB-51", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle", "Maximum Magnification": "0.18x", "Mfr. Model Number": "2184", "Weather Resistant": "Yes"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 24mm
	Front & rear caps
	HB-51 hood
	77mm protective filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1036, 2, 38, 'Nikon 24mm f/1.8G ED AF-S', 'nikon-24mm-f-1-8g-ed-af-s', 'The Nikon 24mm f/1.8G ED AF-S is a budget-friendly wide-angle lens designed for Nikon FX full-frame DSLRs. Key features include:

84º angle of view
Fast, nearly silent autofocus with manual focus
Great for architecture, landscape, and street shooting
FX and DX compatible

Wide-Angle Prime. Generally speaking, 24mm is the most common wide-angle focal length due to its balance of angle of view (84º) with minimal barrel distortion. It’s a popular choice for architecture, landscape, and street photography, but it can also be useful in any instance in which you need a true wide angle but don’t want massive distortion. While it was designed with full-frame FX cameras in mind, it’s also fully compatible with crop-sensor DX cameras with a focal length equivalent to 36mm.

Fast Aperture. The f/1.8 aperture offers depth-of-field control for creating subject/background isolation, as well as enabling low-light shooting.

Silent Wave Autofocus Motor. The Silent Wave Motor provides fast, nearly silent autofocus performance. The rear-focusing design plays well with filters, as the barrel doesn’t extend or rotate. The lens offers full-time manual focus capabilities for quick manual-focus adjustment.

High-Quality Optics. There are two extra-low dispersion elements and two aspherical glass elements that combat chromatic aberrations and distortion while maximizing image sharpness, clarity, and color accuracy.', 1125000.0, '{"Angle of View": "84°", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "Length: 3.27\\"", "Filter Style": "Nonrotating front element", "Focusing System": "Rear, Full time active, SWM motor", "Groups/Elements": "9/12", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Hood Type": "HB-76", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle", "Maximum Magnification": "0.2x", "Mfr. Model Number": "20057", "Weather Resistant": "No"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 24mm
	Front & rear caps
	HB-76 hood
	72mm protective filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1037, 2, 38, 'Nikon 24mm f/3.5D PC-E', 'nikon-24mm-f-3-5d-pc-e', 'The Nikon 24mm f/3.5D PC-E is an ultra-wide perspective-control lens. Key features include:

Great for architectural and nature photography
Extensive perspective-control options
8.4” minimum focusing distance
DX and FX compatible

The Nikon 24mm f/3.5D PC-E is an ultra-wide perspective-control (PC) lens featuring 8.5° tilt, 11.5mm shift, and 90° rotation capabilities, allowing complete perspective control.

It’s perfect for architectural and nature photography, and with 3 ED glass elements and Nano Crystal Coating, it’s amazingly sharp and flare resistant.

Please note that mastering a perspective-control lens isn’t something that can be accomplished in an hour or two. If you don’t have experience with this type of lens, you’ll need a day or two with the manual to practice before tackling an important assignment.', 1875000.0, '{"Angle of View": "84º", "Aperture Blades": "9, rounded", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "3.3 × 4.3″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "77.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "24-24", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Groups/Elements": "10/13", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle, Tilt-Shift, and For DSLR", "Maximum Aperture": "3.5", "Maximum Magnification": "0.37x", "Mfr. Model Number": "2168", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "8.27\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Tilt/Shift": "± 8.5° tilt\\n± 11.5mm shift", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "1.6 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 24mm f/3.5D PC-E
	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	77mm protective filter
	Lens Bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1038, 2, 38, 'Nikon 28-300mm f/3.5-5.6G ED AF-S VR', 'nikon-28-300mm-f-3-5-5-6g-ed-af-s-vr', 'The Nikon 28-300mm f/3.5-5.6G ED AF-S VR brings the superzoom to FX-sensor cameras (and can be used on DX sensors, too). Key features include:

10.5x zoom range
18-inch minimum focusing distance at every focal length
4-stop image stabilization
Fast, nearly silent autofocus

10.5x Zoom and 18-Inch Minimum Focus. The obvious appeal is the 10.5x zoom range and a rather spectacular 18-inch minimum focusing distance at every focal length. The VR II image stabilization allows you to handhold your camera at up to four shutter speeds slower than would otherwise be possible, assuring dramatically sharper still images and stable video capture.

High-Quality Optical Design. The lens has nine aperture blades for producing smooth out-of-focus highlights, two extra-low dispersion elements, and three aspherical elements. It has internal focusing so filters are easy to use, and the Silent Wave Motor provides fast, nearly silent autofocus.', 2125000.0, '{"Brand": "Nikon", "Filter Size": "77.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle, Standard, Telephoto, and Supertelephoto", "Maximum Aperture": "3.5", "Mfr. Model Number": "2191", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weight": "1.8 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 28-300mm
	Hood
	77mm protection filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1039, 2, 38, 'Nikon 28mm f/1.4E ED AF-S', 'nikon-28mm-f-1-4e-ed-af-s', 'The Nikon 28mm f/1.4E ED AF-S is a premium, fast-aperture wide-angle prime for Nikon F-Mount cameras. Key features include:

Great for landscape, street, and architectural shooting
Shallow depth of field and great low-light performance
Excellent clarity and color reproduction
Fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus

Fast-Aperture Wide-Angle Prime. The Nikon 28mm f/1.4E ED AF-S’s focal length makes is excellent for landscape, street, documentary, and architectural photography. Its fast aperture gives you stellar low-light performance with a shallow depth of field. To top it all off, its nine-blade aperture makes sure all of those out-of-focus bits are smooth.

High-Quality Optics. The 28mm f/1.4E’s optical formula is comprised of fourteen elements in eleven groups. Its two extra-low dispersion elements and three aspherical elements ensure high clarity and color reproduction while keeping aberrations in check. The Nano Crystal and Super Integrated Coatings reduce flares and ghosting.

Smooth Autofocus. The Silent Wave Motor provides quick, quiet, and precise autofocus performance for both still and video shooting. The internal focusing design retains the overall lens length during operation while contributing to a lighter overall weight. Full-time manual focus override is as simple as rotating the focus ring at any time.', 2500000.0, '{"Angle of View": "75°", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "Length: 4\\"", "Groups/Elements": "11/14", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle", "Magnification": "0.17x", "Mfr. Model Number": "20069"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 28mm f/1.4E
	HB-83 hood
	Snap-on front cap
	77mm protective filter
	LF-4 rear cap', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1040, 2, 38, 'Nikon 28mm f/1.8G AF-S', 'nikon-28mm-f-1-8g-af-s', 'The Nikon 28mm f/1.8G AF-S is fast-aperture wide-angle lens for Nikon DSLR shooters. Key features include:

Great color rendition and background separation
Ideal for low-light shooting
Fast, silent autofocus
FX and DX compatible

Great Color Rendition. The Nikon 28mm f/1.8G AF-S is compatible with both FX and DX cameras, providing high image quality with great color rendition.

Excellent in Low Light. At 28mm, it serves as a great in-between option for when 24mm is too wide, but 35mm just doesn’t cut it. The f/1.8 aperture makes it ideal for low-light shooting and getting as much background separation possible.

Fast, Silent Autofocus. The combination of Nikon’s Silent Wave Motor and rear-focus design provides fast, silent autofocus that’s perfect for shooting stills and video.

Advanced Optical Design. The lens’s advanced optical design includes two aspherical elements for minimizing aberrations, and Nikon’s Super Integrated Coating and Nano Crystal Coat for eliminating ghosting, flare, and reflections.', 825000.0, '{"Brand": "Nikon", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 28mm
	Front & rear caps
	HB-64 hood
	67mm protective filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1041, 2, 38, 'Nikon 300mm f/2.8G AF-S ED VR II', 'nikon-300mm-f-2-8g-af-s-ed-vr-ii', 'The 300mm f/2.8G AF-S ED VR II is Nikon’s version of the 300 f/2.8 telephoto lens. It is, simply, as good as it gets. Key features include:

Improved, three-stop vibration reduction
Fast, nearly silent autofocus
Focus limiting and focus-preset recall
Nine-blade aperture

Advanced Focusing. The Nikon 300mm f/2.8G AF-S ED VR II has superbly fast focusing with focus limiting and focus-preset recall functions are ideal for sport shooters.

High-Quality Optics. It also has a three-stop vibration reduction with automatic detection of panning, three ED elements to eliminate chromatic aberration and internal reflections, and Nano-Crystal coating to enhance optical performance.', 6075000.0, '{"Angle of View": "8 degrees", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "Length: 10.5\\"", "Filter Size": "52.0mm", "Filter Type": "Drop-In", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Focusing System": "Internal, Silent Wave motor, focus limiter, FT manual, electronic preset", "Groups/Elements": "8/11", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Hood Type": "HK-30", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Telephoto and Supertelephoto", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "0.16x", "Mfr. Model Number": "2186", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Resistant": "Yes", "Weight": "6.4 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 300mm f/2.8G
	Rear cap
	Slip-on front cap
	Strap
	Drop-in UV filter
	HK-30 hood
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1042, 2, 38, 'Nikon 300mm f/4E AF-S PF ED VR', 'nikon-300mm-f-4e-af-s-pf-ed-vr', 'The Nikon 300mm f/4E AF-S PF ED VR is a professional-grade super telephoto lens and update to the Nikon 300mm f/4D ED AF-S. Key features include:

4.5-stop vibration reduction
Fast, nearly silent autofocus and full-time manual focus
Phase fresnel lens design
Excellent for wildlife photography

Phase Fresnel Lens Design. The phase fresnel optic allows the lens to be smaller and lighter compared to its predecessor. This advanced optic system effectively eliminates chromatic aberration and ghosting, ensuring high-quality images. If this sounds vaguely familiar, Canon has used this same optical formula for quite some time under the name Diffractive Optics.

Super Telephoto Prime. The 300mm focal length is popular for sports and wildlife photographers. With its reduced size and weight, this lens targets the latter of the two.

Vibration Reduction. The stabilizer is rated for up to 4.5 stops of correction, which in turn enables better image quality when hand-holding. Additionally, a designated Sports and Action VR Mode provides a more accurate stabilization method when panning.

Silent Wave Autofocus Motor. Provides fast, nearly silent autofocus with full-time manual-focus override for instantaneous manual-focus tweaking. There’s also a focus-limit switch for limiting the focus distance to 3m or further.

Build and Optics. Fluorine coating on the front lens element repels dust, water, grease, and dirt for easy cleaning. In addition to the phase fresnel element, there’s a single extra-low dispersion element for aberration control. At 5.8 inches and 1.7 lb., this 300mm lens is remarkably small compared to other options in the same quality range.', 2400000.0, '{"Angle of View": "8° 10’", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "Length: 5.81\\"", "Filter Style": "Nonrotating", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Flare Resistance": "Minimal", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Focusing System": "Internal focus, Full time active, Silent wave motor, focus limiting switch", "Groups/Elements": "10/16", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Hood Type": "HB-73", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Supertelephoto", "Maximum Aperture": "4.0", "Maximum Magnification": "0.24x", "Mfr. Model Number": "2223", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weight": "1.7 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 300mm f/4E
	Front & rear caps
	HB-73 hood
	77mm protection filter
	Soft carrying case', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1043, 2, 38, 'Nikon 35mm f/1.4G AF-S', 'nikon-35mm-f-1-4g-af-s', 'The Nikon 35mm f/1.4G AF-S is a superb G-series prime lens. Key features include:

Extremely sharp image quality
Fast, nearly silent autofocus and full-time manual focus
9-blade aperture
FX and DX compatible

Extremely Sharp Images. Another superb G-series prime lens, the 35mm f/1.4 features a Silent Wave Motor for quick, quiet, and accurate autofocus via a rear focusing system; nine curved aperture blades for smooth out-of-focus highlights; Nano-Crystal coating to minimize flare; and aspheric elements to reduce aberration.', 2100000.0, '{"Angle of View": "63 degrees (FX)", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "Length: 3.5\\"", "Filter Style": "Nonrotating front element", "Focusing System": "Rear, Full time active, SWM motor", "Groups/Elements": "7/10", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Hood Type": "HB-59", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle", "Maximum Magnification": "0.2x", "Mfr. Model Number": "2198", "Weather Resistant": "Yes"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 35mm
	Front & rear caps
	HB-59 hood
	67mm protective filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1044, 2, 38, 'Nikon 35mm f/1.8G AF-S DX', 'nikon-35mm-f-1-8g-af-s-dx', 'The Nikon 35mm f/1.8G AF-S DX is a very sharp, wide-aperture prime lens for DX-sensor cameras. Key features include:

Excellent sharpness
Fast, nearly silent autofocus
High-quality, pocketable build
Great for portrait, mid-range, and low-light shooting

Fast, Quiet Autofocus. The Nikon 35mm f/1.8G AF-S DX’s built-in Silent Wave Motor ensures fast, nearly silent autofocus.

Portable Portrait and Mid-Range Lens. It’s a pocketable lens that’s excellent for portrait and mid-range shooting, even in low-light situations.', 600000.0, '{"Brand": "Nikon", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 35mm
	Front & rear caps
	HB-46 hood
	52mm protective filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1045, 2, 38, 'Nikon 35mm f/1.8G ED AF-S', 'nikon-35mm-f-1-8g-ed-af-s', 'The Nikon 35mm f/1.8G ED AF-S is a budget-friendly, moderately wide-angle lens designed for Nikon FX and DX DSLRs. Key features include:

Excellent for portraiture and low-light shooting
Fast, nearly silent autofocus
High-quality optics
FX and DX compatible

Semi-Wide Prime. The 35mm focal length is a popular choice for just about any type of photography. It’s used often for portraiture, landscape, and street photography. While it was designed with full-frame FX cameras in mind, it also serves as a great normal-range lens on crop-sensor DX cameras equivalent to 52.5mm

Fast Aperture. The f/1.8 aperture allows a high degree of subject/background isolation desired for portraiture. It also enables the lens to be very useful for low-light shooting.

Silent Wave Autofocus Motor. The Silent Wave Motor provides fast, nearly silent performance. The rear focusing design plays well with filters, as the barrel does not extend or rotate. For quick manual focus adjustment, the lens offers full-time manual focus capabilities.

High-Quality Optics. There’s one extra-low dispersion glass element for increased contrast and sharpness, and an aspherical element that minimizes spherical aberration and distortion.', 875000.0, '{"Angle of View": "63°", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "Length: 2.81\\"", "Filter Style": "Nonrotating front element", "Focusing System": "Rear, Full time active, SWM motor", "Groups/Elements": "8/11", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Hood Type": "HB-70", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle", "Maximum Magnification": "0.24x", "Mfr. Model Number": "2215", "Weather Resistant": "No"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 35mm Lens
	Front & Rear Caps
	HB-70 Hood
	58mm protective filter
	Lens Bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1046, 2, 38, 'Nikon 400mm f/2.8E AF-S FL ED VR', 'nikon-400mm-f-2-8e-af-s-fl-ed-vr', 'The Nikon 400mm f/2.8E AF-S FL ED VR is a pro-grade super tele and update to the popular Nikon 400mm f/2.8G AF-S VR. Key features include:

Ideal for sports and action photography
4-stop vibration reduction
Fast, nearly silent autofocus; full-time manual focusing
Consistent exposures at high frame rates

Designed for Sports. The long reach and fast f/2.8 aperture are perfect for sports and action photography, allowing you to freeze fast-moving subjects even in low light. The wide aperture also enables images with a very shallow depth-of-field, giving great subject/background separation.

Redesigned Build and Optics. In what might be the most notable change from the AF-S VR, Nikon managed to shave 1.72 lbs. off the lens’s weight by switching to a magnesium alloy die-cast lens barrel. Additionally, two fluorite lens elements and two ED lens elements reduce chromatic aberrations while ensuring overall image sharpness, clarity, and color fidelity. As expected, you’re still getting pro-grade dust-, moisture-, and weather-sealing for peace of mind in less-than-ideal conditions.

Advanced Vibration Reduction. The in-lens vibration reduction provides up to four stops of correction for low-light shooting. Combined with the weight reduction, this makes the 400mm f/2.8E AF-S FL ED VR truly hand-holdable. There’s a dedicated VR Sport Mode that recognizes panning motion to provide accurate compensation for camera shake.

Silent Wave Autofocus Motor. The Silent Wave Motor provides quick, quiet, and precise autofocus performance. The internal focusing design retains the overall lens length during operation while contributing to a lighter overall weight. Full-time manual focus override is as simple as rotating the focus ring at any time.

Specialized Electromagnetic Diaphragm. First seen in the Nikon 800mm f/5.6E FL ED AF-S VR, the electromagnetic diaphragm ensures consistent exposures when shooting at high frame rates.', 12325000.0, '{"Angle of View": "6° 10’", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "Length: 14.09\\"", "Filter Size": "40.5mm", "Filter Type": "Drop-In", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Focusing System": "Internal, Silent Wave motor, focus limiter, FT manual, electronic preset", "Groups/Elements": "12/16", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Hood Type": "HK-38", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Supertelephoto", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "0.16x", "Mfr. Model Number": "2217", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Resistant": "Yes", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "8.4 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 400mm f/2.8E
	Rear cap
	Hood with soft cover
	Soft carrying case
	Hard case', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1047, 2, 38, 'Nikon 40mm f/2.8G AF-S DX Micro', 'nikon-40mm-f-2-8g-af-s-dx-micro', 'The Nikon 40mm f/2.8G AF-S DX Micro is a very nice “all-around” prime lens.  Key features include:

Great for full-length portraits and architecture photography
Fast, nearly silent autofocus
Doubles as a true 1:1 macro lens
Compact, lightweight build

Versatile 1:1 Macro. Although the Nikon 40mm f/2.8G AF-S DX Micro doesn’t have the very wide aperture of some primes, f/2.8 is still more than adequate for most conditions. Its focal length is good for street shooting, full length portraits, and outdoor architectural shots. It also acts as a true 1:1 macro lens that’s suitable for close-up work.

Small, Lightweight Build. It’s small and lightweight so it doesn’t take up much room in your bag, and it’s inexpensive so it doesn’t take up a lot of room in your budget.', 500000.0, '{"Angle of View": "38º50’", "Aperture Blades": "7, rounded", "Brand": "Nikon", "Dimensions": "2.7 × 2.5″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "52.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "40-40", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "7/9", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "APS-C", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Macro, For DSLR, and Standard", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "1x", "Mfr. Model Number": "2200", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "6.42\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "0.5 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Nikon 40mm f/2.8 AF-S DX Micro
