Nikon Z System. The Nikon Z 14-24mm f/2.8 S was designed specifically for cameras in Nikon’s full-frame Z-mount system. Z-mount lenses only work with Z-mount cameras, such as the Z7 and Z6, and Z-mount cameras are only natively compatible with Z-mount lenses.

Fast-Aperture Ultra-Wide Zoom. The 14-24 f/2.8 S provides an ultra-wide to wide focal range, making it perfect for landscape and architectural photographers. The relatively fast f/2.8 aperture offers some shallow depth of field, while allowing you to keep shooting even when the lights get dim. Using a DX-mount camera? You’ll get a 21-36mm equivalent focal-length range.

Stepping Autofocus System. This lens’s autofocus system gives you fast, accurate performance throughout the zoom range. This system’s stepping motor provides smooth, nearly silent performance that’s particularly suited to video applications. You also get full-time manual focusing for precision adjustments, while the internal-focusing design means that the lens maintains its length during focusing.

Advanced Optics. The 14-24mm’s eleven-group/sixteen-element optical system includes three aspherical elements and four extra-low dispersion elements for sharpness, clarity, and accurate color rendering. ARNEO and Nano Crystal coatings help keep ghosting, reflections, and flares at bay; multiple elements include a Super Integrated Coating to ensure consistent color accuracy; and a fluorine finish on the front and rear elements helps prevent smudging.

High-Quality Build. This lens’s durable, moisture-resistant construction means you can use it in adverse conditions without worry. A programmable control ring lets you adjust manual focus, aperture, or exposure compensation. A built-in OLED information panel lets you quickly confirm aperture setting, focus distance, and depth of field figures on the lens in bright or dark conditions.', 3200000.0, '{"Angle of View": "114° – 84°", "Aperture Blades": "9, Rounded", "Brand": "Nikon", "Extra Low-Dispersion Elements": "4", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "11/16", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Length": "4.9\\"", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Nikon Z", "Lens Type": "Ultra Wide Angle", "Maximum Magnification": "0.13x", "Mfr. Model Number": "20097", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

