High-Quality Optics. The Nikon 28mm f/2.8’s eight-group/nine-element optical design features two aspherical elements to help promote sharpness and color rendering while limiting chromatic aberrations. Nikon has applied a Super Integrated coating to the elements to combat ghosting and lens flare, even when you’re working in bright or backlit conditions.

