Only for Nikon Z-mount cameras
Excellent for everyday use and low-light shooting
Fast, nearly silent autofocus
High-quality optics

New Nikon Z System. The Nikon Z 50mm f/1.8 S was designed specifically for cameras in Nikon’s new full-frame Z-mount system. Z-mount lenses only work with Z-mount cameras, such as the Z7 and Z6, and Z-mount cameras are only natively compatible with Z-mount lenses.

