Intuitive Controls. A programmable control ring lets you adjust manual focus, aperture, or exposure compensation; two assignable L.Fn buttons work in conjunction with cameras’ Fn buttons to let you quickly and seamlessly change exposure settings and other functions; and a Kensington lock support secures the lens in place when you’re shooting remotely.

Teleconverter Compatible. The 800mm is compatible with the Nikon Z TC-1.4x and TC-2x Teleconverters, which will further extend the lens’s reach. Each teleconverter is available as a separate rental item.', 6875000.0, '{"Angle of View": "3° 10’", "Aperture Blades": "9", "Brand": "Nikon", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon Z", "Lens Type": "Supertelephoto", "Mfr. Model Number": "20108", "Optical Design": "Groups/Elements14/22Phase Fresnel Elements1Extra-Low Dispersion Elements3Short-Wavelength Refractive Elements1", "Physical": "Dimensions (ø x L)5.5 × 15.2″Weight5.2 lbs.", "Tripod Collar": "Fixed and Rotating"}', 'Includes

