	Lens bag

*Lens hood not included!', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1209, 2, 44, 'Panasonic 35-100mm f/2.8 X Power OIS II', 'panasonic-35-100mm-f-2-8-x-power-ois-ii', 'The Panasonic 35-100mm f/2.8 X Power OIS II is a fast-aperture telephoto zoom lens. We now have the updated 35-100mm f/2.8 available. Key features include:

Excellent corner-to-corner sharpness
70-200mm focal length (35mm equivalent)
Fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus system
POWER Optical Image Stabilization system

What’s New? This update to the original Panasonic 35-100mm f/2.8 X OIS sees a new Power OIS system that adds compatibility with Panasonic’s latest-gen cameras with 5-axis Dual IS / Dual IS II.  Additional changes include an autofocus system update for faster performance, smoother automatic exposure changes via new iris, and cosmetic changes to the barrel.

Fast-Aperture Telephoto Zoom. With a focal length equivalent to 70-200mm after crop factor, the Panasonic 35-100mm f/2.8 X Power OIS II is great for sports and action photography.

High-Quality Optics. The Leica influence shows in this lens’s optics. The 35-100 features two extra-low dispersion elements and one ultra extra-low dispersion element to drastically reduce chromatic and spherical aberrations throughout the zoom range while keeping your images clear and sharp. A Nano Surface Coating reduces ghosting and flare.

Linear Autofocus Motor. This lens’s linear motor provides fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus performance for still images and videos alike.

POWER Optical Image Stabilization. The in-lens stabilizer helps to minimize camera shake. Dual-IS compatibility with supported Panasonic cameras works in tandem with sensor stabilization to further eliminate camera shake.

High-Quality Build. The 35-100mm’s high-quality splash-, dust-, and freezeproof build gives you peace of mind when shooting in adverse conditions.', 1675000.0, '{"Angle of View": "34° – 13°", "Brand": "Panasonic", "Dimensions": "Length: 3.93\\"", "Groups/Elements": "13/18", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Micro 4/3", "Lens Type": "Telephoto", "Magnification": "0.1x", "Mfr. Model Number": "H-HSA35100"}', 'Includes

