Unique double-focus system
Built-in image stabilization
Compatible with all L-mount cameras

Versatile Telephoto Zoom. The Panasonic 70-200mm f/4 S PRO OIS covers a versatile, popular range of focal lengths. Using an APS-C camera? You’ll get a 105-300mm equivalent focal-length range.

L-Mount Alliance. This wide-diameter lens mount is a joint collaboration between Leica, Panasonic, and Sigma that’s focused on a line of premium cameras & lenses in a mirrorless format. At 51.6mm mount diameter and just 20mm flange distance, the L-mount is well-suited for fast-aperture full-frame optics with compact dimensions.

Unique Double-Focus System. This lens’s double-focus system uses a linear motor and a stepping motor to provide fast, accurate, nearly silent autofocus performance for still and video use.

Constant f/4 Aperture. The constant f/4 maximum aperture gives you consistent illumination throughout the lens’s zoom range. The rounded nine-blade diaphragm contributes to a pleasing bokeh quality.

Optical Image Stabilization. The in-lens stabilizer helps to combat camera shake, allowing you to shoot at slower shutter speeds. It supports five-axis Dual I.S. and Dual I.S. 2.0 for increased stabilization.

Optics. The 17-group/23-element optical formula includes 1 aspherical element, 1 ultra extra-low dispersion element, and 3 extra-low dispersion elements to reduce chromatic aberrations and distortion.', 2525000.0, '{"Angle of View": "34° to 12°", "Aperture Blades": "9, Rounded", "Brand": "Panasonic", "Diameter": "3.32\\"", "Groups/Elements": "17/23", "Hood Included": "No", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "L", "Lens Type": "Telephoto", "Maximum Magnification": "0.25x", "Mfr. Model Number": "S-R70200", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "3.02’", "Tripod Collar": "Removable and Rotating"}', 'Includes

	Panasonic 70-200mm f/4
	S-R70200 lens hood
	77mm protective filter
	Tripod ring
	Front & rear lens caps
	Lens pouch', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1217, 2, 44, 'Panasonic 70-300mm f/4.5-5.6 S Macro OIS', 'panasonic-70-300mm-f-4-5-5-6-s-macro-ois', 'The Panasonic 70-300mm f/4.5-5.6 S Macro OIS is a versatile telephoto zoom for full-frame L-mount mirrorless cameras. Key features include:

Versatile telephoto zoom with improved tracking
Fast, accurate, quiet autofocus; full-time manual override
Built-in image stabilization with 5-axis Dual I.S. 2 support
Compatible with full-frame L-mount cameras

Versatile Telephoto Focal Length. The Panasonic 70-300mm f/4.5-5.6 S Macro OIS’s focal length makes it an excellent choice for shooting long-range sports, action, and wildlife with full-frame L-mount mirrorless cameras. You get 0.50x macro capability at 300mm for higher resolution macro images. Its f/4.5-5.6 aperture is plenty fast for daytime use, but you probably won’t want to shoot too much in low light with this lens.

L-Mount Alliance. This wide-diameter lens mount is a joint collaboration between Leica, Panasonic, and Sigma that’s focused on a line of premium cameras & lenses in a mirrorless format. At 51.6mm mount diameter and just 20mm flange distance, the L-mount is well-suited for fast-aperture full-frame optics with compact dimensions.

Improved Tracking. This lens combines half-macro and conventional tracking accuracy by increasing the zoom-position detection performance by three times, and wobbling control at 240 Hz means that precise zoom-tracking control is up to eight times faster during telephoto operation.

High-Speed Stepping Autofocus Motor. The motor provides fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus performance for still and video use. You can use the AF/MF switch to easily toggle between autofocus and manual focus modes, and you can use the zoom-lock switch to prevent the lens from extending when you’re not using it.

Optical Image Stabilization. The in-lens stabilizer helps to combat camera shake, allowing you to shoot at slower shutter speeds. It supports five-axis Dual I.S. 2 for increased stabilization.

Advanced Optical Design. The eleven-group/seventeen-element optical formula includes one ultra extra-low dispersion element, two extra-low dispersion elements, and one ultra high-refractive index element to reduce chromatic aberrations and distortion.', 2100000.0, '{"Angle of View": "8.3-34°", "Aperture Blades": "11, rounded", "Brand": "Panasonic", "Dimensions": "3.3 × 5.8″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "77.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "70-300", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "11/17", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "L", "Lens Type": "Telephoto, Macro, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "4.5", "Maximum Magnification": "0.5x", "Mfr. Model Number": "S-R70300", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "1.8’", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "1.7 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Panasonic 70-300mm f/4.5-5.6 S Macro OIS
	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	77mm protective filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1218, 1, 44, 'Panasonic AG-CX10 4K Camcorder w/ NDI Upgrade', 'panasonic-ag-cx10-4k-camcorder-w-ndi-upgrade', 'The Panasonic AG-CX10 4K Camcorder w/ NDI Upgrade is a camcorder with a 24x optical zoom and NDI|HX license. For a higher-quality SDI option, see the AG-CX370 4K. Key features include:

NDI|HX for Streaming and IP Control
Up to UHD 4K60 Video, 3G-SDI, HDMI Out
24x Optical Zoom, 48x Digital iZoom
1/2.5" 8.29M MOS Sensor, Venus Engine

NDI|HX Upgrade. With the pre-installed NDI license from NewTek, this version of the CX10 can transmit live video over IP to any NDI compatible hardware or software. The NDI implementation on this camera provides video, audio, camera control, & tally via one ethernet cable. Camera control may vary dependent upon the hardware of software solution being used.

Integrated Zoom Lens. The wide-angle 24x optical lens offers a zoom range of 25 to 600mm (35mm-equivalent), and it features 32x iZoom in 4K and 48x iZoom in HD. Panasonic’s exclusive high-precision AF also provides high-speed, accurate focusing for both 4K and Full HD shooting.

Recording Options. The camera supports a variety of high-quality recording options using the Venus engine, including 4:2:2 10-bit internal recording with a maximum 29.97p in UHD, and a maximum 59.94p in FHD. When recording in 10-bit, the camcorder delivers 4K 60p 4:2:2 10-bit HDMI output. It also supports HEVC recording (LongGOP/10-bit 4:2:0/MOV) at 59.94p with a bit rate of 200 Mb/s. In addition to MOV, MP4, and AVCHD, the AG-CX10 also supports P2 MXF for broadcast stations, with AVC-LongG support, plus AVC-Intra100/50 support planned via a future firmware update. Dual SD card slots support relay recording for virtually limitless record times.

Please note P2 recording requires microP2 cards, which we no longer stock.

IP Workflow. The AG-CX10 includes advanced IP networking features, such as built-in Wi-Fi support for HD live streaming to YouTube, Facebook, and other social sites via RTMP/RTMPS/RTSP protocols. In addition, the AG-CX10 includes an Ethernet connection for streaming and an NDI|HX connectivity for use in live production, as well as ROP tablet-based control.

Alternatives Available. If you’re looking for a higher-quality SDI camcorder option, we have the AG-CX370 4K Camcorder w/ NDI HX2 and Auto-Tracking available!', 4225000.0, '{"Brand": "Panasonic", "Camera Type": "Camcorder", "Compatible Media": "SD", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "1080p", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Swivel", "Sensor Size": "1-Inch", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Viewfinder Type": "Electronic", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi"}', 'Includes

	Panasonic AG-CX10 4K w/ NDI upgrade
	Hood
	Mic mount
	AG-VBR59P battery
	Dual charger
	USB micro-AB to host cable
	USB Ethernet adapter
	AC adapter
	Power cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1219, 1, 44, 'Panasonic AG-CX350 4K Camcorder', 'panasonic-ag-cx350-4k-camcorder', 'The Panasonic AG-CX350 4K is a professional-grade UHD 4K video camera with a wide class zoom range. Key features include:

1" 15MP 4K UHD MOS Sensor
24.5-490mm f/2.8-4.5 20x optical zoom lens
Capture 4K up to 60p or FHD up to 120p
Three rings for manual zoom, focus, and iris control

NDI HX Supported. With the pre-installed NDI HX license from NewTek, this version of the CX350 can transmit live video over IP to any NDI-compatible hardware or software. The NDI implementation on this camera provides video, audio, camera control, and tally over one Ethernet cable. Camera control may vary depending on the hardware or software used. For an upgraded version of this camera with expanded I/O and a newer NDI HX2 driver, check out the Panasonic AG-CX370.

4K MOS Sensor. The Panasonic AG-CX350 uses a single 1"-type, 15 megapixel MOS sensor for recording high-quality images in 4K/HDR. We strongly recommend using V90 memory cards for 4K capture.

Integrated Zoom Lens. This camera features a fixed lens with an impressive 20x optical zoom. If you need more range, the intelligent zoom enables an additional 24x in UHD or 32x in HD without degrading your image quality. Thanks to the 5-axis hybrid image stabilization, you don’t need to worry about extra support for those longer throws.

Recording Range. The AG-CX350 gives you a wide range of compression options, including AVC-Ultra formats, commonly found in popular P2 ENG-style cameras like the Panasonic AJ-PX270, and HEVC 100Mbps for 4K60p. Unlimited relay recording with dual SD slots allows you to capture all standard frame rates up to 4:2:2 10-bit in UHD or HD and VFR UHD from 1 to 60 fps or FHD from 1 to 120 fps without cropping.

Hybrid-Log Gamma. This camera’s Hybrid-Log Gamma feature means that your footage will look remarkable on HDR and standard televisions without requiring additional color correction. A total of eight different gamma modes ensure versatility and creative control for any setting.

Additional Features. This camera boasts a large 3.2-inch 1.62m-dot LCD touchscreen that lets you control a range of functions, while the high-resolution, 2.36m-dot viewfinder makes shot composition simple. The ND filter system offers Clear, 1/4ND, 1/16ND, and 1/64ND presets as well as a built-in IR cut filter. I/O support like four-channel audio, simultaneous SDI and HDMI out, and LANC compatibility makes this a go-to for shooters in the field or in the studio.

Looking for Additional Power? Check out our Panasonic AG-VBR118G Dolgin Power Kit.', 6625000.0, '{"Brand": "Panasonic", "Camera Type": "Camcorder", "Compatible Media": "SD", "Imaging": "Sensor \\t\\tType: 1” MOS Effective Pixels: 15MP \\tBit Depth \\t\\t4:2:2 10-bit 4:2:0 8-bit", "Inputs/Outputs": "Audio Inputs \\t\\t2x XLR 3-pin \\tAudio Output \\t\\t1x 3.5mm stereo mini jack \\tVideo Outputs \\t\\t1x HDMI (type A) 1x SDI (BNC) \\tAdditional Inputs/Outputs \\t\\tTC In/Outn: 1x BNC Remote: 1x 2.5mm super mini jack LAN: RJ-45 USB 2.0 Host: Type A USB 3.0 Device: 3.1 Type C", "Item Type": "Camera", "Lens": "Zoom \\t\\t20x motorized optical zoom \\t\\tUp to 32x using i.Zoom \\tEffective Focal Length \\t\\t24.5mm – 490mm \\tMax Aperture \\t\\tf/2.8 – f/4.5 \\tMinimum Focusing Distance \\t\\t0.39” (W) 3.3’ (T) \\tImage Stabilization Modes \\t\\t5 axis hybrid \\tFilter Diameter \\t\\t67mm", "Maximum Video Resolution": "4K", "Monitoring": "Viewfinder \\t\\t0.39-type OLED \\tLCD Panel \\t\\t3.5-type TFTLCD \\tInternal Microphone \\tStereo", "Physical": "Dimensions (WxHxD) \\t\\t180mm x 173mm x 311mm \\tWeight Camera body only: Approximately 4.19 lbs Camera with battery/hood: Approximately 5.07 lbs. \\tAccessory Mounts: \\t\\tTripod: ¼-20 and ⅜-16 (1x each) \\t\\tAdditional: 2x accessory shoe", "Power Supply": "AC Adapter(type) \\tBattery Compatibility \\t\\tType: AG-VBR59 (supplied)/AG-VBR118 \\t\\tOperating Time: 121 minutes(VBR59)/242 minutes (VBR118) \\t\\tRecharge Time: Approximately 200 min. (AG-VBR59P)/300 min. (AG-VBR118G)", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Swivel", "Sensor Size": "1-Inch", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Viewfinder Type": "Electronic", "Weather Sealing": "No"}', 'Includes

	Panasonic AG-CX350 4K
	Hood
	Mic mount
	AG-VBR59P battery
	AC Adapter
	Dual charger
	Non-polarized cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1220, 1, 44, 'Panasonic AG-CX370 4K Camcorder w/ NDI HX2 and Auto-Tracking', 'panasonic-ag-cx370-4k-camcorder-w-ndi-hx2-and-auto-tracking', 'The Panasonic AG-CX370 is a broadcast-optimized camcorder that improves on the AG-CX350. Key features include:

1" 15MP 4K UHD MOS Sensor
24.5-490mm f/2.8-4.5 20x optical zoom lens
Vertical video, 5-axis hybrid stabilization
Genlock, 12G-SDI

What’s Changed? The Panasonic AG-CX370 builds on the broadcast-focused AG-CX350 with a few higher-end upgrades to meet the demands of modern video production and live streaming. Key among those is a genlock input terminal for easy multi-camera syncing and 12G-SDI for uncompressed 4K out. While the prior camera offered a 3.5mm stereo jack that supported two-channel audio, this one supports four channels in addition to the standard dual XLR inputs. Lastly, the AG-CX370 is equipped with NDI HX2, which was designed to specifically tackle environments with poor network connections.

Optimized for Live Productions. With built-in NDI HX2 compatibility, the AG-CX370 supports video transmission and camera control over IP when paired with NDI-compatible devices, including switchers and decoders. Stream your content in UHD 4K and simultaneously record in 1080p using standard streaming protocols (you currently cannot stream in 4K while recording in 4K). Please note that simultaneous recording, streaming, and 4K output are not supported when using NDI HX2 mode. When not streaming, you can record uncompressed 4K out over SDI and HDMI at once. Broadcast-ready grading offers 16-axis color correction, skin detail, color temperature, and more. The AG-CX370 also features P2 MXF file format support for simultaneous main and proxy recording in V-Log and Hybrid Log.

Camcorder Convenient, Cinema Features. A fast and long-reaching built-in lens makes this camera pick-up-and-go convenient without giving up some core professional fittings. The lens has three-ring control for zoom, focus, and iris, along with a multistep lever on the handle for smooth zooming at slow speeds. This 24.5-490mm (equivalent) lens has minimal distortion and its i.Zoom technology supports up to 24x zoom in 4K and 32x in 1080p. Built-in hybrid stabilization gives you the option of hand-held shooting and the high-precision autofocus system performs auto-tracking with face detection. Monitoring your footage is easy with simultaneous LCD and EVF viewing and the 3:2 aspect ratio leaves room for timecode and camera status displays. Overall, the AG-CX370 is a great choice for run-and-gun projects, streaming and recording events, and documentary work.', 8425000.0, '{"Brand": "Panasonic", "Camera Type": "Camcorder", "Compatible Media": "SD", "General": "Accessory Mounts2x cold shoesBattery TypePanasonic AG-VBR-seriesDimensions (W x H x D)7.1 × 6.8 × 12.2″Mfr. Model NumberAG-CX370 Monitor3.2\\" articulating touchscreenWeight4.2 lb.", "Imaging": "ISOISO Range: 400-12,800Max ResolutionUHD 4K (3840 × 2160)ND FiltersBuilt-in (mechanical)Sensor15.03MP 1\\"-Type MOSShutterElectronic rollingStabilizationOptical, in lens", "Inputs/Outputs": "Audio I/O1x 3.5mm headphone jack2x 3-pin XLR mic/lineOther I/O1x USB-C1x USB-A1x BNC (ref/TC)1x BNC (genlock)1x 2.5mm LANCEthernet (LAN, shared with NDI)Power I/O12V DC inputAG-VBR battery portStorage I/O2x SD UHS-II slotsVideo I/OHDMI Type-A1x BNC (12G-SDI)1x 3.5mm TRRS A/V (composite)1x Ethernet (NDI, shared with LAN)", "Item Type": "Camera", "Lens": "Filter Size67mmFocal Length8.8-176mm (24.5-490mm equivalent)Focus TypeAutofocus and Manual FocusMax Aperturef/2.8-4.5Min Focusing Distance3.9\\"Prime/ZoomZoom (20x optical, 32x digital HD, 24x digital 4K)", "Maximum Video Resolution": "4K", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Swivel", "Sensor Size": "1-Inch", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Video Capture": "CompressionH.264/HEVCH.264/AVCFormat.MP4.MOVResolutionUHD 4K (3840 × 2160) up to 30 fpsFHD (1920 × 1080p) up to 120 fpsUHD 4K (3840 × 2160) up to 59.94 fps (HDMI out)UHD 4K (3840 × 2160) up to 59.94 fps (SDI/BNC out)", "Viewfinder Type": "Electronic", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi"}', 'Includes

	Panasonic AG-CX370 4K camcorder
	Panasonic AG-CX350/AG-CX370 hood
	Panasonic mic mount
	Panasonic SAE0011 AC adapter
	Panasonic AG-BRD50P charger
	Non-polarized charger cable
	Panasonic AG-VBR59 battery', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1221, 1, 44, 'Panasonic AG-DVX200', 'panasonic-ag-dvx200', 'The AG-DVX200 is Panasonic’s first foray into the 4K compact pro-camcorder market and a user-friendly alternative to the Panasonic AJ-PX270 Camcorder. Key features include:

4/3" 15.49MP large format sensor
28-365.3mm F/2.8-4.5 13x optical zoom lens
Capture 4K DCI up to 24p or UHD up to 60p in MOV or MP4
Wide 12-stop dynamic range with V-Log L processing

Simple 4K for Broadcast. If you’ve ever operated an earlier generation P2 camera like the Panasonic AJ-PX270, you will probably notice the improved user interface right away. Coupled with a large 4/3-type sensor providing bokeh and shallow depth of field and Panasonic’s V-Log flat picture profile, you can capture cinematic images across all twelve stops of dynamic range in a fixed lens format.

FHD Over and Undercrank. An Full HD Variable Frame-Rate Mode allows you to record from 2 to 120 fps over a 59.94p, 29.97p, or 23.98p base in 1920 × 1080 resolution.

13x Optical Zoom. The integrated 29.5-384.9mm f/2.8-f/4.5 (35mm equivalent) lens features five-axis hybrid image stabilization and three independent rings for control over mechanical zoom, focus, and iris.

Records to SD Memory. The AG-DVX200 offers an array of resolutions and bit rates including DCI 4K 24p at 100 Mbps, UHD 4K up to 60p at 150 Mbps. The dual-slot SD recording allows for spanned recordings or creation of low-resolution proxy files. Please note that UHS Speed Class 3 cards are required for 4K capture.', 5475000.0, '{"Battery": "Compatibility VW-VBD59P (included)Life 95 mins. (VW-VBD59P)", "Brand": "Panasonic", "Camera Type": "Camcorder", "Compatible Media": "SD", "DC Input": "DC 12 V (when the AC adaptor is used)", "Frame Rates": "4096 × 2160 – 24.00p, 3840 × 2160 – 59.94p, 29.97p, 23.98p, 1920×1080 – 59.94P, 59.94i, 29.97p, 23.98p, 1440 × 1080 – 59.94i, 1280×720 – 59.94p, 720×480 –  59.94i, and Variable Frame Rate Mode: 2 to 120 FPS over 59.94p, 29.97p, 23.98p base", "Inputs/Outputs": "Audio Inputs \\t\\t2x XLR 3-pin \\tAudio Output \\t\\t1x 3.5mm stereo mini jack \\tVideo Outputs \\t\\t1x HDMI (type A) 1x BNC (3G/1.5G)  Additional Inputs/Outputs \\t\\tVideo Out/Genlock In: 1x BNC Cam Remote: 1x 2.5mm super mini jack(Zoom S/S) and 1x 3.5mm (Focus/Iris) mini jackTC In/Out: 1x BNCUSB Device: 3.0 Type micro BUSB host: 2.0/3.0 Type A", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "4K", "Recording Formats": "H.264 (MP4/MOV): 4K, UHD, and FHD, AVCHD 1920×1080, 1280×720, and Audio – LPCM (16 bits, 48 kHz, 2 channels)", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Swivel", "Sensor": "4/3 MOS Sensor", "Sensor Size": "4/3", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Viewfinder Type": "Electronic", "Weather Sealing": "No"}', 'Includes

	AG-DVX200
	Hood
	Mic mount
	AG-VBR118G battery
	AG-BRD50P Dual Battery Charger
	(2) SAE0011 AC adapter
	(2) Non-polarized cords
	Bag or hard case', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1222, 1, 44, 'Panasonic AU-EVA1 Compact 5.7K Super 35 Cinema Camera', 'panasonic-au-eva1-compact-5-7k-super-35-cinema-camera', 'The Panasonic AU-EVA1 Compact 5.7K Super 35 Cinema Camera is a flexible, high-quality cinema camera system. Key features include:

17.25MP Dual Sensitivity 5.7K S35 sensor
Internal 4:2:2 10-bit in 4K DCI, UHD, and full HD
MOV or AVCHD (4:2:0 8-bit) recording options or output RAW
Netflix approved camera

5.7K Image Sensor. The Panasonic AU-EVA1 Compact 5.7K Super 35 Cinema Camera is based around a high-resolution 5.7K sensor that can produce oversampled 4K footage. This gives you sharper images and more accurate colors than native 4K sensors.

Dual Native ISO. The 5.7K sensor incorporates Dual Native ISO, which increases sensitivity and maintains a high signal-to-noise ratio. This camera’s standard native ISO is 800, but you can switch it to 2500 if you’re shooting in low light.

V-Log and V-Gamut Capture. The EVA1 includes both V-Log and V-Gamut capture. The former gives you curve characteristics similar to those of negative film, while the latter produces a color space that’s larger than film. The inclusion of V-Log and V-Gamut lets you use the EVA1 in HDR and SDR production workflows.

Recording Modes. The EVA1 offers up to 10-bit 4:2:2 sampling, even at 4K resolutions. You can capture in-camera footage in 4K (4096 × 2160), UHD (3840 × 2160), 2K (2048 × 1080), Full-HD (1920 × 1080), and HD (1280 × 720). The EVA1 also gives you up to 59.94 fps for 4K, up to 120 fps for 2K and Full-HD, or 240 fps with an image sensor crop.

Records to SDXC Cards. This camera records to V60-rated SD cards (not included), which support all of its internal recording modes—even the 10-bit 4:2:2 AK modes. You get two card slots so that you can simultaneously record to two cards or continuously record from card to card.

Electronic Image Stabilization. The EVA1’s built-in image-stabilization system helps keep your images clear and sharp, even when you’re shooting hand-held or shoulder-mounted.

EF Lens Mount. This camera’s EF lens mount supports a wide array of popular manufacturers’ lenses. You can view a Panasonic-verified list of compatible lenses here. Please note that the auto-iris function may have more noise than what is acceptable in some shooting situations, causing Panasonic to recommend manual iris only for many compatible lenses.

Additional Features. The EVA1 offers a range of imaging tools, including Waveform, Zebras, and Peaking. It gives you focus squares to help you achieve critical focus. You get dual XLR audio inputs; independently adjustable, 4K-capable HDMI and SDI video outputs; and timecode functionality. Finally, there are integrated, motorized ND and IR-cut filters.

Need a Memory Card? You’ll need an ultra-fast memory card for a camera this powerful, and we recommend the Sony 128GB SF-G Tough Series UHS-II SDXC. This camera can take full advantage of its superior 299 MB/s max write speed and 300 MB/s max read speed for high-resolution, high-bitrate capture.', 4500000.0, '{"Brand": "Panasonic", "Camera Mount": "Canon EF", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Compatible Media": "SD", "Imaging": "Maximum Resolution \\t\\tDCI 4K (4096 × 2160)  \\tSensor \\t\\tType: Super 35, MOS \\t\\tSize: 24.60mm x 12.97mm Effective Pixels: Approximately 17.25 MP \\tCrop Factor x 1.15 (S35 mode) \\tBit Depth4:2:2 10 bit (MOV)4:2:0 8 bit (MOV/AVCHD) \\tISO \\t\\tDynamic Range: 14 stops \\t\\tDefault Sensitivity Range: 200 to 2000 (800 base)/1000 to 25600 (2500 base) \\t\\tExpanded Sensitivity Range: (values) \\t\\tNative ISO: 800/2500 (dual) FiltersElectrical Driven ND (0.6ND, 1.2ND, 1.8ND)IR Cut Filter", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "5K", "Physical": "Dimensions (W x H x D) 135 × 133 × 170mm WeightBody Only: 2.65 lbsBody with Accessories: 4.5 lbs. \\tAccessory Mounts: Tripod: 1x ¼-20 and 1x ⅜-16 Additional: Cold shoe mount", "Power Supply": "AC AdapterSAE0011 (included) \\tBattery \\t\\tType: AG-VBR59P (included)/AG-VBR118G (available as a separate rental item) \\t\\tOperating Time: Approximately 90 min (AG-VBR59P)/215 min. (AG-VBR118G) \\t\\tRecharge Time: Approximately 200 min. (AG-VBR59P)/300 min. (AG-VBR118G)", "Recording": "Formats \\t\\tVideo: H.264/MPEG-4 AVC High Profile \\t\\tAudio: 48 kHz/24 bit 2 CH, Linear PCM (MOV), 48 kHz/16 bit, 2 CH, Dolby Audio™ (AVCHD) \\t\\tFile: MOV, AVCHD  \\t MOV Modes \\t\\t400 Mbps 422Intra: 4096 × 2160/3840 × 2160 (23.98p, 29.97p)  150 Mbps 422LongGOP: 4096 × 2160/3840 × 2160 (23.98p, 29.97p) 150 Mbps 420LongGOP: 4096 × 2160/3840 × 2160 (59.94p) 100 Mbps 420LongGOP: 4096 × 2160/3840 × 2160/204 (23.98p, 29.97p)  200 Mbps 422Intra: 2048 × 1080/1920 × 1080 (59.94p) 100 Mbps 422Intra: 2048 × 1080 (23.98p, 29.97p)/1920 × 1080 (23.98p, 29.97p, 59.94i)  100 Mbps 422LongGOP: 2048 × 1080/1920 × 1080 (59.94p) 50 Mbps 422LongGOP: 2048 × 1080 (23.98p, 29.97p)/1920 × 1080 (23.98p, 29.97p, 59.94i) \\tMedia \\t\\tType: 2 slot SD \\t\\tHigh Resolution Class Requirement: Class V60 or faster  \\tApproximate Record Times \\t\\t400 Mbps: Approximately 0.3 Min/GB 150 Mbps: Approximately 0.86 Min/GB 100 Mbps: Approximately 1.4 Min/GB 50 Mbps: Approximately 2.5 Min/GB   \\tMulti-Slot Recording Methods \\t\\tSimul RecRelay Rec", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Swivel", "Sensor Size": "Super35", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi"}', 'Includes

	Panasonic AU-EVA1
	AG-VBR118G battery
	AC adapter
	AC adapter cable
	AG-BRD50P battery charger
	Mic holder
	Mic holder adapter
	LCD monitor
	LCD hood
	LCD mount
	Top handle
	Handgrip
	Grip belt
	EF port cap', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1223, 1, 44, 'Panasonic AW-UE160 UHD 4K 20x PTZ Camera', 'panasonic-aw-ue160-uhd-4k-20x-ptz-camera', 'The Panasonic AW-UE160 UHD 4K 20x PTZ Camera is designed to capture the clearest of images in the most challenging environments. Key features include:

Phase-detection autofocus
20x optical zoom
Two XLR audio inputs
75.1° horizontal viewing angle

Professional 4K PTZ Camera. The Panasonic AW-UE160 UHD 4K 20x PTZ Camera fits right into professional productions, conferences, or classrooms. It outputs UHD 4K60 video at up to 60p over HDMI, Full HD at up to 60p over SDI, and supports live streaming up to Full HD 60p. This unit offers a 20x optical zoom, with a 75.1° horizontal viewing angle.

Low Light Support & Moiré Reduction. The high sensitivity of the new 4K 1" MOS sensor allows for clear, clean images even when shooting in dimly lit locations such as stages and live venues. The sensitivity can be set to either Normal mode or Low Light mode, depending on what the lighting is like where you’re shooting. Moiré is defined as the noticeable contrast between the light of the image and the darkness of the gap between an LED wall or screen. This unit reduces that contrast using the integrated Optical Low Pass Filter, ultimately smoothing out those gaps for high-quality video output.

Image Stabilization. In addition to the usual 2-axis in-lens image stabilization, this camera also features roll correction that uses electronic image processing technology to provide highly effective correction. Stable images with reduced blurring can be shot even in locations where special equipment such as a rail systems or camera arms are used.

Tally Talk. This camera features two tally lamps, one located on the front, and one located on the rear side of the device. These tally lamps allow you to see the camera status from any angle, and can be linked to the front and rear sides to set the brightness and to turn the tally indicators on or off. The additional yellow tally lamp is especially helpful when there are a large number of cameras, when multiple cameras are used on site, or when simultaneous streaming and recording are required.

Inputs & Outputs. The UE160 camera supports HDMI, 3G-SDI, 12G-SDI, IP, and optical fiber outputs. The output method can be selected to suit the operation, making it easy to add to an existing imaging system or build a system tailored to the site. This unit is also equipped with two XLR channels for audio input. In addition, there are no restrictions on the video output method, even when outputting from multiple terminals simultaneously, allowing simultaneous operation in 4K.

Slow Motion Style. This unit uses an HDMI output to capture smooth and grain-free video during sports or other high motion events by performing high-speed shooting at FHD 120 fps, so not a single frame of the decisive moment is missed.

Functions & Support. Cropping your image while simultaneously outputting 4K video is a newer feature of the Panasonic PTZ line, and allows cropping positions from up to three locations. This unit is also V-Log compatible, enabling you to provide suitable images for color grading. High Dynamic Range (HDR) is also supported to prevent blown-out highlights and blocked-up shadows, which help you create picture quality close to that of the naked eye.

Mount Like You Mean It. This camera is compact and lightweight enough to permanently or temporarily install, and includes a horizontal level gauge to ensure your setup is perfectly level.  It’s equipped with a 1/4"-20 thread for mounting to most standard tripods. Please note, this product does not include a ceiling or wall mount.', 19700000.0, '{"Brand": "Panasonic", "Camera Type": "PTZ", "Compatible Media": "External Storage", "Control": "Move SpeedPan: 0.08 to 1800°/secTilt: 0.08 to 1800°/sec Movement RangePan: 350° (-175 to 175°)Tilt: 240° (-30 to 210°) Tally LightYes Supported Control ProtocolsIPRS-422 Max Cable Length328.1’  (Cat 5e, Cat 6)", "Environmental": "Operating Temperature32 to 104°F Storage Temperature-4 to 122°F Operating Humidity20 to 90%", "Exposure Control": "Shutter Speed1/2000 to 1/48 Second Gain0 to 36 dB Precise Scan Rate ControlYes Flip / Mirror SupportImage Flip White Balance2000 to 15,000K", "General": "Dimensions (W x H x D)10.9 × 9.4 × 8.4″ Weight10.1 lb", "Imaging": "Sensor Type1\\"-Type MOS Sensor Horizontal Resolution (TV Lines)1600 TV Lines Sensor ResolutionEffective: 9.62 Megapixel Built-In ND FilterMechanical Filter Wheel with 2-Stop (1/4), 4-Stop (1/16), 6-Stop (1/64) ND Filters Low Pass FilterOptical Focus ControlAutofocusManual Focus", "Interface": "Video I/O1 x BNC (12G-SDI) Output2 x BNC (3G-SDI) Output1 x HDMI 2.0 Output Audio I/O2 x XLR 3-Pin Mic/Line (48 V Phantom Power) Input Other I/O1 x RJ45 (LAN) Control1 x RJ45 (RS-422) Expansion Slots1 x SFP Slot", "Item Type": "Camera", "Lens": "Focal Length8.8 to 176mm (35mm Equivalent Focal Length: 24.5 to 490mm) Optical Zoom Ratio20x Field of ViewHorizontal: 75.1 to 4°Vertical: 46.7 to 2.3°Diagonal: 82.8 to 4.6° Maximum Aperturef/2.8 to 4.5", "Maximum Video Resolution": "4K", "Power": "PoE SupportPoE++ 802.3bt Power I/O1 x XLR 4-Pin (12VDC at 1.5 A) Input Power Consumption10.8 to 13.2 VDC at 5 APoE: 42 to 57 VDC", "Sensor Size": "1-Inch", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Video Capture": "External Recording Modes\\nSDI/BNC / HDMI / RJ45UHD 4K (3840 × 2160) at 23.98/24.00/25/29.97/50/59.94 fpsHD (1920 × 1080p) at 23.98/24.00/25/29.97/50/59.94/60.00 fpsHD (1920 × 1080i) at 50/59.94 fps1280 × 720 at 50/59.94 fps Broadcast OutputNTSC/PAL Gamma CurveHDR-HLG, Normal 1", "Weather Sealing": "Yes"}', 'Includes

	Panasonic AW-UE160 UHD 4K 20x
	Lens cap
