High-Quality Build. The 12-60mm’s high-quality splash-, dust-, and freeze-proof metal build gives you peace of mind when shooting in adverse conditions.', 1600000.0, '{"Angle of View": "84° to 20°", "Brand": "Panasonic", "Dimensions": "Length: 3.39\\"", "Groups/Elements": "12/14", "Hood Included": "No", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Micro 4/3", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle, Standard, and Telephoto", "Magnification": "3x", "Mfr. Model Number": "H-ES12060", "Weight": "0.71"}', 'Includes

