Built-In Stabilizer. The in-lens MEGA OIS stabilizer helps to prevent camera shake. However, when shoot 1:1 macro you’ll absolutely want to be locked down on a tripod.', 1025000.0, '{"Angle of View": "27º", "Aperture Blades": "7, rounded", "Brand": "Panasonic", "Dimensions": "2.5 × 2.5″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "46.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "45-45", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "10/14", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Micro 4/3", "Lens Mount": "Micro 4/3", "Lens Type": "Telephoto, Macro, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "1x", "Mfr. Model Number": "H-ES045", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "5.91\\"", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "0.5 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

