INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1267, 1, 44, 'Panasonic Lumix L10', 'panasonic-lumix-l10', 'New Product – Coming Soon.

Place your reservation now! We fill orders on a first-come, first-served basis. Please note that included items and rental cost could change as we finalize this listing.

If the listed rental price increases between your preorder and ship dates, don’t worry—you’ll be locked in at your original pre-order price. And if the price decreases, you’ll still pay the lower price. We’ll always contact you to confirm pricing before we ship your order.

Offering advanced versatility and impressive quality in a sleek, stylish design, the Panasonic LUMIX L10 is a premium compact camera characterized by the unique 20.4MP Multi-Aspect BSI CMOS sensor and a Leica-designed 24-75mm-equivalent zoom lens. The large sensor and flexible zoom realize a multimedia creator’s tool that’s capable of recording rich photos with unique Photo Style or videos up to 5.6K with accurate focus, reliable OIS, and a handsome camera body design.

Key features include:

Multi-Aspect 20.4MP BSI CMOS Sensor
	Leica 10.9-34mm f/1.7-2.8 Lens
	24-75mm Full-Frame Equivalent
	AI-Tracking PDAF & POWER O.I.S.', 2350000.0, '{"Brand": "Panasonic", "Camera Type": "Compact", "Item Type": "Camera"}', 'Includes

	Panasonic Lumix L10', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1268, 2, 44, 'Panasonic Lumix S 100mm f/2.8 Macro for L-Mount', 'panasonic-lumix-s-100mm-f-2-8-macro-for-l-mount', 'The Panasonic Lumix S 100mm f/2.8 Macro for L-Mount is a bright, ultra-compact medium-telephoto macro prime designed for full-frame L-mount mirrorless cameras. Key features include:

Fast, compact medium-telephoto macro prime
High-quality optical design for sharp, clear images
Fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus system
Splash-. dust-, and freezeproof metal build

Medium-Telephoto Macro Prime. The Panasonic Lumix S 100mm f/2.8 Macro’s medium-telephoto focal length, 1:1 magnification ratio, and 8-inch minimum focusing distance make it a stellar choice for portraiture and detailed close-ups, while its bright f/2.8 aperture and rounded nine-blade diaphragm produce pleasing circular bokeh.

L-Mount Alliance. This wide-diameter lens mount is a joint collaboration between Leica, Panasonic, and Sigma that’s focused on a line of premium cameras and lenses in a mirrorless format. With a 51.6mm mount diameter and just 20mm of flange distance, the L-mount is well-suited for fast-aperture full-frame optics with compact dimensions.

Linear Autofocus System. The 100mm f/2.8’s autofocus system uses a compact, newly developed dual-phase linear motor to provide fast, accurate, nearly silent performance that’s as great for video as it is for stills. The AF/MF switch lets you easily toggle between autofocus and manual-focus modes, and the focus-range selector switch lets you select 0.204 to 0.5m, 0.5 to Infinity, or FULL.

Premium Optics. This lens’s eleven-group/thirteen-element optical formula incorporates three aspherical elements, two ultra extra-low dispersion elements, and one extra-low dispersion element, which combine to reduce chromatic and spherical aberrations while producing sharp, clear, color-accurate images.

Compact Weatherproof Build. The lens barrel’s metal construction provides a solid, yet lightweight feel, while its splash-. dust-, and freeze-proof design lets you work with confidence in inclement weather conditions down to -14°F.', 1550000.0, '{"Angle of View": "24°", "Aperture Blades": "9, rounded", "Brand": "Panasonic", "Dimensions": "2.9 × 3.2\\" (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "77.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "70-300", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "11/13", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "L", "Lens Type": "Telephoto, Macro, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "4.5", "Maximum Magnification": "1x", "Mfr. Model Number": "S-E100", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "8\\"", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "1.7 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Panasonic Lumix S 100mm f/2.8 Macro for L-Mount
	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	67mm protective filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1269, 2, 44, 'Panasonic Lumix S 18-40mm f/4.5-6.3', 'panasonic-lumix-s-18-40mm-f-4-5-6-3', 'With this lens, Panasonic is the first to market with the world’s smallest and lightest autofocus zoom lens for a full frame system! At 5.5 ounces and 1.6 inches long, the Panasonic Lumix S 18-40mm is the perfect travel companion. Key features include:

Full-frame, L-mount zoom
Ultra-wide to wide-portrait focal range
Suppressed focus breathing
Durable build with weather resistance

The Ultimate Carry-Everywhere Lens. This tiny L-mount, full-frame lens offers a unique wide-to-normal focal range that is ideal for landscapes, cityscapes, street photography, and interiors. This, coupled with its pancake lens-like build, makes the Panasonic Lumix S 18-40mm a great option for travelers and vloggers. It also offers a surprisingly robust build with resistance to adverse weather.

Compatibility Features. This lens is originally intended for the Panasonic S9 and is compatible with that camera’s Hybrid Zoom feature, which effectively makes the 18-40mm an 18-120mm by merging digital and optical zooms. The design overall matches the size and aesthetic of the S9. However, this lens is compatible with any L-mount camera. The Panasonic Lumix 18-40mm is suitable for both photography and videography. It is equipped with focus breathing suppression and has a nice close focusing distance of just 5.9".', 1000000.0, '{"Angle of View": "100-57°", "Brand": "Panasonic", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "L", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle", "Mfr. Model Number": "S-R1840"}', 'Includes

	Panasonic Lumix S 18-40mm f/4.5-6.3
	Front & rear caps
	62mm Hoya EVO Antistatic filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1270, 2, 44, 'Panasonic Lumix S 18mm f/1.8', 'panasonic-lumix-s-18mm-f-1-8', 'The Panasonic Lumix S 18mm f/1.8 is a bright, compact ultra-wide prime designed for full-frame L-mount mirrorless cameras. Key features include:

Compact, fast-aperture ultra-wide prime
High-quality optical design for sharp, clear images
Fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus system
Splash-. dust-, and freeze-resistant metal build

Compact Ultra-Wide Angle Prime. The Panasonic Lumix S 18mm f/1.8’s ultra-wide focal length makes it a particularly great option for landscape, interior, and architectural photography. Its bright f/1.8 aperture and rounded nine-blade diaphragm produce pleasing bokeh and smooth defocus gradation. Using an APS-C camera? You’ll get a 27mm focal length.

L-Mount Alliance. This wide-diameter lens mount is a joint collaboration between Leica, Panasonic, and Sigma that’s focused on a line of premium cameras and lenses in a mirrorless format. At 51.6mm mount diameter and just 20mm flange distance, the L-mount is well-suited for fast-aperture full-frame optics with compact dimensions.

Linear Autofocus System. The 18mm f/1.8’s autofocus system uses a linear motor to provide fast, accurate, nearly silent performance for still and video use while suppressing focus breathing. You can use the AF/MF switch to easily toggle between autofocus and manual focus modes, and a 7.1-inch minimum focusing distance will let you get in pretty close.

Premium Optics. This lens’s twelve-group/thirteen-element optical formula features three aspherical elements, three extra-low dispersion elements, an ultra extra-low refractive index element, and an ultra-high refractive index element to reduce chromatic aberrations and color fringing, producing sharp, clear, color-accurate images.

High-Quality Build. The lens barrel’s metal construction provides a solid, yet lightweight feel, while its splash-. dust-, and freeze-resistant design lets you work in inclement weather conditions down to -14° with confidence.', 1500000.0, '{"Angle of View": "100°", "Aperture Blades": "9, Rounded", "Brand": "Panasonic", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "L", "Lens Type": "Ultra Wide Angle", "Maximum Magnification": "0.2x", "Mfr. Model Number": "S-S18", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "0.6’", "Optical Design": "Groups/Elements12/13Aspherical Elements3Extra-Low Dispersion Elements3Ultra Extra-Low Refractive Index Elements1Ultra-High Refractive Index Elements1", "Physical": "Dimensions (ø x L)2.9 × 3.2″Weight0.8 lb."}', 'Includes

	Panasonic 18mm f/1.8
	Front & rear caps
	Panasonic S-S18 hood
	67mm protective filter
	Lens pouch', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1271, 2, 44, 'Panasonic Lumix S 20-60mm f/3.5-5.6 for L-Mount', 'panasonic-lumix-s-20-60mm-f-3-5-5-6-for-l-mount', 'The Panasonic Lumix S 20-60mm f/3.5-5.6 is a versatile ultra-wide to short-portrait zoom designed for the L-mount system. Key features include:

High-quality optics for sharp, clear images
20-60mm focal length; 30-90mm equivalent on APS-C
Fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus system
Splash-. dust-, and freezeproof metal build

Ultra-Wide to Short-Portrait Zoom. The Panasonic Lumix S 20-60mm f/3.5-5.6’s focal length and 6.0-inch minimum focusing distance make it a particularly great option for close-up photography and for shooting indoors when space is at a premium. The rounded nine-blade diaphragm helps to produce pleasing bokeh. Its f/3.5-5.6 aperture isn’t anything to write home about, but it’ll get the job done in good lighting. If you’re shooting indoors or in low light, you’ll want a flash and/or tripod. Using an APS-C camera? You’ll get a 30-90mm equivalent focal-length range.

L-Mount Alliance. This wide-diameter lens mount is a joint collaboration between Leica, Panasonic, and Sigma that’s focused on a line of premium cameras & lenses in a mirrorless format. At 51.6mm mount diameter and just 20mm flange distance, the L-mount is well-suited for fast-aperture full-frame optics with compact dimensions.

Stepping Autofocus System. This autofocus system uses a stepping motor to provide fast, accurate, nearly silent autofocus performance for still and video use. You can use the AF/MF switch to easily toggle between autofocus and manual focus modes.

Premium Optics. This lens’s nine-group/eleven-element optical formula features three extra-low dispersion elements and two aspherical elements to reduce spherical aberration and distortion, producing sharp, clear, color-accurate images.

High-Quality Build. Its metal barrel construction provides a solid, yet lightweight feel, while its splash-. dust-, and freeze-proof design lets you work in inclement weather conditions down to -14° with confidence.', 1100000.0, '{"Angle of View": "94° to 40°", "Aperture Blades": "9, Rounded", "Brand": "Panasonic", "Diameter": "3.1\\"", "Extra Low-Dispersion Elements": "3", "Groups/Elements": "9/11", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "L", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle, Standard, and Telephoto", "Maximum Magnification": "0.43x", "Mfr. Part Number": "S-R2060", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "0.5’"}', 'Includes

	Panasonic Lumix S 20-60mm f/3.5-5.6
	Front & rear caps
	S-R2060 hood
	67mm protective filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1272, 2, 44, 'Panasonic Lumix S 24-60mm f/2.8', 'panasonic-lumix-s-24-60mm-f-2-8', 'The Panasonic Lumix S 24-60mm f/2.8 is a hybrid-ready zoom lens designed for full-frame L-Mount cameras. Key features include:

Constant f/2.8 aperture across the entire zoom range
Hybrid Zoom compatible with select Lumix S cameras
Linear and non-linear manual focus modes
Customizable control ring and Focus button

Versatile Midrange Zoom. This lens’s wide-to-short-telephoto zoom range is ideal for everyday shooting. It maintains a smaller form factor compared to other L-Mount zooms without sacrificing the fast f/2.8 constant aperture.

Hybrid Zoom with Select Cameras. When paired with select Lumix S cameras, including the S1 II, S1 IIE, S1R II, S5 II, S5 IIX, and S9, the Hybrid Zoom function on this lens will extend the 60mm maximum focal length to up to 187mm digitally. Activate this with the on-barrel Focus button.

Dual-Function Control Ring. The focus ring on this lens doubles as a control ring that is programmable for key settings, such as aperture and exposure compensation.

Reliable All-Rounder. With a minimum focusing distance of just 7.5" and a max magnification of 0.3x, this lens can be used for closeup subjects as well as portraits and events. It offers linear and non-linear manual focus modes and manual focus can be used while zooming – a great feature for video. This mid-length tele is a great choice for weddings, senior portraits, sports, pets, and more.', 1750000.0, '{"Angle of View": "84-40º", "Brand": "Panasonic", "Focus Type": "Autofocus and Manual Focus", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "L", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle and Standard", "Stabilization": "No"}', 'Includes

	Panasonic Lumix S 24-60mm f/2.8 lens
	Front & rear caps
	Panasonic S-E2460/S-R24105 hood
	77mm Hoya EVO antistatic filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1273, 2, 44, 'Panasonic Lumix S 24mm f/1.8', 'panasonic-lumix-s-24mm-f-1-8', 'The Panasonic Lumix S 24mm f/1.8 is a bright, compact wide-angle prime designed for full-frame L-mount mirrorless cameras. Key features include:

Compact, fast-aperture wide-angle prime
High-quality optical design for sharp, clear images
Fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus system
Splash-, dust-, and freeze-resistant metal build

Compact Wide-Angle Prime. The Panasonic Lumix S 24mm f/1.8’s wide-angle focal length makes it a particularly great option for landscapes, portraiture, nature photography, and architectural photography. Its bright f/1.8 aperture and rounded nine-blade diaphragm produce pleasing bokeh and smooth defocus gradation. Using an APS-C camera? You’ll get a 36mm focal length.

L-Mount Alliance. This wide-diameter lens mount is a joint collaboration between Leica, Panasonic, and Sigma that’s focused on a line of premium cameras and lenses in a mirrorless format. At 51.6mm mount diameter and just 20mm flange distance, the L-mount is well-suited for fast-aperture full-frame optics with compact dimensions.

Linear Autofocus System. The 24mm f/1.8’s autofocus system uses a linear motor to provide fast, accurate, nearly silent performance for still and video use while suppressing focus breathing. You can use the AF/MF switch to easily toggle between autofocus and manual focus modes.

Premium Optics. This lens’s eleven-group/twelve-element optical formula features three aspherical elements, three extra-low dispersion elements, and an ultra extra-low refractive index element to reduce chromatic aberrations and color fringing, producing sharp, clear, color-accurate images.

High-Quality Build. The lens barrel’s metal construction provides a solid, yet lightweight feel, while its splash-, dust-, and freeze-resistant design lets you work in inclement weather conditions down to -14° with confidence.', 1350000.0, '{"Angle of View": "84°", "Aperture Blades": "9, Rounded", "Brand": "Panasonic", "Diameter": "2.9\\"", "Extra Low-Dispersion Elements": "3", "Groups/Elements": "11/12", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "L", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle", "Maximum Magnification": "0.15x", "Mfr. Model Number": "S-S24", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "0.8’", "Ultra Extra-Low Dispersion Elements": "1"}', 'Includes

	Panasonic 24mm f/1.8
	Front & rear caps
