Input and Outputs.  Dual 12G-SDI ports enable you to output mirror feeds to two displays, or individual feeds with or without focus peaking, timecode, or other displays, or with two different looks. A USB Type-C port outputs up to 1080p video streaming.

DSMC3 Ecosystem.  The DSMC3 form features several improvements over the previous DSMC2 brains and no compatibility with DSMC2 accessories. DSMC3 cameras have a larger fan system with two intake valves that provide better thermal heat exchange (TEC) enabling a wide ambient temperature operating range.', 31475000.0, '{"Brand": "RED", "Camera Mount": "Canon RF", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Compatible Media": "CFexpress Type B", "Format Support": "Supports Apple ProRes / ProRes proxy", "Imaging": "Sensor Type35.4 MP Full Frame CMOSSensor Size40.96 × 21.6 mmEffective Pixels8192 × 4320Dynamic Range17 Stops", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Frame Rates": "REDCODE HQ8192 × 4320p up to 60 fps6144 × 3240p up to 96 fps4096 × 2160p up to 240 fps2048 × 1080p up to 480 fpsREDCODE MQ8192 × 4320p up to 60 fps6144 × 3240p up to 160 fps4096 × 2160p up to 240 fps2048 × 1080p up to 480 fpsREDCODE LQ8192 × 4320p up to 60 fps6144 × 3240p up to 160 fps4096 × 2160p up to 240 fps2048 × 1080p up to 480 fps", "Maximum Video Resolution": "8K", "Physical": "Dimensions6.1 × 4.3 × 4.3″Weight4 lb (body only)Operating Temperature32°F to 104°F", "Power Supply": "DC Input+11 to +17 V DC via the integrated 4-pin LEMO portBatteryMicro V-Mount", "Sensor Size": "Full-Frame", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi"}', 'Includes

