Cine DSX Quality and Consistency. Each lens in the Cine DSX series shares common focus and iris gear ring positions, enabling quick and easy lens change when using a follow focus. A multi-layer coating process offers color matching across the Cine DSX line for consistent results regardless of focal length.', 1375000.0, '{"Angle of View": "84.1°", "Aperture Blades": "9", "Brand": "Rokinon", "Dimensions": "3.3 × 4.85″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "77.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "24-24", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Front Lens Diameter": "84mm", "Gearing": "0.8 MOD focus, iris", "Groups/Elements": "12/13", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle, Cine, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "1.5", "Mfr. Model Number": "DSX24-NEX", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "9.8\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "1.43 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

