Cine DSX Quality and Consistency. Each lens in the Cine DSX series shares common focus and iris gear ring positions, enabling quick and easy lens change when using a follow focus. A multi-layer coating process offers color matching across the Cine DSX line for consistent results regardless of focal length.', 1200000.0, '{"Angle of View": "63.1°", "Aperture Blades": "9", "Brand": "Rokinon", "Dimensions": "3.3 × 4.4″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "77.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On and Matte Box Mount", "Focal Length": "35-35", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Front Lens Diameter": "84mm", "Gearing": "0.8 MOD focus, iris", "Groups/Elements": "10/12", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Canon EF", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle, Cine, and For DSLR", "Maximum Aperture": "1.5", "Mfr. Model Number": "DSX35-C", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "11.8\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "1.62 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

