Great sharpness and smooth bokeh
Hybrid aspherical elements
Manual-focus lens with internal-focusing design
Excellent value

Great Sharpness and Smooth Bokeh. The Rokinon 85mm f/1.4 ASPH is very sharp and produces smooth bokeh in out-of-focus regions which, combined with its narrow depth of field, gives a remarkable 3-D effect.

Advanced Optical Design. Hybrid aspherical elements minimize distortion and chromatic aberrations while ensuring sharpness across the frame.

Manual Focus Only. This is a manual-focus lens. It provides no electronic communication with the camera. You must manually make all focus adjustments on the lens itself.', 375000.0, '{"Angle of View": "18.3 degrees (crop sensor)", "Brand": "Rokinon", "Dimensions": "Length: 3.25\\"", "Groups/Elements": "7/9", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Telephoto", "Maximum Magnification": "0.08x", "Mfr. Model Number": "85M-N", "Weather Resistant": "No"}', 'Includes

