Wide-Angle Prime. The Rokinon 35mm f/2.8 AF FE for Sony E is a more compact and cost-effective alternative to Sony’s own 35mm f/2.8 FE lens. It provides a versatile 63.1° angle of view that makes it a great general-use lens. Its fast f/2.8 maximum aperture is useful in a range of lighting conditions, including low light, and its seven aperture blades contribute to smooth bokeh. This lens is also compatible with APS-C cameras, on which it’ll give you a 52.5mm equivalent focal length.

Advanced Optics. The 35mm f/2.8’s optical formula incorporates two aspherical elements and one high-refractive element to help eliminate distortion and aberrations, all while retaining sharpness and clarity at any aperture or focal distance. The Ultra Multi-Coating controls ghosting and flare for a contrasty, color-neutral image, even when you’re shooting in strong lighting.

Autofocus. The built-in autofocus motor works with Sony cameras’ focusing systems to provide fast, accurate AF control, while the manual-focus override lets you make precise adjustments.

Compact, High-Quality Build. This lens comes in a sturdy and lightweight aluminum-alloy housing. Its compact build means it’s a great option for travel and walk-around photography.', 825000.0, '{"Angle of View": "63.1°", "Aperture Blades": "7", "Brand": "Rokinon", "Dimensions": "2.43 × 1.3″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "49.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "35-35", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "6/7", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "For Mirrorless and Wide Angle", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "0.12x", "Mfr. Model Number": "IO35AF-E", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "1.15", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "0.19 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

