Durable, lightweight build

Super Wide-Angle Prime. The Rokinon SP 14mm f/2.4 provides a 114° angle of view on FX-format Nikon F-mount cameras and an 89° angle of view on DX-format cameras, where it’ll also give you a 22.4mm equivalent focal length.

Advanced Optics. The eighteen-element/fourteen-group optical formula incorporates two aspherical elements, two extra-low dispersion elements, and three high-refractive index elements to help prevent color fringing, distortions, and aberrations, all while retaining sharpness, clarity, and color accuracy at any aperture or focus distance. The Ultra Multi-Coating and built-in hood control ghosting and flare, even when working in bright, direct light.

Manual Focus. The manual-focus design allows for precision adjustments, and lets you work with subjects as close as eleven inches away.

