	67mm protective filter
	Lens case', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1485, 2, 51, 'Sigma 105mm f/1.4 DG HSM Art for L-Mount', 'sigma-105mm-f-1-4-dg-hsm-art-for-l-mount', 'The Sigma 105mm f/1.4 DG HSM Art for L-Mount is a high-quality short-telephoto prime designed for L-mount cameras. Key features include:

Superb low-light performance and depth-of-field control
Great image quality, clarity, contrast, and sharpness
Fast, smooth, and quiet autofocus
Optimized for Panasonic and Leica L-mount cameras

Fast-Aperture Short Tele. The Sigma 105mm f/1.4 DG HSM Art’s fast aperture gives you great performance in low light and extensive control over depth of field. The rounded nine-blade aperture gives you super-smooth bokeh, making this lens a great choice for portrait work. Using a APS-C sensor camera? You’ll have a focal length equivalent to 157.5mm.

High-Quality Images. As a part of Sigma’s Art lens line, this lens goes through Sigma’s rigorous A1 testing to ensure high image quality. The 105mm f/1.4’s optics are quite impressive. Three “F” Low-Dispersion elements, two SLD glass elements, and one aspherical element correct for chromatic aberrations while ensuring high image sharpness, clarity, and contrast. A Super Multi-Layer Coating minimizes lens flare and ghosting to help produce high-contrast, color-accurate images.

Hyper Sonic Motor Autofocus System. The HSM autofocus system provides fast, smooth, and quiet operation in a wide variety of shooting situations. You can also manually override the autofocus motor at any time by rotating the focusing ring, giving you quick fine-tuning ability.

Durable Build. Sigma’s Art 105mm is weather sealed, making it dust and splash resistant. It’s made of a Thermally Stable Composite (TSC) material, giving it greater precision and allowing for use in a wide array of temperatures.', 1975000.0, '{"\\"F\\" Low-Dispersion Elements": "3", "Accessory Type": "3.6 lb.", "Angle of View": "23.3°", "Aperture Blades": "9, Rounded", "Brand": "Sigma", "Groups/Elements": "12/17", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "L", "Lens Type": "Telephoto", "Maximum Magnification": "0.12x", "Mfr. Model Number": "259969", "Super Low-Dispersion Elements": "2"}', 'Includes

	Sigma 105mm f/1.4 DG HSM Art for L-Mount
	LH1113-­01 hood
	Front & rear caps
	TS-111 tripod ring
	105mm protective filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1486, 2, 51, 'Sigma 105mm f/1.4 DG HSM Art for Nikon F', 'sigma-105mm-f-1-4-dg-hsm-art-for-nikon-f', 'The Sigma 105mm f/1.4 DG HSM Art for Nikon is a high-quality short-telephoto prime designed for Nikon F-mount cameras and camcorders. Key features include:

Superb low-light performance and depth-of-field control
Great image quality, clarity, contrast, and sharpness
Fast, smooth, and quiet autofocus
USB-dock compatible

Fast-Aperture Short Tele. The Sigma 105mm f/1.4 DG HSM Art for Nikon’s fast aperture gives you great performance in low light and extensive control over depth of field. The rounded nine-blade aperture gives you super-smooth bokeh, making this lens a great choice for portrait work. Using a DX-sensor camera? You’ll have a focal length equivalent to 157.5mm.

High Image Quality. As a part of Sigma’s Art lens line, this lens goes through Sigma’s rigorous A1 testing to ensure high image quality. The 105mm f/1.4’s optics are quite impressive. Three “F” Low-Dispersion elements, two SLD glass elements, and one aspherical element correct for chromatic aberrations while ensuring high image sharpness, clarity, and contrast. A Super Multi-Layer Coating minimizes lens flare and ghosting to help produce high-contrast, color-accurate images.

Hyper Sonic Motor Autofocus System. The HSM autofocus system provides fast, smooth, and quiet operation in a wide variety of shooting situations. You can also manually override the autofocus motor at any time by rotating the focusing ring, giving you quick fine-tuning ability.

Sigma Dock Compatible. As part of Sigma’s Global Vision series, this lens is compatible with the Sigma USB Dock for Nikon F Lenses (separate rental item), allowing you to adjust certain parameters through the Sigma Optimization Pro software.

Durable Build. Sigma’s Art 105mm is weather sealed, making it dust and splash resistant. It’s made of a Thermally Stable Composite (TSC) material, giving it greater precision and allowing for use in a wide array of temperatures.', 2125000.0, '{"Angle of View": "23.3°", "Brand": "Sigma", "Dimensions": "Length: 5.2\\"", "Groups/Elements": "12/17", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Telephoto", "Magnification": "0.12x", "Maximum Reproduction Ratio": "1:8.3", "Mfr. Model Number": "259955", "Tripod Collar": "Yes – removable, rotating"}', 'Includes

