Try it with These Fuji Cameras. The Sigma 16-300mm f/3.5-6.7 DC OS Contemporary is compatible with Fuji’s entire crop sensor X-mount line. Its portable design is especially well suited for the rangefinder-inspired Fuji X-Pro3 or the travel-ready Fuji X-M5. Event photographers might want to pair this lens with the Fuji X-T4, which offers dual SD card slots and a longer battery life.', 1400000.0, '{"Angle of View": "83.2-5.4°", "Brand": "Sigma", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Fuji X", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle, Standard, Telephoto, and Supertelephoto"}', 'Includes

