Fast, Quiet Autofocus System. The 17mm’s integrated stepping autofocus motor provides fast, quiet operation in a broad range of shooting situations, and its optimized AF algorithm helps facilitate smooth performance. You get a 4.7-inch minimum focusing distance with a 1:3.6 maximum magnification ratio, letting you take macro-style close-up shots.', 875000.0, '{"Angle of View": "103.7°", "Aperture Blades": "7, rounded", "Brand": "Sigma", "Dimensions": "2.5 × 2″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "55.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "17-17", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "8/9", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Ultra Wide Angle and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "4.0", "Maximum Magnification": "0.28x", "Mfr. Model Number": "415965", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "4.7\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "0.48 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

