Advanced Optics. This lens’s fifteen-group/nineteen-element optical design includes three aspherical elements, two Special Low-Dispersion elements, and six F Low-Dispersion elements to minimize chromatic aberrations, distortion, and vignetting while providing maximum sharpness, color accuracy, and clarity.

High-Quality Build. The Sigma 24-70mm is dust- and splash-resistant, so that you can use it in adverse conditions. It also boasts a brass bayonet mount for maximum durability.', 2000000.0, '{"Angle of View": "84.1-34.3°", "Aperture Blades": "11, rounded", "Brand": "Sigma", "Filter Size": "82.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "24-70", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "15/19", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle, Standard, Telephoto, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "0.34x", "Mfr. Model Number": "578965", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "6.7\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "1.6 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

