Improved Autofocus System. A linear-motor high-response actuator provides highly accurate, nearly silent autofocus operation at more than three times the speed of this lens’s predecessor, while an optimized autofocus algorithm gives you smooth performance. You can use the dedicated AF/MF switch to toggle between autofocus and manual-focus modes on the fly, and you can program the integrated Autofocus-Lock buttons to adjust additional functions, giving you even more options and capabilities. A dedicated zoom-lock switch keeps the barrel from extending when you don’t want it to.

