Sigma I Series. The Sigma 24mm f/2 DG C belong’s to Sigma’s 1 Series group of lenses, which is a collection that prioritizes compactness without sacrificing performance. These lenses offer all-metal construction with precision-cut aluminum, an elegant finish, and pleasingly tactile knurled focus and aperture rings.

