Wide Field of View. This lens captures a sense of space without the distortion and has a close focusing distance of under 10" for beautiful closeups that still include the surrounding environment. With an f/2 maximum aperture, this lens is suitable for low-light subjects and is a great option for landscapes, cityscapes, and nightscapes.

Try it with These E-Mount Cameras. The portable nature of this lens makes it a great option for shooters on the go and pairs well with slightly more compact cameras like the Sony ZV-E1 or the Sony Alpha a7C II. However, it’ll work with any E-mount system, including APS-C sensor cameras like the Sony a6600, where it will provide an equivalent focal length of 36mm.', 1275000.0, '{"Angle of View": "84.1°", "Aperture Blades": "9, rounded", "Brand": "Sigma", "Dimensions": "2.8 × 2.9″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "62.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "24-24", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "11/13", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.0", "Maximum Magnification": "0.15x", "Mfr. Model Number": "4B3965", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "9.6\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "0.79 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

