Advanced Optics. This lens’s eleven-group/thirteen-element optical design includes two Special Low-Dispersion elements, two aspherical elements, and one “F” Low-Dispersion element, which work together to minimize spherical aberrations and fringing while improving clarity, sharpness, and color accuracy. A Super Multi-Layer Coating has been applied to each element to boost contrast, and to combat ghosting and flare.

High-Quality Build. The Sigma 24mm’s Thermally Stable Composite build is dust- and splash-resistant, so that you can use it in adverse conditions. It also boasts a brass bayonet mount for maximum durability.', 825000.0, '{"Angle of View": "84.1°", "Aperture Blades": "9, rounded", "Brand": "Sigma", "Dimensions": "2.8 × 2.8″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "62.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "24-24", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "11/13", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.0", "Maximum Magnification": "0.15x", "Mfr. Model Number": "403965", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "9.6\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "0.8 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

