High-Quality Design. The Sigma Cine 14mm T3.2 FF Classic Art Prime (PL) offers full-frame coverage, giving you a compact and lightweight cine lens. It’s capable of delivering 6K to 8K resolution, and its T3.2 aperture allows depth-of-field control and low-light shooting flexibility.

