High-Quality Design. The Sigma Cine 35mm T2.5 FF Classic Art Prime (PL) offers full-frame coverage, giving you a compact and lightweight cine lens. It’s capable of delivering 6K to 8K resolution, and its T2.5 aperture allows depth-of-field control and low-light shooting flexibility.

Cinematic Expression. Without sacrificing quality, the Sigma Classic Prime line delivers a low-contrast image with artistic flare and ghosting, along with excellent bokeh effects, to produce stunning footage. When you need to pull focus or aperture, this lens comes with the same geared rings as other Sigma Cine lenses so you can make adjustments by hand or with a focus motor.

Compact, Sleek Build. As with other Sigma Cine lenses, this lens is made with high-quality materials for durability and ease of use. It also utilizes the Cooke “/i Technology” communication protocol for recording various lens metadata for post-processing, comes with a lens support foot, and features newly developed coating for the glass elements.', 5300000.0, '{"Angle of View": "54.4°", "Aperture Blades": "9, rounded", "Brand": "Sigma", "Dimensions": "3.7 × 3.5″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "76.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On and Matte Box Mount", "Focal Length": "35-35", "Focus Rotation": "180º", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Front Lens Diameter": "95mm", "Gearing": "0.8 MOD focus, iris", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "PL", "Lens Type": "Standard, Cine, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.5", "Maximum Magnification": "0.19x", "Mfr. Model Number": "34A974", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "12\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "2.8 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

