INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1738, 2, 51, 'Sigma Cine 50-100mm T2 (E)', 'sigma-cine-50-100mm-t2-e', 'The Sigma Cine 50-100mm T2 is a rehoused cinema lens designed for APS-C / Super35 cameras with the Sony E-mount. Key features include:

Full metal housing
Short telephoto zoom
High-quality optics
Sony E-mount for APS-C/Super35

Sony E-Mount. We carry this lens in multiple lens mounts. This is the version designed specifically for APS-C/Super35 cameras with the Sony E-mount.

Cine Style. The Sigma Cine 50-100mm T2 (Sony E) is a full re-housing of the Sigma 50-100mm f/1.8 DC HSM Art photo lens. That means all of the great functions of that lens carry over, while adding full manual, geared control over focus, zoom, and iris, as well as a standard barrel size and robust metal construction.

That Build Quality Though. A factor so strong, we thought it deserved a second bullet point. Each ring on this lens is sealed, making it both splash-proof and dust-proof. Its markings are laser engraved and a luminous paint job helps you work in the dark

Fast T2 Zoom. The Sigma 50-100mm bests the majority of cinema style zooms by a full stop. This enables stellar low-light shooting while providing full-frame style depth of field on a super35mm sized sensor.

High Quality Optics. The optics of the stills version carry over, meaning you have an optical formula that includes a complex optical design that boasts 21 elements in 15 groups. Included are three “F” Low-Dispersion elements,  as well as one Special Low-Dispersion element, and one high-refractive, high-dispersion element. This combination delivers strong contrast and clarity while minimizing aberrations and color fringing.

