	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	55mm protective filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1855, 2, 54, 'Sony E 18-200mm f/3.5-6.3 PZ OSS', 'sony-e-18-200mm-f-3-5-6-3-pz-oss', 'The Sony E 18-200mm f/3.5-6.3 PZ OSS is a servo zoom lens for Sony E-mount camcorders. Key features include:

Silent autofocus
4-stop Optical SteadyShot image stabilization
11x zoom ratio
7-blade circular aperture

Advanced Features. This lens features silent autofocus, optical image stabilization, and an 11x zoom ratio.

Flexibility, Ergonomics, and Operability. When used in conjunction with the APS-C sized sensor of Sony NEX camcorders, this lens provides you with a 35mm equivalent angle-of-view of 27-300mm. The 18-200mm Power Zoom lens offers the flexibility of a removable lens with the ergonomics and operability of a Handycam camcorder.', 1725000.0, '{"Angle of View": "76-8º", "Aperture Blades": "7, rounded", "Brand": "Sony", "Dimensions": "3.67 × 3.9-6.78\\" (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "67.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "18-200", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "12/17", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "APS-C", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle, Standard, and Telephoto", "Maximum Aperture": "3.5", "Maximum Magnification": "0.35x", "Mfr. Model Number": "SELP18200", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "11.81\\"", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "1.43 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

