	49mm protective filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1861, 2, 54, 'Sony E 55-210mm f/4.5-6.3 OSS', 'sony-e-55-210mm-f-4-5-6-3-oss', 'The Sony E 55-210mm f/4.5-6.3 OSS is a short-to-long telephoto range lens that gives Sony E-mount users an 82-315mm full-frame equivalent zoom. Key features include:

Good image quality throughout the zoom range
Fast, quiet autofocus
Optical SteadyShot image stabilization
Excellent value

The lens’s wide range is great for bringing your subject closer to you, no matter how far away it is. Its internal focusing system gives you smooth, responsive autofocus with minimum noise—perfect for capturing video. This lens features Sony’s Optical SteadyShot autofocus system, giving users the ability to capture images and video with minimal camera shake. Two Extra-low Dispersion (ED) glass elements help to suppress chromatic aberration and color bleeding at all focal lengths, giving good image quality throughout the zoom range.', 775000.0, '{"Angle of View": "29-7º40’", "Aperture Blades": "7, rounded", "Brand": "Sony", "Dimensions": "2.51 × 4.25″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "49.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "55-210", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "9/13", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "APS-C", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Telephoto and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "4.5", "Maximum Magnification": "0.23x", "Mfr. Model Number": "SEL55210/B", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "3.28’", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "0.76 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

