INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1863, 1, 54, 'Sony FDR-AX53 4K Ultra HD Camcorder', 'sony-fdr-ax53-4k-ultra-hd-camcorder', 'The Sony FDR-AX53 4K Ultra HD Camcorder is an ultra-compact, consumer-level 4K camcorder with a solid feature set and a built-in Zeiss 20x optical zoom lens. Key features include:

4K Ultra HD 24/30p video capture and 16.6MP stills
Large Exmor R CMOS sensor
26.8mm Zeiss Vario Sonnar T* zoom lens
20x Optical zoom and 40x Clear Image zoom

4K Ultra HD Video. The Sony FDR-AX53 records up to 3840 × 2160 4K video at 24 and 30 fps in XAVC S. If you’re shooting 1920 × 1080 HD video, you have your choice of XAVC S at 24/30/60 fps or AVCHD at 28/60 fps.

Exmor R CMOS Sensor. The large sensor gives great low-light performance for a compact camcorder. In addition to video, you can also snap 16.6MP still images.

Zeiss Vario Sonnar Lens. The integrated 20x optical zoom lens gives you a focal length equivalent to 26.8 to 536mm at 16:9 and 32.8 to 656mm at 4:3. Its elements have a multi-layer Zeiss T* coating to help maintain high image quality by reducing flare and ghosting. It features Sony’s optical SteadyShot image stabilization with five steps of vibration compensation, which provides electronic roll stability for smooth video capture. This lens uses contrast-based autofocus and has tracking focus capabilities.

0.24-inch OLED EVF/3.0-inch XtraFine LCD. The high contrast 0.24-inch OLED Tru-Finder EVF has a 1,555K-dot resolution and uses four dual-surface aspherical lenses for highly accurate color reproduction. The large, 3.0-inch Xtra Fine touchscreen LCD offers a 921K-dot resolution with 16:9 aspect ratio for a sharp and bright image even in bright daylight conditions.

Built-in Wi-Fi and NFC. This camera’s built-in Wi-Fi and NFC support allows simple connectivity to a smartphone for image transfer, one-touch sharing, and camera control. You can also connect up to five compatible Sony cameras via Wi-Fi and use the FDR-AX53’s LCD to preview the synced cameras’ angles and to start recording.', 4100000.0, '{"Battery": "Rechargeable Lithium-Ion Battery Pack, 6.8 VDC, 1960 mAh", "Brand": "Sony", "Camera Type": "Camcorder", "Charging Method": "AC Adapter", "Compatible Media": "SD", "Depth": "6.6\\"", "Filter Size": "55mm", "Height": "3.2\\"", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "4K", "Mfr. Model Number": "FDRAX53/B", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Swivel", "Sensor": "1-Chip 1/2.5\\" CMOS", "Sensor Size": "1-Inch", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Video Formats": "3840 × 2160p at 24/30 fps (100 Mb/s XAVC S)\\n1920 × 1080p at 24/30/60 fps (60 Mb/s XAVC S)\\n1920 × 1080p at 60 fps (28 Mb/s AVCHD)\\n1920 × 1080p at 24 fps (24 Mb/s AVCHD)\\n1920 × 1080p at 24 fps (17 Mb/s AVCHD)\\n1920 × 1080i at 60 fps (24 Mb/s AVCHD)\\n1920 × 1080i at 60 fps (17 Mb/s AVCHD)\\n1440 × 1080i at 60 fps (9 Mb/s AVCHD)\\n1440 × 1080i at 60 fps (5 Mb/s AVCHD)\\n1280 × 720p at 30 fps (3 Mb/s MP4)", "Viewfinder Type": "Electronic", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Wi-Fi": "Yes", "Width": "2.9\\"", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi"}', 'Includes

	Sony FDR-AX53
	NP-FV70 battery
	Sony BC-TRV battery charger
	AC-L200 AC adapter
	USB cable
	Polarized cable', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1864, 2, 54, 'Sony FE 100-400mm f/4.5 GM OSS', 'sony-fe-100-400mm-f-4-5-gm-oss', 'The Sony FE 100-400mm f/4.5 GM OSS is a full-frame super-telephoto zoom bringing improvements to the 100-400mm f/4.5-5.6 GM OSS, like a constant f/4.5 aperture, faster performance, and more. Key features include:

Internal zoom and focus design
Super ED, ED XA, and XA glass elements
Weather sealed
OSS with Panning & Moving Subject modes

New Product – Coming Soon.

Place your reservation now! We fill orders on a first-come, first-served basis. Please note that included items and rental cost could change as we finalize this listing.

If the listed rental price increases between your preorder and ship dates, don’t worry—you’ll be locked in at your original pre-order price. And if the price decreases, you’ll still pay the lower price. We’ll always contact you to confirm pricing before we ship your order.

What’s Changed? Building off of the design of its predecessor, this FE 100-400mm f/4.5 GM OSS from Sony offers improved performance at the  long end of the range through an updated constant f/4.5 aperture. The updated ED XA, XA, Super ED, and ED lens elements are equipped with Nano AR Coating II to deliver sharp, rich, and vivid capture while suppressing flares. Offering an increase to the amount of rounded diaphragm blades from 9 to 11 creates creamy, smooth bokeh quality when you’re using selective-focus techniques. With a new focus floating design, this lens offers high image quality throughout the entire focal range and a massively decreased minimum focusing distance of just 2.1-feet.

Full-Frame E-mount. As a part of the FE line of lenses, the FE 100-400mm f/4.5 GM OSS is designed for Sony full-frame cameras. It’s also fully compatible with APS-C cameras, on which it’ll provide a 150-600mm equivalent focal length.

Telephoto Zoom with IS. This is a far-reaching telephoto zoom that’s great for sports, wildlife, and action photographers and videographers who are looking for some extra reach. An Optical SteadyShot image-stabilization system minimizes the appearance of camera shake at all focal lengths, giving you sharp images even when you’re shooting hand-held at lower shutter speeds. The SteadyShot system will work with select cameras’ built-in sensor-shift image stabilization for even more effective blur control.

High-Speed AF. Operating on four extreme dynamic (ED) linear motors, this lens boasts fast, smooth autofocus performance that outshines its predecessor’s speeds by 3×. With support for continuous shooting speeds up to 120 fps or high-speed video recording at up to 240 fps, this telephoto zoom also offers 50% more accurate tracking performance and improved subject tracking.', 6150000.0, '{"Angle of View": "24°-6° @ 10’", "Aperture Blades": "11, Rounded", "Brand": "Sony", "Dimensions": "4.7 × 12.9″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "Screw-On: 95mmDrop-In: 40.5mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On, Drop-In, and Rear Mount", "Focal Length": "100-400", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "20/25", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Telephoto and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "4.5", "Maximum Magnification": "0.25x", "Mfr. Model Number": "SEL100400MC", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "2.1’", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "4lb", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Sony FE 100-400mm f/4.5 GM OSS', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1865, 2, 54, 'Sony FE 100-400mm f/4.5-5.6 GM OSS', 'sony-fe-100-400mm-f-4-5-5-6-gm-oss', 'The Sony FE 100-400mm f/4.5-5.6 GM OSS is a compact telephoto zoom for Sony’s full-frame mirrorless cameras. For an update with a constant f/4.5 aperture, see the 100-400mm f/4.5 GM OSS. Key features include:

Professional-grade telephoto zoom lens
Built-in image stabilization
Fast, nearly silent autofocus
Advanced optical design for high-quality images

Full-Frame E-mount. As a part of the FE line of lenses, the FE 100-400mm f/4.5-5.6 GM OSS is designed for Sony full-frame cameras. It’s also fully compatible with APS-C cameras, on which it’ll provide a 150-600mm equivalent focal length.

Pro-Grade Compact Telephoto Zoom. The FE 100-400mm f/4.5-5.6 GM OSS is a far-reaching telephoto zoom that’s great for sports, wildlife, and action photographers and videographers who are looking for some extra reach. The rounded nine-blade diaphragm helps create smooth bokeh when you’re using selective-focus techniques.

Image Stabilization. An Optical SteadyShot image-stabilization system minimizes the appearance of camera shake at all focal lengths, giving you sharp images even when you’re shooting hand-held at lower shutter speeds. The SteadyShot system will work with select cameras’ built-in sensor-shift image stabilization for even more effective blur control.

Direct Drive SSM Autofocus System. This internal focusing system provides fast, nearly silent, and highly accurate autofocus performance that’s great for still and video use. A dedicated focus hold button and AF/MF switch help to tailor focusing to your shooting needs. There’s also a manual aperture ring that can be “de-clicked” for smooth aperture adjustment when shooting video.

Advanced Optics. The FE 100-400mm f/4.5-5.6 GM OSS’s 16-group/22-element design includes one super extra-low dispersion element and two extra-low dispersion elements to minimize chromatic aberrations, and to produce clear, high-contrast images. A Nano AR coating keeps flare and ghosting at bay while maintaining color fidelity.', 3050000.0, '{"Angle of View": "24-6°10’", "Aperture Blades": "9, rounded", "Brand": "Sony", "Dimensions": "3.7 × 8\\" (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "77.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "100-400", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "16/22", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Telephoto, Supertelephoto, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "4.5", "Maximum Magnification": "0.35x", "Mfr. Model Number": "SEL100400GM", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "3.2’", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "3.0 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Sony FE 100-400mm f/4.5-5.6 GM OSS
	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	Tripod foot
	77mm Hoya EVO antistatic filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1866, 2, 54, 'Sony FE 100mm f/2.8 Macro GM', 'sony-fe-100mm-f-2-8-macro-gm', 'The Sony FE 100mm f/2.8 Macro GM is a powerful medium-telephoto lens offering a 1.4x maximum magnification for immersive and detailed macro photography. Key features include:

Full-Frame sensor coverage
f/2.8 to f/22 aperture range
Four XD liner autofocus motors; Internal focusing
Optical SteadyShot image stabilization

Macro Marvel. Convenient close-up capture resides in the reliable and versatile Sony FE 100mm f/2.8 Macro GM! Boasting an impressive 10.2-inch minimum focusing distance from the sensor, this lens delivers 1.4x maximum magnification with a 1.4:1 macro magnification ratio for clarified, immersive macro close-ups. The focusing ring on the lens can slide forward or backward to switch between manual focus or autofocus, while the focus range limiter switch allows range limitations to be set for improved autofocus speed and responsiveness. The fast f/2.8 aperture enables extremely shallow depth-of-field control at macro focus distances.

G Master Lens. A continuation of the G Master (GM) line, this lens stakes claim as Sony’s first Macro GM option. Constructed with a 17 element / 13 group optical configuration, this lens effectively minimizes aberration through two eXtreme Aspherical (XA) and two Extra-low Dispersion (ED) glass elements, while a Nano AR Coating II on the elements help reject flare, ghosting, and internal reflections. Additionally, its 11-blade circular aperture delivers a smooth, round bokeh around your imaging.

Motorized Focusing. To capture those clear, sharp close-ups, the 100mm Macro GM uses four near-silent XD linear motors to power the autofocus system up to 1.9x faster than the "Sony FE 90mm f/2.8 Macro G OSS ":/rent/sony-fe-90mm-f2.8-g-oss-macro, and offer full compatibility with the 120 fps burst shooting of the Sony a9 III. The internal-focusing system provides fast, highly accurate, and nearly silent autofocus performance that’s great for still and video use. This system is crucial to macro work because the front element doesn’t extend or rotate.

Optical Image Stabilization. The advanced Optical SteadyShot image stabilization allows you to shoot at slower shutter speeds without having to worry about camera shake.

High Build Quality. Like the Sony a9-series cameras, this lens offers dust- and moisture-resistant sealing for use in less-than-ideal conditions. The all-metal barrel and smooth, responsive manual-focus ring give the lens a solid feel.', 2375000.0, '{"Angle of View": "24°", "Aperture Blades": "11, rounded", "Brand": "Sony", "Dimensions": "3.2 × 5.8″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "67.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "96-100", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "13/17", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Macro, For Mirrorless, and Telephoto", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "1.4x", "Mfr. Model Number": "SEL100M28GM", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "10.2\\"", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "1.4 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Sony FE 100mm f/2.8 Macro GM
	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	67mm protective filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1867, 2, 54, 'Sony FE 100mm f/2.8 STF GM OSS', 'sony-fe-100mm-f-2-8-stf-gm-oss', 'The Sony FE 100mm f/2.8 STF GM OSS is a professional-grade short-telephoto E-mount prime lens for Sony full-frame cameras like the a7 series. Key features include:

Professional-grade portrait lens
Built-in image stabilization
Fast, nearly silent autofocus
Advanced optical design for high-quality images

Full-Frame E-mount. As a part of the FE line of lenses, the FE 100mm f/2.8 STF GM OSS is designed for Sony full-frame cameras like the a7 series. It’s also fully compatible with APS-C cameras, on which it’ll provide a 150mm equivalent focal length.

Pro-Grade Portrait Lens. The FE 100mm f/2.8 STF GM OSS’s fast f/2.8 aperture and short tele focal length make it perfect for portrait photography. The Smooth Trans Focus system’s apodization filter works in tandem with the eleven-blade diaphragm to create smooth bokeh with rounded out-of-focus highlights.

Image Stabilization. An Optical SteadyShot image-stabilization system minimizes the appearance of camera shake, giving you sharp images even when you’re shooting hand-held at lower shutter speeds. The SteadyShot system will work with select cameras’ built-in sensor-shift image stabilization for even more effective blur control.

Direct Drive SSM Autofocus System. This internal focusing system provides fast, nearly silent, and highly accurate autofocus performance that’s great for still and video use. A dedicated focus hold button and AF/MF switch help to tailor focusing to your shooting needs. There’s also a manual aperture ring that can be “de-clicked” for smooth aperture adjustment when shooting video.

Advanced Optics. The FE 100mm f/2.8 STF GM OSS’s eleven-group/fourteen-element design includes one aspherical element and one extra-low dispersion element to minimize spherical and chromatic aberrations, and to produce clear, high-contrast images. Nano AR coatings keep flare and ghosting at bay while maintaining color fidelity.', 1675000.0, '{"Angle of View": "24°", "Aperture Blades": "11, rounded", "Brand": "Sony", "Dimensions": "3.35 × 4.65″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "72.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "100-100", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "11/14", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Standard and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "0.25x", "Mfr. Model Number": "SEL100F28GM", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "1.87’", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "1.54 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Sony FE 100mm f/2.8 STF GM OSS
	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	72mm protection filter
	Case', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1868, 2, 54, 'Sony FE 12-24mm f/2.8 GM', 'sony-fe-12-24mm-f-2-8-gm', 'The Sony FE 12-24mm f/2.8 GM is an ultra-wide, full-frame zoom lens designed for Sony E-mount cameras. Key features include:

Versatile ultra-wide focal range
Great for photographing night scenes and starry skies
Advanced optical formula for extremely sharp images
Fast, nearly silent, and highly accurate autofocus

Full-Frame E-Mount. As a part of the G Master line of lenses, the 12-24mm f/2.8 is designed to cover Sony E-mount cameras’ full-frame sensors. It’s also fully compatible with APS-C NEX cameras.

Ultra-Wide Zoom. When used on a full-frame camera, this lens’s zoom range is wide. Like really wide. Its field of view ranges from 122° at its widest to 84° at the long end, which means it’s perfect for night scenes and starry skies. With an APS-C sensor camera, you’ll get a focal length equivalent to 18-36mm. The constant f/2.8 aperture and rounded nine-blade diaphragm make it a great choice for low-light shooting while giving you excellent depth-of-field control.

Advanced Optics. The FE 12-24mm f/2.8 GM’s fourteen-group/seventeen-element design includes one aspherical element, three extreme aspherical elements, and two extra-low dispersion elements to minimize spherical and chromatic aberrations, and to produce extremely sharp high-resolution images. Nano AR II coatings keep reflections, flare, and ghosting at bay while maintaining clarity and color fidelity.

XD Linear Motor Autofocus System. The XD Linear Motor system uses four autofocus motors and an internal-focusing design to provide fast, nearly silent, and highly accurate focusing performance that’s great for still and video use. A dedicated focus hold button and AF/MF switch help to tailor focusing to your shooting needs.

High-Quality Build. The FE 12-24mm offers dust- and moisture-resistant sealing for use in less-than-ideal conditions. The all-metal barrel and smooth, responsive, rubberized zoom and manual-focus rings give this lens a solid feel. Its front element has a fluorine coating to help protect it from fingerprints and debris.', 4000000.0, '{"Angle of View": "122-84°", "Aperture Blades": "9, rounded", "Brand": "Sony", "Filter Type": "Rear Mount", "Focal Length": "12-24", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "14/17", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Ultra Wide Angle and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "0.14x", "Mfr. Model Number": "SEL1224GM", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "11.02\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "1.86 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Sony FE 12-24mm f/2.8 GM
	Front & rear caps
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1869, 2, 54, 'Sony FE 12-24mm f/2.8 GM w/ Haida Rear ND Filter Kit', 'sony-fe-12-24mm-f-2-8-gm-w-haida-rear-nd-filter-kit', 'The Sony FE 12-24mm f/2.8 GM w/ Haida Rear ND Filter Kit takes the OG 12-24mm f/2.8 GM a step further with a pre-installed Haida ND filter holder and four interchangeable ND filters. Key features include:

ND0.9, ND1.2, ND1.8, and ND3.0 filters
K9 optical glass
Dedicated rear lens adapter ring
Filter holder pre-installed

Full-Frame E-Mount. As a part of the G Master line of lenses, the 12-24mm f/2.8 is designed to cover Sony E-mount cameras’ full-frame sensors. It’s also fully compatible with APS-C NEX cameras. This particular rental provides you with this lens, a pre-installed Haida filter holder, and four Haida Rear ND filters, coming in ND0.9, ND1.2, ND1.8, and ND3.0. These filters are interchangeable, and as ND filters, are designed to help filter light through the lens without compromising color accuracy.

Ultra-Wide Zoom. When used on a full-frame camera, this lens’ zoom range is wide. Like really wide. Its field of view ranges from 122° at its widest to 84° at the long end, which means it’s perfect for night scenes and starry skies. With an APS-C sensor camera, you’ll get a focal length equivalent to 18-36mm. The constant f/2.8 aperture and rounded nine-blade diaphragm make it a great choice for low-light shooting while giving you excellent depth-of-field control.

Advanced Optics. The FE 12-24mm f/2.8 GM’s fourteen-group/seventeen-element design includes one aspherical element, three extreme aspherical elements, and two extra-low dispersion elements to minimize spherical and chromatic aberrations, and to produce extremely sharp high-resolution images. Nano AR II coatings keep reflections, flare, and ghosting at bay while maintaining clarity and color fidelity.

XD Linear Motor Autofocus System. The XD Linear Motor system uses four autofocus motors and an internal-focusing design to provide fast, nearly silent, and highly accurate focusing performance that’s great for still and video use. A dedicated focus hold button and AF/MF switch help to tailor focusing to your shooting needs.

High-Quality Build. The FE 12-24mm offers dust- and moisture-resistant sealing for use in less-than-ideal conditions. The all-metal barrel and smooth, responsive, rubberized zoom and manual-focus rings give this lens a solid feel. Its front element has a fluorine coating to help protect it from fingerprints and debris.', 4150000.0, '{"Angle of View": "122-84°", "Aperture Blades": "9, rounded", "Brand": "Sony", "Filter Type": "Rear Mount", "Focal Length": "12-24", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "14/17", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle, Kit, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "0.14x", "Mfr. Model Number": "SEL1224GM", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "11.02\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "1.86 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Sony FE 12-24mm f/2.8 GM
	Haida rear filter holder
	Front & rear caps
	Haida ND 0.9 rear filter
	Haida ND 1.2 rear filter
	Haida ND 1.8 rear filter
	Haida ND 3.0 rear filter
	Haida ND rear filter kit case
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1870, 2, 54, 'Sony FE 12-24mm f/4 G', 'sony-fe-12-24mm-f-4-g', 'The Sony FE 12-24mm f/4 G is a wide-angle, full-frame zoom lens designed for Sony E-mount cameras. Key features include:

Covers the ultra-wide to moderately wide focal range
Great for landscapes, cityscapes, and architectural shooting
Advanced optical formula for high-quality images
Fast, silent autofocus with full-time manual focusing

Full-Frame E-mount. As a part of the FE line of lenses, the 12-24mm f/4 is designed to cover Sony E-mount cameras’ full-frame sensors. It’s also fully compatible with APS-C NEX cameras.

Wide-Angle Zoom. When used on a full-frame camera, this lens’s zoom range is wide. Like really wide. Its field of view ranges from 122° at its widest to 84° at the long end, which means it’s perfect for sweeping cityscapes, landscapes, and architectural shooting. With an APS-C sensor camera, you’ll get a focal length equivalent to 18-36mm. The constant f/4 aperture isn’t quite fast enough for low-light shooting, but it’s better than a variable-aperture zoom.

Advanced Optics. The FE 12-24mm f/4 G’s thirteen-group/seventeen-element design includes four aspherical elements, three extra-low dispersion elements, and one super extra-low dispersion element to minimize spherical and chromatic aberrations, and to produce clear, high-contrast images. Nano AR coatings keep reflections, flare, and ghosting at bay while maintaining clarity and color fidelity.

Direct Drive SSM Autofocus System. This internal focusing system provides fast, nearly silent, and highly accurate autofocus performance that’s great for still and video use. A dedicated focus hold button and AF/MF switch help to tailor focusing to your shooting needs.

High-Quality Build. The FE 12-24mm offers dust- and moisture-resistant sealing for use in less-than-ideal conditions. The all-metal barrel and smooth, responsive, rubberized zoom and manual-focus rings give this lens a solid feel.', 2975000.0, '{"Angle of View": "122-84°", "Aperture Blades": "7, rounded", "Brand": "Sony", "Dimensions": "3.43 × 4.6″ (ø x L)", "Filter Type": "Rear Mount", "Focal Length": "12-24", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "13/17", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "4.0", "Maximum Magnification": "0.14x", "Mfr. Model Number": "SEL1224G", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "11.02\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "1.24 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	FE 12-24mm f/4 G
	Front & rear caps', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (1871, 2, 54, 'Sony FE 135mm f/1.8 GM', 'sony-fe-135mm-f-1-8-gm', 'The Sony FE 135mm f/1.8 GM is a professional-grade full-frame E-mount prime designed for Sony a7- and a9-series cameras. It’s the sharpest lens we’ve ever tested as of March 2019. Key features include:

Incredibly sharp image quality
Professional-grade portrait lens
Fast, nearly silent autofocus
Excellent low-light capabilities

Full-Frame E-mount. As a part of the FE line of lenses, the Sony FE 135mm f/1.8 GM is designed to cover the full-frame sensors on Sony a7- and a9-series cameras. Since it’s an E-mount lens, it’s also fully compatible with APS-C cameras as well. On an APS-C camera, you’ll get a focal length equivalent to 202.5mm

Pro-Grade Medium Telephoto Prime. The FE 135 GM’s fast f/1.8 aperture and medium tele focal length make it perfect for portrait photography. At f/1.8, you’ll get dramatic, shallow depth of field and excellent performance in low light.

XD Linear Motor Autofocus System. This internal focusing system provides fast, nearly silent, and highly accurate performance that’s great for still and video use. Two dedicated focus hold buttons and an AF/MF switch help to tailor focusing to your shooting needs. There’s also a manual aperture ring that can be “de-clicked” for smooth aperture adjustment when shooting video.

G-Master Series Quality. The GM series is Sony’s premium lens offering. What sets it apart from other Sony lenses is an emphasis on an extremely high resolving power of fifty lines per mm, out-of-focus “bokeh” quality, and a robust, weather-sealed body.

Advanced Optics. The FE 135 GM uses one “XA” extreme aspherical element, one extra-low dispersion element, and one Super ED element to minimize spherical and chromatic aberrations, and to produce incredibly sharp, high-contrast images. The rounded eleven-blade aperture diaphragm produces smooth out-of-focus highlights when you desire a shallow depth of field.', 2925000.0, '{"Angle of View": "18°", "Aperture Blades": "11, rounded", "Brand": "Sony", "Filter Size": "82.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "135-135", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "10/13", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Telephoto and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "1.8", "Maximum Magnification": "0.25x", "Mfr. Model Number": "SEL135F18GM", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "2.3’", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "2.09 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Sony FE 135mm f/1.8 GM
	Front & rear caps
