Broad-Ranging Stabilization Options. Looking to eliminate the appearance of camera shake? You get five-axis in-body optical stabilization with AI-enhanced processing, a Dynamic Active mode designed to stabilize hand-held footage, and embedded E-mount lens-shake metadata for easier post-production.

CFexpress Type A and SD Support. The Sony FX2 has one CFexpress Type A/SDXC card slot and one SD card slot, which means you can use CFexpress Type A media for the highest bitrate recording and SDXC or SD cards for less demanding frame rates and bitrates. This configuration also lets you capture video and stills to separate cards without the need to switch cards.

Built-in Wireless Streaming. Whether controlling the camera via a smartphone or tablet, streaming wirelessly to a client monitor, or wirelessly transferring files to editorial, the FX2’s built-in Wi-Fi is prepared to handle all of your wireless needs.

Monitor and Control. You can use Sony’s Monitor & Control app for Android and iOS to turn your smartphone into a wireless video monitor. It lets you use your phone to remotely control the camera, display and control clips from the camera, start and stop recording, adjust white balance, change ISO, adjust color settings, and swap between LUTs.', 4975000.0, '{"Brand": "Sony", "Camera Mount": "Sony E", "Camera Type": "Cinema", "Compatible Media": "CFexpress Type A and SD", "General": "Dimensions (W x H x D)5.1 × 4.1 × 3.1″129.7 × 103.7 × 77.8mmWeight1.3 lb. / 594 g (Body Only)1.5 lb. / 679 g (With Battery, Recording Media)", "Item Type": "Camera", "Maximum Video Resolution": "4K", "Recording Formats": "H.264 ALL-Intra/H.264 Long GOP/MPEG-4 AVC/XAVC S 4:2:2 10-BitUHD 4K (3840 × 2160) at 23.98/25/29.97/50/59.94 fps [100 to 200 Mb/s]1920 × 1920 at 23.98/25/29.97/50/59.94 fps [50 Mb/s]H.264 ALL-Intra/H.264 Long GOP/MPEG-4 AVC/XAVC S-I 4:2:2 10-BitDCI 4K (4096 × 2160) at 23.98/24.00/25/29.97/50/59.94 fps [240 to 600 Mb/s]UHD 4K (3840 × 2160) at 23.98/25/29.97/50/59.94 fps [240 to 600 Mb/s]1920 × 1920 at 23.98/25/29.97/50/59.94 fps [89 to 222 Mb/s]H.264 ALL-Intra/H.264 Long GOP/MPEG-4 AVC/XAVC S 4:2:0 8-BitUHD 4K (3840 × 2160) at 23.98/25/29.97/50/59.94 fps [60 to 150 Mb/s]1920 × 1080 at 23.98/25/29.97/50/59.94/100/120 fps [16 to 100 Mb/s]H.265 ALL-Intra/H.265 Long GOP/XAVC HS 4:2:2 10-BitUHD 4K (3840 × 2160) at 23.98/50/59.94 fps [50 to 200 Mb/s]H.265 ALL-Intra/H.265 Long GOP/XAVC HS 4:2:0 8-BitUHD 4K (3840 × 2160) at 23.98/50/59.94 fps [30 to 150 Mb/s]", "Screen Type": "Touchscreen and Swivel", "Sensor Size": "Full-Frame", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Viewfinder Type": "Electronic", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Wireless Connectivity": "Wi-Fi and Bluetooth"}', 'Includes

	Sony FX2 Digital Cinema Camera
	Sony XLR-H1 XLR handle unit
