Durable Construction. You can use this lens in inclement conditions thanks to its moisture-resistant build. The front element’s fluorine coating protects against smearing and debris.', 1225000.0, '{"Angle of View": "105°20’-71°35’", "Aperture Blades": "7, rounded", "Brand": "Tamron", "Dimensions": "2.9 × 3.4″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "67.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "11-20", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "10/12", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "APS-C", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Ultra Wide Angle and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "0.25x", "Mfr. Model Number": "AFB060S-700", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "5.9\\"", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "0.73 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

