TAP-in Compatible. The 150-600m G2 is compatible with Tamron’s TAP-in Console for fine-tuning focus.

Alternative Options Available! If this lens isn’t exactly what you’re looking for, we carry a few great alternatives at very similar price points. Check out the Sigma 150-600mm f/5-6.3 DG OS HSM Contemporary for Nikon F, Sigma 150-600mm f/5-6.3 DG OS HSM Sports for Nikon F, Sigma 60-600mm f/4.5-6.3 DG OS HSM Sports for Nikon F, or Nikon 200-500mm f/5.6E ED AF-S VR!', 2025000.0, '{"Angle of View": "Full Frame: 16° 25’ – 4° 8’", "Brand": "Tamron", "Dimensions": "Length: 10.24\\"", "Flare Resistance": "BBAR, eBAND, and fluorine coatings", "Focusing System": "USD motor, full-time manual, and nonrotating front element", "Groups/Elements": "13/21", "Hood Included": "Yes", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Telephoto", "Maximum Magnification": "0.256x", "Mfr. Model Number": "AFA022N-700", "Weather Resistant": "Yes", "Zoom Method": "Barrel extend"}', 'Includes

