1:2 maximum magnification; 4.7-inch minimum focus
High-quality optical design
Fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus

Versatile Wide-Angle Prime. The Tamron 24mm f/2.8 Di III OSD M 1:2’s wide-angle focal length is ideal for travel photography, while its 1:2 maximum magnification ratio and 4.7-inch minimum focusing distance make it great for working with close-up subjects. Its f/2.8 maximum aperture gives you excellent depth-of-field control and consistent brightness. Using an APS-C camera? This lens will give you a 36mm equivalent focal length.

Advanced Optics. The nine-group/ten-element optical formula incorporates three Low-Dispersion elements and one molded glass aspherical element to give you sharp, high-contrast images across the image plane. Each element features Tamron’s BBAR coating to combat flare and ghosting for even greater contrast in backlit and harsh lighting conditions.

Fast, Accurate Autofocus. The 24mm autofocuses quickly, accurately, and smoothly, making it ideal for still and video use. It also offers full-time manual-focus override for even greater precision.

Durable Construction. You can use this lens in inclement conditions thanks to its moisture-resistant build. The front lens’s fluorine coating protects against smearing and debris.', 650000.0, '{"Angle of View": "84°4’", "Aperture Blades": "7, rounded", "Brand": "Tamron", "Dimensions": "2.87 × 2.5″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "67.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "24-24", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "9/10", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "0.5x", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "4.7\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "0.47 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Tamron 24mm f/2.8 Di III OSD M 1:2 for Sony E
	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	67mm protective filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2000, 2, 55, 'Tamron 25-200mm f/2.8-5.6 Di III VXD G2 for Sony E', 'tamron-25-200mm-f-2-8-5-6-di-iii-vxd-g2-for-sony-e', 'The Tamron 25-200mm f/2.8-5.6 Di III VXD G2 for Sony E is a versatile, wide-angle zoom for full-frame Sony E-mount cameras, and an update to the Tamron 28-200mm f/2.8-5.6 Di III RXD. Key features include:

Versatile, fast-aperture all-in-one zoom
Revised optical formula for greater sharpness
Improved autofocus performance
1:1.9 maximum magnification for half-macro shooting

What’s Changed? The Tamron 25-200mm f/2.8-5.6 Di III VXD G2 for Sony E offers several significant improvements to its previous-gen predecessor, the Tamron 28-200mm f/2.8-5.6 Di III RXD. It maintains the 28-200’s compact build while expanding its wide end to 25mm. Its 1:1.9 maximum magnification at the 25mm end enables half-macro photography. Its revised optical formula improves image quality, and the autofocus system is even more precise.

Fast-Aperture Wide-to-Telephoto Zoom. The Tamron 25-200mm f/2.8-5.6 Di III VXD G2’s wide-to-telephoto zoom range makes it great for portrait, landscape, nature, and sports photography, among many other applications. Its bright, f/2.8 maximum aperture gives you excellent depth-of-field control; soft, beautiful bokeh; and consistent brightness throughout the zoom range.

Revised Optical Design. The redesigned fourteen-group/eighteen-element optical formula includes an extra-low dispersion element, three low-dispersion elements, two glass-molded aspherical elements, and two hybrid aspherical elements to give you sharp, high-contrast images across the image plane. Each lens element has a BBAR-G2 coating that combats ghosting, internal reflections, and flare while helping maintain sharpness and color fidelity even in strong light.

VXD Linear-Motor Autofocus System. The 25-200mm’s VXD linear-motor autofocus system tracks even the most fast-moving subjects quickly, accurately, quietly, and smoothly, making it ideal for still and video use. This lens is compatible with Sony’s Direct Manual Focus function and Eye AF on cameras with those features, and there’s also full-time manual-focus override for even greater precision. An 6.5-inch minimum focusing distance at the wide end lets you get reasonably close to your subject.

Durable Construction. You can use this lens in inclement conditions thanks to its moisture-resistant build. The front element’s fluorine coating protects against smearing and debris.', 1550000.0, '{"Angle of View": "81°44’-12°21’", "Aperture Blades": "9, rounded", "Brand": "Tamron", "Dimensions": "3 × 4.8″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "67.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "25-200", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "14/18", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle, Standard, Telephoto, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "0.53x", "Mfr. Model Number": "AFA075S700", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "6.3-31.2\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "1.3 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Tamron 25-200mm f/2.8-5.6 Di III VXD G2 for Sony E
	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	67mm Hoya EVO antistatic filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2001, 2, 55, 'Tamron 28-200mm f/2.8-5.6 Di III RXD for Sony E', 'tamron-28-200mm-f-2-8-5-6-di-iii-rxd-for-sony-e', 'The Tamron 28-200mm f/2.8-5.6 Di III RXD is a versatile standard zoom designed for full-frame Sony E-mount cameras. Key features include:

Versatile standard-range zoom
High-quality optics for sharp, clear images
Fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus
Durable, weather-resistant build

Versatile Standard Zoom. The Tamron 28-200mm f/2.8-5.6 Di III RXD’s bright f/2.8-5.6 maximum aperture range is great for shooting in available lighting conditions, particularly when you’re working at the wide-angle end of its zoom range, while the rounded seven-blade diaphragm creates smooth, pleasing bokeh. Using an APS-C camera? This lens will give you 42-300mm equivalent focal length.

Optics. The fourteen-group/eighteen-element optical formula uses specialized glass to give you sharp, high-contrast images across the image plane.

Fast, Accurate Autofocus. The 28-200mm autofocuses quickly, accurately, and smoothly, making it ideal for still and video use. It also offers full-time manual-focus override and compatibility with Sony’s Direct Manual Focus function for even greater precision. Its 7.5-inch minimum focusing distance and 1:3.1 maximum magnification make it useful for working with close-up subjects.

Durable Construction. You can use this lens in inclement conditions thanks to its moisture-resistant build. The front lens’s fluorine coating protects against smearing and debris. A zoom-lock switch keeps the lens retracted when you’re not using it.', 1350000.0, '{"Angle of View": "75º23’-12º21’", "Aperture Blades": "7, rounded", "Brand": "Tamron", "Dimensions": "2.91 × 4.6″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "67.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "28-200", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "14/18", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Standard, Telephoto, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "0.32x", "Mfr. Model Number": "A071", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "7.5\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "1.27 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Tamron 28-200mm f/2.8-5.6 Di III RXD for Sony E
	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	67mm protective filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2002, 2, 55, 'Tamron 28-300mm f/4-7.1 Di III VC VXD for Sony E', 'tamron-28-300mm-f-4-7-1-di-iii-vc-vxd-for-sony-e', 'The Tamron 28-300mm f/4-7.1 Di III VC VXD for Sony E is a full-frame telephoto zoom lens with a 10.7x zoom range that begins at 28mm, providing ultimate versatility. Key features include:

Exceptionally portable for its range
Voice-coil eXtreme-torque Drive linear AF motor
Vibration Compensation
Ideal for landscapes, portraits, wildlife, and sports

Compact Ultra-Telephoto Zoom. Covering a massive wide-view to super-telephoto range, the Tamron 28-300mm f/4-7.1 Di III VC VXD for Sony E is an extremely versatile lens that is remarkably portable: only 5" long and under 2 lb. With one lens you can cover landscapes, cityscapes, portraits, wildlife, and sports.

Enhanced Form Factor and Operation. Tamron made some key structural tweaks to this lens for a user-friendly experience. The arc rotation of the zoom ring has been shortened so that you can reach your desired focal length quickly. The rubber on the ring has also been improved for better grip with deeper grooves. A curvier, more contoured profile makes the entire lens more ergonomic and comfortable to hold and the focus setting buttons on the barrel are surrounded by a bevel that naturally guides your finger to position. All of this, along with its overall compactness, allows this lens to be used all day without fatigue.

Outstanding Performance in Various Conditions. The Tamron 28-300mm f/4-7.1 Di III VC VXD for Sony E is equipped with a Voice-coil eXtreme-torque Drive (VXD) linear motor focus mechanism for advanced autofocusing with excellent tracking performance in low light. Tamron’s signature Vibration Compensation (VC) controls camera shake and this particular lens is equipped with AI technology that chooses the right compensation characteristics depending on whether you are shooting video or at focal lengths under 100mm. Leak-resistant seals are featured throughout the lens barrel along with high-precision components to withstand rigorous use.

Try it with These E-Mount Cameras. The portable nature of this lens makes it a great option for shooters on the go and pairs well with slightly more compact cameras like the Sony a7C II, the Sony a7CR, or the Sony ZV-E1.', 1500000.0, '{"Angle of View": "75º23’-8º15’", "Brand": "Tamron", "Dimensions": "3 × 5″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "67.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "28-300", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "13/20", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Standard, Telephoto, Supertelephoto, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "4.0", "Maximum Magnification": "0.26x", "Mfr. Model Number": "A074", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "7.5\\"", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "1.3 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Tamron 28-300mm f/4-7.1 Di III VC VXD for Sony E
	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	67mm protective filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2003, 2, 55, 'Tamron 28-75mm f/2.8 Di III VXD G2 for Nikon Z', 'tamron-28-75mm-f-2-8-di-iii-vxd-g2-for-nikon-z', 'The Tamron 28-75mm f/2.8 Di III VXD G2 is a full-frame, Nikon Z-mount zoom offering a versatile wide-to-portrait-length range. Key features include:

Voice-coil eXtreme-torque Drive linear AF motor
Bright constant f/2.8 maximum aperture
Updated ergonomic design
Ideal for travel, candids, events, and portraits

Compact Ultra-Telephoto Zoom. Covering a wide to portrait-length range, the Tamron 28-75mm f/2.8 Di III VXD G2 for Nikon Z is a versatile lens that is remarkably portable: only 4.7" long and under 2 lb. With one lens you can cover portraits, street photography, travel, and events. On a crop-sensor camera this lens will provide an equivalent 42-112.5mm range.

Enhanced Form Factor and Operation. Tamron made some key structural tweaks to this lens for a user-friendly experience. The arc rotation of the zoom ring has been shortened so that you can reach your desired focal length quickly. The rubber on the ring has also been improved for better grip with deeper grooves. A curvier, more contoured profile makes the entire lens more ergonomic and comfortable to hold and the focus setting buttons on the barrel are surrounded by a bevel that naturally guides your finger to position. All of this, along with its overall compactness, allows this lens to be used all day without fatigue.

Outstanding Performance in Various Conditions. The Tamron 28-75mm f/2.8 Di III VXD G2 for Nikon Z is equipped with a Voice-coil eXtreme-torque Drive (VXD) linear motor focus mechanism for advanced autofocusing with excellent tracking performance in low light. Close focusing has been improved over the prior version and the optical system has been redesigned for edge-to-edge sharpness.

Try it with These Z-Mount Cameras. The portable nature of this lens makes it a great option for shooters on the go and pairs well with slightly more compact cameras like the Nikon Z8. It’s also a great all-in-one lens that you can use all day and is a suitable companion to a long-lasting camera such as the Nikon Z9, which boasts a 750-shot-per-charge lifespan, a durable build, and thoughtful ergonomics.', 1475000.0, '{"Brand": "Tamron", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon Z", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle and Standard", "Optical Design": "Groups/Elements15/17Aperture Blades9, Rounded"}', 'Includes

	Tamron 28-75mm f/2.8 Di III VXD G2 for Nikon Z
	Front & rear caps
	Tamron HA063 hood
	67mm Hoya EVO antistatic filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2004, 2, 55, 'Tamron 28-75mm f/2.8 Di III VXD G2 for Sony E', 'tamron-28-75mm-f-2-8-di-iii-vxd-g2-for-sony-e', 'The Tamron 28-75mm f/2.8 Di III VXD G2 for Sony E is an advanced, flexible wide-to-portrait zoom designed for full-frame Sony cameras. Key features include:

Versatile, fast-aperture, wide-to-portrait zoom
High-quality optical design
Fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus
Durable, weather-resistant build

Fast-Aperture Standard Zoom. The Tamron 28-75mm f/2.8 Di III VXD G2’s wide-to-portrait range and f/2.8 maximum wide-open aperture make it great for portrait, wedding, and event photography. Its bright maximum aperture gives you excellent depth-of-field control and consistent brightness throughout the zoom range. Using an APS-C camera? This lens will give you 42-112.5mm equivalent focal length.

Advanced Optical Design. The fifteen-group/seventeen-element optical formula includes four low-dispersion elements and three glass-molded aspherical elements to give you sharp, high-contrast images across the image plane. Each lens element has a BBAR-G2 coating that combats ghosting, internal reflections, and flare while helping maintain sharpness and color fidelity even in strong light.

VXD Linear-Motor Autofocus System. The 28-75mm’s VXD linear-motor autofocus system tracks even the most fast-moving subjects quickly, accurately, quietly, and smoothly, making it ideal for still and video use. This lens is compatible with Sony’s Direct Manual Focus function and Eye AF on cameras with those features, and there’s also full-time manual-focus override for even greater precision.

Durable Construction. You can use this lens in inclement conditions thanks to its moisture-resistant build. The front element’s fluorine coating protects against smearing and debris.', 1450000.0, '{"Aperture Blades": "9, rounded", "Brand": "Tamron", "Dimensions": "3 × 4.6″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "67.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "28-75", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "15/17", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle, Standard, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "0.37x", "Mfr. Model Number": "AFA063S700", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "7.1\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "1.2 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Tamron 28-75mm f/2.8 Di III VXD G2 for Sony E
	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	67mm protective filter
	Lens pouch', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2005, 2, 55, 'Tamron 35-100mm f/2.8 Di III VXD (E)', 'tamron-35-100mm-f-2-8-di-iii-vxd-e', 'The Tamron 35-100mm f/2.8 Di III VXD (E) is an advanced, flexible wide-to-telephoto zoom designed for full-frame Sony E-mount cameras. Key features include:

Quick and quiet VXD linear motor focus mechanism
Tamron Lens Utility connector port
8.7-25.6" minimum focusing distance
Lightweight and comfortable handling

Everyday Zoom. Lightweight and under 5", the Tamron 35-100mm f/2.8 Di III VXD is a great everyday shooter. It maintains a maximum f/2.8 aperture across the entire zoom range, making it suitable for dawn, dusk, and indoor shooting. For this reason, the Tamron 35-100mm is touted as a dream lens for travelers looking for maximum range in the smallest package possible without sacrificing speed. It is compatible with full-frame Sony E-mount cameras. On crop-frame sensor sensors, it will provide an equivalent (approximate) 52-150mm range, which is good for portrait work.

Up Close and Personal. An 8.7" minimum focusing distance makes this lens particularly versatile. When shooting at the wide end of the zoom range, you can capture tabletop shots of products, food, or small details at events. The minimized barrel extension stabilizes the 35-100mm’s center of gravity for steady operation and is small enough for use with a gimbal.

Tamron Lens Utility Compatible. The Tamron 35-100mm f/2.8 Di III VXD is equipped with a waterproof USB-C connector port that is compatible with the Tamron TAMRON-LINK (not included). This lets you control the lens wirelessly from your smartphone up to 16’ away! Check out Tamron’s Lens Utility Software here, which you will need for your smart device. For more information, see Tamron’s Ultimate Guide To Tamron Lens Utility Software.', 1550000.0, '{"Angle of View": "63º26’-24º25’", "Aperture Blades": "9, rounded", "Brand": "Tamron", "Dimensions": "3.2 × 4.7″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "67.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "35-100", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "13/15", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Standard, Telephoto, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "0.3x", "Mfr. Model Number": "AFA078S700", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "8.7-25.6\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "1.2 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Tamron 35-100mm f/2.8 Di III VXD (E)
	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	67mm protective filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
