Advanced Optical Design. The 18-group/24-element optical formula includes extra-low dispersion elements, low-dispersion elements, and hybrid aspherical elements to give you high-contrast, color-accurate images across the image plane while reducing color fringing, chromatic aberrations, and distortion throughout the zoom range. Each lens element has a BBAR-G2 coating that combats ghosting, internal reflections, and flare while helping maintain sharpness and color fidelity even in strong light.

VC Image Stabilization. Tamron’s proprietary VC (Vibration Compensation) image stabilization helps to offset the effects of camera shake for more effective handheld and low-light shooting. You get three image-stabilization modes: a standard single-shot mode, a panning-optimized mode, and a framing priority mode.

VXD Linear-Motor Autofocus System. The 50-400mm’s VXD linear-motor autofocus system tracks even the most fast-moving subjects quickly, accurately, and smoothly, making it ideal for still and video use. This lens is compatible with Sony’s Direct Manual Focus function and Eye AF on cameras with those features, and there’s also full-time manual-focus override for even greater precision.

Durable Construction. You can use this lens in inclement conditions thanks to its moisture-resistant build. The front element’s fluorine coating protects against smearing and debris.

Tripod Mount Included. This rental includes the Tamron A035TM tripod mount, which is designed to mount this lens on most Arca-type heads and clamps.', 2050000.0, '{"Aperture Blades": "9, rounded", "Brand": "Sony", "Dimensions": "3.5 × 7.2″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "67.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "50-400", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "18/24", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Standard, Telephoto, Supertelephoto, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "4.5", "Maximum Magnification": "0.5x", "Mfr. Model Number": "A067", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "9.8\\"", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "2.54 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Tamron 50-400mm f/4.5-6.3 Di III VC VXD Lens
	Front & rear caps
	Tamron A035TM tripod mount
	Hood
	67mm protective filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2015, 2, 55, 'Tamron 70-180mm f/2.8 Di III VC VXD G2 for Nikon Z', 'tamron-70-180mm-f-2-8-di-iii-vc-vxd-g2-for-nikon-z', 'The Tamron 70-180mm f/2.8 Di III VC VXD G2 for Nikon Z is an advanced, flexible short to mid telephoto zoom designed for full-frame Nikon Z-mount cameras. Key features include:

Versatile, fast-aperture short to mid telephoto zoom
Revised optical formula for greater sharpness
Fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus
VC image stabilization; weather-resistant build

Fast-Aperture Telephoto Zoom. The Tamron 70-180mm f/2.8 Di III VC VXD G2’s short to mid telephoto zoom range and f/2.8 maximum wide-open aperture make it great for sports and wildlife photography. Its bright maximum aperture gives you excellent depth-of-field control; soft, beautiful bokeh; and consistent brightness throughout the zoom range.

Revised Optical Design. The redesigned fifteen-group/twenty-element optical formula includes an extra-low dispersion element, three low-dispersion elements, two glass-molded aspherical elements, and a hybrid aspherical element to give you sharp, high-contrast images across the image plane. Each lens element has a BBAR-G2 coating that combats ghosting, internal reflections, and flare while helping maintain sharpness and color fidelity even in strong light.

VXD Linear-Motor Autofocus System. The 70-180mm’s VXD linear-motor autofocus system tracks even the most fast-moving subjects quickly, accurately, quietly, and smoothly, making it ideal for still and video use. This lens is compatible with Sony’s Direct Manual Focus function and Eye AF on cameras with those features, and there’s also full-time manual-focus override for even greater precision. An 11.8-inch minimum focusing distance lets you get reasonably close to your subject.

Vibration Compensation. Tamron’s Vibration Compensation system is based around a free-floating element controlled by two gyroscoping sensors that measure horizontal and vertical vibrations and compensate accordingly to eliminate the appearance of camera shake.

Durable Construction. You can use this lens in inclement conditions thanks to its moisture-resistant build. The front element’s fluorine coating protects against smearing and debris.', 1900000.0, '{"Brand": "Tamron", "Filter Size": "67.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Nikon Z", "Lens Type": "Telephoto", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Mfr. Model Number": "AFA065Z700", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weight": "1.9 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Tamron 70-180mm f/2.8 Di III VC VXD G2 for Nikon Z
	Tamron HA065 hood
	Front & rear caps
	Hoya EVO 67mm antistatic filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2016, 2, 55, 'Tamron 70-180mm f/2.8 Di III VC VXD G2 for Sony E', 'tamron-70-180mm-f-2-8-di-iii-vc-vxd-g2-for-sony-e', 'The Tamron 70-180mm f/2.8 Di III VC VXD G2 for Sony E is an advanced and flexible short-to-mid telephoto zoom designed with updates to the previous 70-180mm f/2.8 Di III VXD. Key features include:

Versatile, fast-aperture short to mid telephoto zoom
Revised optical formula for greater sharpness
Fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus
VC image stabilization; weather-resistant build

Fast-Aperture Telephoto Zoom. The Tamron 70-180mm f/2.8 Di III VC VXD G2’s short to mid telephoto zoom range and f/2.8 maximum wide-open aperture make it great for sports and wildlife photography. Its bright maximum aperture gives you excellent depth-of-field control; soft, beautiful bokeh; and consistent brightness throughout the zoom range. Using an APS-C camera? This lens will give you a 105-270mm equivalent focal length.

Revised Optical Design. The redesigned fifteen-group/twenty-element optical formula includes an extra-low dispersion element, three low-dispersion elements, two glass-molded aspherical elements, and a hybrid aspherical element to give you sharp, high-contrast images across the image plane. Each lens element has a BBAR-G2 coating that combats ghosting, internal reflections, and flare while helping maintain sharpness and color fidelity even in strong light.

VXD Linear-Motor Autofocus System. The 70-180mm’s VXD linear-motor autofocus system tracks even the most fast-moving subjects quickly, accurately, quietly, and smoothly, making it ideal for still and video use. This lens is compatible with Sony’s Direct Manual Focus function and Eye AF on cameras with those features, and there’s also full-time manual-focus override for even greater precision. An 11.8-inch minimum focusing distance lets you get reasonably close to your subject.

Vibration Compensation. Tamron’s Vibration Compensation system is based around a free-floating element controlled by two gyroscoping sensors that measure horizontal and vertical vibrations and compensate accordingly to eliminate the appearance of camera shake.

Durable Construction. You can use this lens in inclement conditions thanks to its moisture-resistant build. The front element’s fluorine coating protects against smearing and debris.', 1950000.0, '{"Angle of View": "34°21’-13°42’", "Aperture Blades": "9", "Brand": "Tamron", "Dimensions": "3.3 × 6.2″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "67.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "70-180", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "15/20", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Telephoto and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "0.21-0.38x", "Mfr. Model Number": "AFA065S-700", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "11.8\\"", "Stabilization": "Yes", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "1.88 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Variable Focal Length"}', 'Includes

