Common Uses. The fast, constant f/2.8 aperture and versatile focal range make this lens a good choice for sports photography, portraiture, and event photography.  It’s also great for low-light shooting. On a crop-sensor camera, it gives you a 105-300mm equivalent focal-length range.

Ring-Type USD Autofocus System. Its USD focus motor provides fast, nearly silent autofocus performance that’s great for capturing fast-moving subjects. The motor also gives you full-time manual control, and this lens has a 3.1-foot minimum focusing distance.

High-Quality Optics. The updated 23-element/17-group optical design features one extra-low dispersion element and five low-dispersion elements to help minimize chromatic aberrations while maximizing clarity and sharpness. Its advanced multi-layer eBAND and BBAR coatings reduce ghosting and lens flare to improve performance. The nine-blade electromagnetic diaphragm retains its round shape from f/2.8-5.6, providing smooth background blurring with circular out-of-focus highlights.

Built-In VC Image Stabilization. The built-in Vibration Compensation minimizes the appearance of camera shake for up to five stops, letting you shoot hand-held in low-light conditions. You get three distinct VC modes to best fit your shooting circumstances: Mode 1 gives you a stabilized viewfinder image and stabilized results; Mode 2 is designed for panning movements; and Mode 3 only stabilizes during capture, and doesn’t stabilize the viewfinder image.

Durable, High-Quality Build. The 70-200 f/2.8 has a curved metal barrel for easy handling. Its large, textured focus and zoom rings to make it ergonomically sound. The moisture-resistant construction means it’s able to hold up in less-than-ideal shooting conditions. It includes both a removable, rotating tripod ring with an Arca-type compatible foot.

TAP-in Compatible. This lens is compatible with Tamron’s TAP-in Console for Nikon.', 1900000.0, '{"Brand": "Tamron", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Telephoto", "Mfr. Model Number": "AFA025N-700"}', 'Includes

	Lens
	Front & rear caps
	HA025 hood
	Tripod ring
	77mm protection filter
	Case', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2020, 2, 55, 'Tamron 70-300mm f/4.5-6.3 Di III RXD for Nikon Z', 'tamron-70-300mm-f-4-5-6-3-di-iii-rxd-for-nikon-z', 'The Tamron 70-300mm f/4.5-6.3 Di III RXD is a versatile telephoto zoom designed for Nikon Z-mount mirrorless cameras. Key features include:

Versatile telephoto zoom
High-quality optical design
Fast, accurate, and nearly silent autofocus
Durable, weather-resistant build

Versatile Telephoto Zoom. The Tamron 70-300mm f/4.5-6.3 Di III RXD’s telephoto zoom range makes it great for a broad range of shooting situations, including sports, portraiture, and wildlife. Using an APS-C camera? This lens will give you 105-450mm equivalent focal-length range.

Variable Aperture. The variable f/4.5-6.3 aperture isn’t useful for low-light shooting, so you’ll probably want to stick with outdoor-lighting conditions for best results. The rounded seven-blade diaphragm contributes to smooth, pleasing bokeh for shallow depth-of-field techniques.

Advanced Optical Design. The ten-group/fifteen-element optical formula includes a low-dispersion front element that gives you sharp, high-contrast images across the image plane. Each element features Tamron’s BBAR coating to combat flare and ghosting for even greater contrast in backlit and harsh lighting conditions.

Fast, Accurate Autofocus. The 70-300mm autofocuses quickly, accurately, and smoothly, making it ideal for stills and video use. It can also take advantage of in-camera features like Fast Hybrid AF and Eye AF.

Additional Features. This lens is compatible with in-camera chromatic-aberration, shading, and distortion lens-correction features. You can use this lens in inclement conditions thanks to its strong, moisture-resistant, aluminum-magnesium alloy build.', 1100000.0, '{"Brand": "Tamron", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon Z", "Lens Type": "Telephoto", "Physical": "Dimensions (ø x L)5.8 × 3.0″Weight1.2 lb."}', 'Includes

	Tamron 70-300mm
	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	67mm protective filter
	Lens pouch', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
