With its f/2.8 max aperture and its four-stop, second-generation image stabilization, the Canon 70-200mm f/2.8L IS III lens is perfect for capturing action, even when the lighting isn’t ideal.

We’ve paired this lens with the heavy-duty Oben ACM-2400 4-Section Aluminum Monopod, which extends to 63 inches. Instead of your standard ballhead, we’ve also included the Novoflex MagicBall 50 Ballhead. Ideal when using a monopod, it’s more flexible and easier to control than a standard ballhead.', 3250000.0, '{"Brand": "Canon", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Canon EF", "Lens Type": "Telephoto and Kit"}', 'Includes

