Versatile Short-Tele Prime. The Tokina ATX-M 85mm f/1.8 FE’s short-telephoto focal length makes it excellent for a range of applications, including portraiture, landscape photography, and sports photography. Using an APS-C camera? You’ll get a 127.5mm-equivalent focal length.

