Built for Real-World Shooting. The 35mm f/2.8 has an integrated Arca-Swiss compatible lens support for fast, easy mounting in your workflow, while its 77mm front filter thread allows you to use a wide array of filters without the need for unwieldy adapters. You can rotate this lens 360°, and there are click stops at 15° increments for intuitive adjustments. Finally, the front element’s water-, debris-, and moisture-resistant Frog-Eye coating keeps you working in a range of shooting conditions.', 2050000.0, '{"Angle of View": "87.5°", "Aperture Blades": "15", "Brand": "Venus Optics", "Dimensions": "4.1 × 5.9″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "77.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "35-35", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Groups/Elements": "12/14", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Canon RF", "Lens Type": "Macro, For Mirrorless, Tilt-Shift, and Standard", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "0.5x", "Mfr. Model Number": "VE3528TS-RF", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "9\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Tilt/Shift": "± 10° tilt\\n± 12mm shift", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "3.0 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

