INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2107, 2, 59, 'Venus Laowa 35mm f/2.8 Zero-D Tilt-Shift 0.5x Macro (Z)', 'venus-laowa-35mm-f-2-8-zero-d-tilt-shift-0-5x-macro-z', 'The Venus Laowa 35mm f/2.8 Zero-D Tilt-Shift 0.5x Macro (Z) is a versatile wide-angle tilt-shift macro prime for full-frame Nikon Z-mount mirrorless cameras. Key features include:

Clear, ultra-sharp rendering across the frame
+/- 10° tilt range; +/- 12mm shift range; 360° rotation
Great for product, tabletop, and architectural photography
9-inch min focusing distance; 0.5x max magnification

Versatile, Wide Tilt-Shift Prime. The Venus Laowa 35mm f/2.8 Zero-D Tilt-Shift 0.5x Macro’s wide focal length makes it an excellent choice for immersive architectural photography and tabletop shooting alike. Its +/-10° tilt range gives you extensive control over the focal plane, letting you capture sweeping, razor-sharp images and shots with an artistic, toy-like miniature effect with ease. You can use the +/- 12mm shift range to help compensate for converging lines, eliminate keystone distortion, and take multiple shots for panoramic stitching.

See the Microcosm in Macro Vision. If you want to capture a subject’s most minute details at close range, the 35mm has you covered. Its 9-inch minimum focusing distance and 0.5x maximum magnification mean it’s a great product-photography solution. If you’re feeling adventurous, you can combine its macro and tilt-shift functions to manipulate focus, blur, and depth of field to produce très artsy macro shots.

You’ve Gotta Look Sharp! This lens’s twelve-group/fourteen-element Zero-D optical design produces ultra-sharp, clear, and virtually distortion-free images across the entire focal length while helping to eliminate chromatic aberrations and color fringing.

Built for Real-World Shooting. The 35mm f/2.8 has an integrated Arca-Swiss compatible lens support for fast, easy mounting in your workflow, while its 77mm front filter thread allows you to use a wide array of filters without the need for unwieldy adapters. You can rotate this lens 360°, and there are click stops at 15° increments for intuitive adjustments. Finally, the front element’s water-, debris-, and moisture-resistant Frog-Eye coating keeps you working in a range of shooting conditions.', 2050000.0, '{"Angle of View": "87.5°", "Aperture Blades": "15", "Brand": "Venus Optics", "Dimensions": "4.1 × 5.9″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "77.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "35-35", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Groups/Elements": "12/14", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Nikon Z", "Lens Type": "Macro, For Mirrorless, Tilt-Shift, and Standard", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "0.5x", "Mfr. Model Number": "VE3528TS-NZ", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "9\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Tilt/Shift": "± 8.5° tilt\\n± 12mm shift", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "3.0 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

