Canon RF Mount. This version of the Venus Optics Laowa 10mm T2.9 Zero-D VV Cine is only compatible with Canon RF-mount cameras, and was designed for RF-mount cinema cameras with up to full-frame sensors. It does not work with Canon EF-mount cameras.

Lightweight, Ultra-Wide Cine Lens. The Venus Optics Laowa 10mm T2.9 Zero-D Cine’s ultra-wide 130.3° angle of view makes it great for landscape shooting, outdoor shooting, and working in interior locations where space is at a premium, while its lightweight, compact design makes it a perfect match for hand-held rigs, drones, and gimbals.

