Canon RF Mount. This version of the Venus Optics Laowa 12mm T2.9 Zero-D Cine is only compatible with Canon RF-mount cameras, and was designed for RF-mount cinema cameras with up to full-frame sensors. It does not work with Canon EF-mount cameras.

