Professional-Grade Cinema Housing. The aperture and focusing rings boast standard 0.8 mod gears so that you can easily install a follow-focus system. The extended 270° smooth focus throw gives you accurate focus pulling. This lens’s lightweight, compact design means it’s great for hand-held shooting, and that you can use it on gimbals.', 2200000.0, '{"Angle of View": "122º", "Aperture Blades": "7", "Brand": "Venus Optics", "Dimensions": "4 × 3.43″ (ø x L)", "Focal Length": "12-12", "Focus Rotation": "270º", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Front Lens Diameter": "102mm", "Gearing": "0.8 MOD focus, iris", "Groups/Elements": "10/16", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame and VistaVision", "Lens Mount": "Canon RF", "Lens Type": "Ultra Wide Angle, Cine, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.9", "Mfr. Model Number": "VE1229RFC", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "7\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "1.5 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

