Shift and Rotation Functions. The Venus Optics Laowa 15mm f/4.5 Zero-D Shift for Nikon Z has an extremely broad 110° angle of view that’s complemented by an impressive +/- 11mm shift range that helps compensate for converging lines and eliminate keystone distortion. The shift control works in combination with a 360° rotation mechanism that allows you to apply the shift in a range of directions to best suit shooting in horizontal and vertical orientations. The rotation mechanism has click stops at 15° increments for intuitive handling.

High-Quality Optics. This lens’s rectilinear optical design keeps distortion at bay, making it perfect for architectural, interior, and landscape photography. Its eleven-group/seventeen-element design includes two aspherical elements and three extra-low dispersion elements that help to eliminate chromatic aberrations and color fringing while keeping images sharp. An updated anti-reflective coating reduces flare and ghosting for greater contrast and color accuracy when you’re shooting in strong lighting conditions.

Fully Manual Lens. The 15mm f/4.5 is a fully manual lens. Its floating optical system maintains a high level of performance throughout its focal range of 7.9 inches to infinity, and its five-blade diaphragm produces distinct 10-point sun stars.

Shift Lens Support Compatible. This lens is compatible with the Venus Optics Laowa Shift Lens Support V3, which is available as a separate rental item. This lens support gives you improved mounting and makes it easier to shoot shift-type stitched panorama photos, all while retaining your image’s axis during orientation adjustments. Additionally, we carry this lens and the V3 lens support as a bundled rental here!', 1725000.0, '{"Angle of View": "110º", "Aperture Blades": "5", "Brand": "Venus Optics", "Dimensions": "3.1 × 4.1″ (ø x L)", "Filter Type": "Rear Mount", "Focal Length": "15-15", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Groups/Elements": "11/17", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Nikon Z", "Lens Type": "Ultra Wide Angle, Tilt-Shift, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "4.5", "Mfr. Model Number": "VE1545NZ", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "7.9\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Tilt/Shift": "± 11mm shift", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "1.3 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

