Advanced optical design; next to no distortion
Accurate, fully manual focusing

Fuji G Mount. This ultra-wide angle lens was designed for use on Fuji G-mount cameras, on which it gives you a 13mm-equivalent focal length.

Versatile Ultra-Wide Prime. The Venus Optics Laowa 17mm f/4 Zero-D’s ultra-wide 113° angle of view, and virtually distortion-free performance make it great for astrophotography, architectural photography, and interiors. Its 86mm filter compatibility means it excels at landscape shooting, while you can use its 7.9-inch minimum focusing distance and ultra-wide perspective to get great bokeh shots and wide-angle close-ups. The f/4 aperture makes it great for shooting with available light.

Virtually Distortion-Free. This lens’s rectilinear 14-group/21-element optical design keeps distortion at an absolute minimum. It includes two aspherical elements and three extra-low dispersion elements which help to eliminate chromatic aberrations and color fringing. The Frog Eye coating keeps the front element clear of dust and moisture, allowing you to work in inclement conditions.

Fully Manual Lens. This is a fully manual lens that provides no electronic communication with the camera. You must manually make all aperture and focus adjustments on the lens itself, and lens information is not transferred through EXIF data. A dedicated switch lets you quickly de-click the manual aperture ring for smooth, quiet rotation that’s great for video.', 1700000.0, '{"Angle of View": "104º", "Aperture Blades": "14", "Brand": "Venus Optics", "Dimensions": "3.7 × 4.4″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "86.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "17-17", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Groups/Elements": "12/18", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Medium Format", "Lens Mount": "Fuji G", "Lens Type": "Ultra Wide Angle, Tilt-Shift, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "4.0", "Maximum Magnification": "0.13x", "Mfr. Model Number": "VE1740GFX", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "9.8\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Tilt/Shift": "± 10° tilt\\n± 12mm shift", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "1.8 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Venus Optics Laowa 17mm f/4
	Front & rear caps
	86mm protective filter
	Lens bag', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2169, 2, 59, 'Venus Optics Laowa 180mm f/4.5 1.5x Ultra-Macro APO (E)', 'venus-optics-laowa-180mm-f-4-5-1-5x-ultra-macro-apo-e', 'The Venus Optics Laowa 180mm f/4.5 1.5x Ultra-Macro APO (E) is a compact medium telephoto prime lens with 1.5x macro capture capabilities for full-frame, E-mount cameras. Key features include:

1.5:1 maximum magnification ratio
Apochromatic optical design
11.8-inch minimum focusing distance
Assignable function button

Macro-Tele Prime. The revolutionary Venus Optics Laowa 180mm f/4.5 1.5x Ultra-Macro APO makes its mark as Laowa’s first ultra-macro telephoto lens, offering an incredible 5.8-inch minimum working distance and 11.8-inch minimum focusing distance to capture even the smallest of insects. Its stunning f/4.5 to f/32 aperture range can be used in a variety of lighting conditions, while its 9-blade diaphragm and 12 element/9 group optical design ensure clarified, sharp results.

Apochromatic Optical Design. Supporting capture at close-range with high magnification, this lens is equipped with an apochromatic optical design that effectively limits color fringing while maintaining clarity and detail, even at a long-range focusing distance. Its fixed focal length of 180mm and narrow field of view team up to capture anything from detailed portraits to magnificent close-ups.

Compact Design. Coming in at just 1.1 lbs and 5.3-inches long, this lens bridges portability and convenience without sacrificing impressive image capture. An assignable function button allows you to control exposure and camera functions, while the USB-C port provides firmware upgrades. Additionally, this lens features both autofocus and manual focus capabilities! Please note that autofocus is only available at distances of 4.9-feet or longer, and manual focus is required for close-up shots.', 925000.0, '{"Angle of View": "13.7°", "Aperture Blades": "9", "Brand": "Venus Optics", "Dimensions": "2.7 × 5.3″\\t(ø x L)", "Filter Size": "62.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "180-180", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Groups/Elements": "9/12", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Telephoto, Macro, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "4.5", "Maximum Magnification": "1.5x", "Mfr. Model Number": "VE18045AFFE", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "11.8\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "1.1 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

	Venus Optics Laowa 180mm f/4.5 1.5x Ultra-Macro APO (E)
	Front & rear caps
	Hood
	62mm protective filter', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
