Fuji X-mount lens
Greater-than-life-size 2:1 macro reproduction ratio
High-quality optics
Fully manual focusing with internal-focusing design

Macro Telephoto Prime. The Venus Optics Laowa 65mm f/2.8 2x Ultra Macro APO for Fuji X boasts a greater-than-life-size 2:1 macro reproduction ratio and 6.7-inch minimum focusing distance that make it great for working with up-close subjects. This lens is designed for APS-C format Fuji X-mount cameras, on which it provides a 97.5mm equivalent focal length.

High-Quality Optics. This lens’s ten-group/fourteen-element design includes three low-dispersion elements that help to eliminate chromatic aberrations and color fringing while keeping images sharp and color-accurate.

Fully Manual Lens. The 65mm f/2.8 is a fully manual lens. Its internal-focusing design means that it maintains its overall length during use, while its nine-blade aperture produces pleasing bokeh. The lens barrel includes focus-distance and depth-of-field scales for precision control.', 775000.0, '{"Angle of View": "24.4°", "Aperture Blades": "9", "Brand": "Venus Optics", "Dimensions": "2.2 × 3.9″ (ø x L)", "Filter Size": "52.0mm", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focal Length": "65-65", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Groups/Elements": "10/14", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "APS-C", "Lens Mount": "Fuji X", "Lens Type": "Telephoto, Macro, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "2.8", "Maximum Magnification": "2x", "Mfr. Model Number": "VE6528FX", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "6.69\\"", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "No", "Weight": "0.74 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

