Ultra-Fast, Clickless Aperture. The Voigtlander 29mm f/0.8 Super Nokton for Micro 4/3 features an ultra fast f/0.8 aperture that’s ideal for shooting in extremely low light and for giving you extensive depth-of-field control. For video shooters, having clickless aperture is key for smooth transitions. By simply pulling and rotating the aperture ring, you can switch between clicked and de-clicked aperture.

Precise Manual Focus. This lens has been designed with absolute precision in mind, and its refined manual-focus system epitomizes that. Its manual-focus ring gives you refined focus control and lets you work with subjects as close as 1.2 feet away. When working with low apertures found in this lens, having a weighted, accurate focus throw is ideal.

