Manual Focus. The 40mm f/2’s manual-focus design uses a scalloped focus ring to give you smooth, precise control. The lens has a 1:4 maximum magnification ratio and a 9.8-inch minimum focusing distance, while a nine-blade aperture contributes to pleasing bokeh.

High-Quality Build. The lens’s durable all-metal barrel includes depth-of-field and focus-distance scales to help with pre-focusing and hyperfocal focusing, and a built-in AI-S type CPU lets you use in-camera controls to adjust aperture settings for fast, intuitive exposure control.', 700000.0, '{"Brand": "Voigtlander", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon F", "Lens Type": "Standard"}', 'Includes

