Updated Optical Design. This second-gen model comes equipped with an impressive updated optical design, featuring a floating elements system containing two aspherical lenses and five partial dispersion lenses within 10 elements in 8 groups. The addition of these lenses allows your image quality to soar, with reduced aberrations, improved contrast, and enhanced overall image quality!

Manual Focus and Aperture. This lens’s manual-focus design gives you silent, smooth, precision control over focus placement. Its stepless, de-clicked manual aperture ring allows for optimum exposure control, and you can configure the ring to use traditional 1/3-stop clicks by simply pulling and rotating it if you want something a little more tactile. Even though this is a manually focusing lens, it transfers EXIF data to the camera so that you can use in-camera stabilization, magnification, focus assistance, and other features.', 1550000.0, '{"Brand": "Voigtlander", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Nikon Z", "Lens Type": "Standard"}', 'Includes

	Voigtlander 50mm f/2 APO-Lanthar Aspherical II for Nikon Z
	Protective Hoya EVO Antistatic 58mm	Filter
	LR Small Lens Barrel', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
INSERT INTO products (id, category_id, brand_id, name, slug, description, base_price, specifications, accessories_included, created_at, updated_at) VALUES (2309, 2, 63, 'Voigtlander 50mm f/2 APO-Lanthar Aspherical for Leica M', 'voigtlander-50mm-f-2-apo-lanthar-aspherical-for-leica-m', 'The Voigtlander 50mm f/2 APO-Lanthar Aspherical for Leica M is a high-quality aspherical wide-angle prime for Leica M-mount cameras and camcorders. Key features include:

High-quality wide-angle prime
27.6-inch minimum focusing distance
Advanced apochromatic optical design
Manual focus for precision adjustments

High-Quality Wide-Angle Prime. The Voigtlander 50mm f/2 APO-Lanthar Aspherical’s compact build and versatile focal length make it ideal for a broad range of shooting situations, particularly those in which you want your subject to stand out. The reasonably fast f/2 aperture lets you shoot in low light while offering excellent focus control when using shallow depth-of-field techniques, and the rounded twelve-blade diaphragm lets you render smooth bokeh. This lens is compatible with APS-C cameras, on which it’ll produce a 75mm focal length.

Advanced Optics. The 50mm f/2’s eight-group/ten-element optical design includes two aspherical elements and five partial-dispersion elements, which give you the exceptional sharpness you need to capture your subjects’ most minute details. The lens’s apochromatic design prevents spherical aberrations, color fringing, and distortion throughout the aperture range.

Manual Focus and Aperture. This lens’s manual-focus design gives you silent, smooth, precision control over focus placement. Its stepless, de-clicked manual aperture ring allows for optimum exposure control, and you can configure the ring to use traditional 1/3-stop clicks by simply pulling and rotating it if you want something a little more tactile.', 1500000.0, '{"Brand": "Voigtlander", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Leica M", "Lens Type": "Standard"}', 'Includes

	Voigtlander 50mm f/2 APO-Lanthar Aspherical for Leica M
	Front & rear caps
	49mm protective filter
	Lens pouch', CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
