Each lens is fitted with a Cool-Lux LuxGear lens gear on its focus ring.  These seamless, high-durometer silicone gears feature a standard 0.8-MOD/32-pitch and continuous 360º of rotation.', 4425000.0, '{"Brand": "Zeiss", "Filter Type": "Screw-On", "Focus Type": "Autofocus", "Gearing": "0.8 MOD focus, iris", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame", "Lens Mount": "Sony E", "Lens Type": "Wide Angle, Telephoto, Ultra Wide Angle, Kit, and Cine", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

