Like the rest of the line of CP.2 lenses, the CP.2 50mm has a fourteen-blade aperture ring for smooth out-of-focus highlights and tight mechanical tolerances for precision adjustments. Across the board, the low distortion and color-matched optics make it simple to incorporate any of the CP.2 lenses into your shoot without having to worry about matching issues in post.

