Rugged Matched Housings. While relatively small for large-format cinema lenses, this series dwarfs the Zeiss CP.3 line. Once you get past the size and weight, you can begin to appreciate the matched gear placement, clear markings, and rugged, cinema-quality build of the housings. They’re built to last.', 17800000.0, '{"Angle of View": "30.5°", "Aperture Blades": "16", "Brand": "Zeiss", "Dimensions": "3.7 × 4.8″ (ø x L)", "Filter Type": "Matte Box Mount", "Focal Length": "65-65", "Focus Rotation": "300°", "Focus Type": "Manual Focus Only", "Format": "Full Frame", "Front Lens Diameter": "95mm", "Gearing": "0.8 MOD focus, iris", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Format": "Full-Frame and VistaVision", "Lens Mount": "LPL", "Lens Type": "Standard, Cine, and For Mirrorless", "Maximum Aperture": "1.5", "Mfr. Model Number": "2233-299 (LPL)", "Minimum Focusing Distance": "2’", "Stabilization": "No", "Weather Sealing": "Yes", "Weight": "3.6 lb.", "Zoom Type": "Fixed Focal Length"}', 'Includes

