High-Quality Build. An all-metal lens housing gives the ZM 50mm f/1.5 Sonnar a premium feel. Its manual focus ring offers precision focus adjustment and excellent speed. The C in its name stands for “compact”—this lens is just 2.5 inches long.', 1500000.0, '{"Angle of View": "46 degrees", "Brand": "Zeiss", "Dimensions": "Length: 2.5\\"", "Groups/Elements": "4/6", "Hood Included": "No", "Item Type": "Lens", "Lens Mount": "Leica M", "Lens Type": "Standard", "Maximum Magnification": "0.066x", "Mfr. Model Number": "1407-218"}', 'Includes

